&lt;ul class=&quot;ak-ul&quot; data-local-id=&quot;fdeacbb9-b4a4-4e54-9fbe-d95110c5f465&quot; data-indent-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1715&quot; data-local-id=&quot;1700744e-a402-40b0-a842-171d6bd84f23&quot;&gt;Solid understanding of server and networking equipment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1774&quot; data-local-id=&quot;bda325b5-bb53-48e0-9c4c-705e4dab013b&quot;&gt;Practical, hands-on experience with server hardware, network switches, and fiber optic cabling.&lt;/p&gt;
