&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1873&quot; data-local-id=&quot;baa1cdec-252d-4979-85f0-6e5b462a5519&quot;&gt;Proven ability to diagnose and resolve hardware-related issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
