&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2045&quot; data-local-id=&quot;c1ac88ed-b5ed-4655-9bd8-8d2ddfb16c4a&quot;&gt;Valid Category B driving license.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2082&quot; data-local-id=&quot;3cc24c36-3719-4a90-be9b-b3d06cc5ffa1&quot;&gt;Basic knowledge of the Linux operating system and familiarity with command-line tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
