&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior DevSecOps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: London | Practice Area: Technology &amp;amp; Engineering | Type: Permanent&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build the platforms that power secure, intelligent and scalable enterprise engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Capco, we&#39;re looking for a Senior DevSecOps Engineer to help design, build and modernise enterprise software delivery capabilities for leading financial services organisations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll play a key role in developing a modern enterprise Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC) platform, with a focus on CI/CD automation, policy-as-code, security controls and cloud-native engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on engineering opportunity where you&#39;ll translate architecture into production-ready capabilities, integrate complex enterprise technologies and support engineering teams in adopting scalable, secure delivery practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also explore approved AI-enabled engineering tools and workflows to improve development productivity, automation and delivery quality, while maintaining appropriate human oversight, security controls and responsible AI practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build modern CI/CD platforms: Design, develop and implement enterprise GitLab SaaS CI/CD pipelines, reusable engineering patterns and automated workflows, leveraging approved AI-assisted engineering capabilities where appropriate to improve efficiency and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embed security and governance: Implement policy-as-code, automated security and quality gates, change controls, SAST, DAST, secrets management and vulnerability management throughout the SDLC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineer cloud-native solutions: Build and integrate services across Azure, Kubernetes and Azure API Management, supporting application, cloud and data workloads, including Snowflake and Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modernise enterprise engineering environments: Support migrations from legacy Jenkins, GitLab, SonarQube, Artifactory/Nexus and AWS environments, integrating observability capabilities using Grafana and Prometheus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable engineering teams: Translate target architecture into working production capabilities, develop reusable platform services and onboard engineering teams, promoting responsible AI-enabled workflows with appropriate review, auditability and human decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GitLab and Azure expertise: Extensive hands-on experience designing, building and operating enterprise GitLab CI/CD pipelines and Azure-based engineering solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud-native engineering: Strong practical experience with Kubernetes, DevSecOps principles, infrastructure automation and policy-as-code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Security and governance integration: Experience embedding identity, security controls, automated testing, quality gates and compliance requirements into enterprise delivery pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise modernisation: Demonstrated experience modernising complex engineering environments, integrating multiple technologies and delivering scalable, production-ready platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical leadership and delivery: Ability to take architectural designs through implementation, collaborate with engineering teams and support knowledge transfer, with an interest in applying approved AI tools and automation responsibly to improve engineering outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus Points For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating Azure API Management with cloud-native platforms and enterprise applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Snowflake, Salesforce and engineering patterns supporting data-intensive workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience migrating from Jenkins, SonarQube, Artifactory/Nexus or AWS-based engineering environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of Grafana, Prometheus and enterprise observability practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI-assisted development tools or AI-enabled DevSecOps workflows, with an understanding of responsible AI, human review and appropriate security guardrails.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver high-impact technology solutions for Tier 1 financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work in a collaborative, flat, and entrepreneurial consulting culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access continuous learning, training, and industry certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be part of a team shaping the future of digital financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the future of digital transformation across FS &amp;amp; Energy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer a competitive, people-first benefits package designed to support every aspect of your life:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Benefits: Discretionary bonus, competitive pension, health insurance, life insurance and critical illness cover.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental Health: Easy access to CareFirst, Unmind, Aviva consultations, and in-house first aiders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family-Friendly: Maternity, adoption, shared parental leave, plus paid leave for sickness, pregnancy loss, fertility treatment, menopause, and bereavement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Family Care: 8 complimentary backup care sessions for emergency childcare or elder care.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holiday Flexibility: 5 weeks of annual leave with the option to buy or sell holiday days based on your needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Learning: Your growth, your way – minimum 40 hours of training annually. Take your pick: workshops, certifications, e-learning. Plus, a Business Coach assigned from Day One to provide one-on-one guidance to support your goals and development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare Access: Convenient online GP services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extra Perks: Gympass (Wellhub), travel insurance, Tastecard, season ticket loans, Cycle to Work, and dental insurance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion at Capco&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re committed to making our recruitment process accessible and straightforward for everyone. If you need any adjustments at any stage, just let us know – we&#39;ll be happy to help.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value each person&#39;s unique perspective and contribution. At Capco, we believe that being yourself is your greatest strength. Our #BeYourselfAtWork culture encourages individuality and collaboration – a mindset that shapes how we work with clients and each other every day.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-DNI&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;At Sony Music Entertainment, we fuel the creative journey. We&#39;ve played a pioneering role in music history, from the first-ever music label to the invention of the flat disc record. We&#39;ve nurtured some of music&#39;s most iconic artists and produced some of the most influential recordings of all time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we work in more than 70 countries, supporting a diverse roster of international superstars, developing and independent artists, and visionary creators. From our position at the intersection of music, entertainment, and technology, we bring imagination and expertise to the newest products and platforms, embrace new business models, employ breakthrough tools, and provide powerful insights that help our artists push creative boundaries and reach new audiences. In everything we do, we&#39;re committed to artistic integrity, transparency, and entrepreneurship.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music Entertainment is a member of the Sony family of global companies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Music&#39;s Product Design Engineering and Global Operations (PDEGO) team is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Software Engineer, Data Operations&lt;/strong&gt; to own the reliability, observability, and operational health of our data platform&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain monitoring systems, alerting pipelines, and health dashboards that give the team real-time visibility into platform status&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take an active role in production incident response - help triage, contribute to resolution, communicate clearly to stakeholders, and document post-mortems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and build automation for repetitive operational work - access requests, backfill coordination, and pipeline health checks - to improve team throughput over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on Snowflake infrastructure through Terraform - contributing to access controls, cost monitoring, and warehouse configuration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Data Engineering on system design and code reviews with reliability and operability in mind&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write and maintain runbooks, incident response playbooks, and platform documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support analyst enablement by improving platform reliability, query performance, and data accessibility across global teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Suggest and implement improvements to team tooling, processes, and operational practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6-8+ years in software engineering with meaningful experience in SRE, platform engineering, or data infrastructure roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven record of contributing to production incident response, including stakeholder communication and post-incident analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of monitoring and observability: alerting design, SLO definition, dashboards, and root cause analysis across distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Snowflake or equivalent data warehouse at an operational level - access management, cost governance, performance tuning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure-as-code; Terraform experience strongly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong debugging skills across cloud infrastructure, data pipelines, and distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with data pipeline tooling (Fivetran, dbt, Airflow, or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AWS experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, proactive communicator - comfortable translating technical incidents to business and analyst stakeholders without jargon&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated to reduce toil through automation and scalable process - not just absorb operational load, but systematically eliminate it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in music and learning the intricacies of the music business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoMsg_Job&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we give you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You join a vibrant global community with the opportunity to channel your passion every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233279&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A modern office environment designed for you, empowering you to bring your best&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Investment in your professional growth and development enabling you to thrive in our vibrant community&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The space to accelerate progress, positively disrupt and create what happens next&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;5&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We give you the platform to champion positive change, with the opportunity to contribute to our social impact, diversity, equity and inclusion initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;Arial&quot; data-listid=&quot;6&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;•&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;6&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We provide an excellent range of benefits like private medical cover, a generous pension scheme, life assurance, income protection, plus loads of music industry perks. There’s also time off over winter break&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;iCIMS_InfoMsg iCIMS_InfoField_Job&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an active part of a culturally and socially diverse society, Sony Music’s aim is that our workforce is diverse and inclusive. Sony Music is an equal opportunity employer and supports workforce diversity.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We employ, retain, promote and otherwise treat all employees and job applicants according to their merit, qualifications, competence and talent. We apply this policy without regard to any individual’s sex, race, religion, origin, age, sexual orientation, marital status, medical condition or disability.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Please click&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://tools.sonymusiccreative.com/privacy/PCP_UK.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to read our privacy policy before beginning the application process as you will need to agree to the terms of the policy before submitting your information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note that applicants must be at least 18 years of age.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
