 experience, the postholder will design and deliver the interfaces and custom system features that connect&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW5128015 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Metrea&#39;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW5128015 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;business-critical platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW5128015 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW81914748 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW81914748 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;aaed607e-c2a3-5841-9fb4-41037bfa0faf|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;3&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;paragraph&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;The role calls for a strong technical background coupled with a solid understanding of business process, and the ability to interact effectively with personnel at all levels of the business. In an entrepreneurial and fast-paced environment, there will be a need to adapt and rapidly prioritise to changing business needs in support of the company&#39;s commercial and operational&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW81914748 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW81914748 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW81914748 BCX8&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:288}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a hands-on architecture and development role. The successful candidate will be expected to design solutions, build integrations, develop custom code and scripts, troubleshoot issues, and engage directly with business stakeholders.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
