&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Ability and willingness to undertake international travel, including regular trips to Australia, Greece, and the United States, as required.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Firmware&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Metrea, our single core value is Rooted in Humility, and our four cornerstone attributes are Entrepreneurial, Systematic, Discerning, and Over-Deliver. These form what we call our Teammate Firmware. Just like technical firmware connects software and hardware, our Firmware is the constant interface between our mission and our people. It defines how we show up, how we work together, and how we solve complex problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team Firmware creates a web-like, hyper-collaborative, dynamically hierarchical way of working that helps us adapt quickly, communicate openly, and distribute decision-making to where expertise actually lives. It enables groups to self-organize around hard problems, shift fluidly as priorities evolve, and operate with the trust, curiosity, and discipline required in a complex mission space. This foundation allows us to deliver elegant, effective solutions and uphold our purpose: protecting our precious inheritance.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Keyfactor&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Our mission is to securely connect the world: humans, machines, and AI. Keyfactor is the leader in trust infrastructure for AI and machines, helping the world&#39;s largest enterprises and government agencies take control of the cryptographic identities that safeguard every digital interaction. Behind the platform is a global team of people who care deeply about the work and each other. We move fast, think big, and show up for one another every day. If you&#39;re looking for work that matters and a team that brings out your best, we hope you&#39;ll trust your future with Keyfactor!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;24682da0-f735-43dd-9919-e0d4caa6d2f0|170&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469775450,&amp;quot;CSS Page Title&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134234082,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;CSSPageTitle&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134224900,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;40&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;240&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,335559739,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,134233279,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469777929,&amp;quot;CSS Page Title Char&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Title&amp;quot;]}&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-linked-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;24682da0-f735-43dd-9919-e0d4caa6d2f0|172&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[469775450,&amp;quot;CSS Page Title Char&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;CSSPageTitleChar&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,134231262,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134224900,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,201342446,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;4&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Calibri Light&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;40&amp;quot;,469777929,&amp;quot;CSS Page Title&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Title Char&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Title:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt; Senior Director, Professional Services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;United Kingdom (Remote)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt; Managerial&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Job Function:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Professional Services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Employment Type:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Full-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;T&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;ime&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Industry:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt; Cost of Goods Sold&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;Travel Requirements:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;25&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;CSS Page Title&quot;&gt;%&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:259}&quot;&gt;About the position&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Director of Global Professional Services, provides visionary leadership in Global Professional Services, driving strategic initiatives and overseeing transformational projects. Builds key executive relationships, ensures financial health, establishes global standards, drives innovation, and fosters a culture of high performance and continuous improvement throughout the organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide visionary leadership for the entire Global Professional Services organization, driving strategic initiatives and organizational growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute long-term strategies to enhance service delivery, customer satisfaction, and business performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a team of Directors, ensuring alignment with organizational goals and strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive large-scale transformation initiatives to improve operational efficiency and service quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships with key executive stakeholders, both internal and external.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the financial health of the Professional Services organization, ensuring sustainable growth and profitability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent the organization in top-tier customer engagements, industry conferences, and executive briefings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and enforce global standards, processes, and best practices for project delivery.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive innovation and the adoption of cutting-edge technologies to stay ahead of industry trends.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure global compliance with regulatory requirements, industry standards, and contractual obligations.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a culture of high performance, accountability, and continuous improvement across the entire organization.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications, Education, and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a relevant field such as Computer Science, Information Technology, Business Administration, or equivalent experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge in a technical, MSP, or software consulting capacity with commiserate leadership experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capability to lead organizational change, influence company-wide strategy, and drive business growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Complex reporting capabilities with Excel, or other BI software with the ability to use the data to effectively communicate and persuade an audience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Visionary leadership, advanced strategic planning, exceptional stakeholder engagement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong and effective communication skills in a consultative manner with customers and internal/external stakeholders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced, methodical, and expedient business troubleshooting and problem-solving abilities without needing escalation to other leaders.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently speaks with confidence to technical, non-technical, and executive audiences internally and externally, effectively de-escalating any situation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates advanced interpersonal communication and writing abilities with autonomy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-NA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salary will be commensurate with experience. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture, Career Opportunities and Benefits&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build teams that continually strive to get better than the day before. You will be challenged daily and given opportunities to grow personally and professionally. We balance autonomy and structure to create an entrepreneurial environment to spur creativity and new ideas. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Here are just some of the initiatives that make our culture special:  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Second Fridays (a company-wide day off on the second Friday of every month minus November and December due to the Holiday schedule). Please note that this benefit is subject to change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive benefit coverage globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Paid Parental Leave is available to new parents. Structure varies based on regional/government requirements. In regions where government-paid leave doesn’t exist, like in the U.S., the company offers generous paid parental leave, along with comprehensive adoption and fertility support.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive time off globally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated employee-focused ambassadors via Key Contributors &amp;amp; Culture Committees.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;DIVERSE Commitment, a call to action for a more inclusive and diverse future in business, society, and technology.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Keyfactor Alliance Program to support DEIB efforts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellbeing resources, wellness allowance, mindfulness app free membership, Wellness Wednesdays.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global Volunteer Day, company non-profit matching, and 3 volunteer days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly Talent development and Cross Functional meetings to support professional development.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular All Hands meetings – followed by group gatherings.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Core Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our core values are extremely important to how we run our business and what we look for in every team member:  &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Trust&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; is paramount.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We deliver security software and solutions where trust and openness are of the highest importance for our customers. We are honest and a trusted partner in every aspect of business.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; are core.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strategize, operate, and execute through a customer-centric view. We prioritize the security interests of our customers, and we act as if their data were our own.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; never stops, it only accelerates.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The speed of change is accelerating. We are committed, through investment and focus, to stay ahead of the innovation curve.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We deliver with &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;agility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We thrive in high-paced and continually changing environments. We navigate through newly added variables, adjust accordingly, while driving towards our strategic goals.  &lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;United by &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;respect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;. &lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Respect for all is what unites us. We promote diversity, inclusivity, equity, and acting with empathy and openness, both in our business and in our communities.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Teams&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; make “it” happen.&lt;/strong&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Vision and goals are not individually achievable – they require teamwork. We pride ourselves in operating as a cohesive team, creating promoters and partners, and winning as one.  &amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keyfactor is a proud equal opportunity employer including but not limited to veterans and individuals with disabilities.&lt;/strong&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;REASONABLE ACCOMMODATION: &lt;/strong&gt;Applicants with disabilities may contact a member of Keyfactor’s People team via ----- and/or telephone at 1.216.785.2990 to request and arrange for accommodations at any time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.keyfactor.com/privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;Keyfactor Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fans have opinions. Fanatics Markets lets them trade on them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics connects 100M+ fans with around 900 sports partners across Commerce, Collectibles, and Betting &amp;amp; Gaming. We’re now building Fanatics Markets, and we want it to be the biggest and best prediction market for sports, sports culture, crypto and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our core customer is a sports-first trader who is more likely to use Robinhood or Hyperliquid than a sportsbook. We’re building a suite of tools to give this customer the best possible trading experience from their phone. We have a small, high-performing team and a very flat structure to ensure the best ideas win.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a Senior Product Manager who is highly nimble and can solve a wide range of problems across the entire product stack. You’ll come in, understand the problem, define a solution, ship, iterate and move on to the next problem. Here are some example problems you might solve:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building the best perpetual futures product for a sports-first trader&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building a “pro” trading mode for our best customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building industry-first tools that help traders make better decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building new types of rewards and incentives for traders&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whatever else you come up with to drive trading volume and grow the business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2–6 years’ experience in Product Management&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A love of numbers – you think in probabilities and make data-driven decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong communication skills, both written and verbal&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience delivering amazing products to end customers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;An entrepreneurial, high-ownership mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Comfort with basic trading concepts and familiar with top platforms like Kalshi, Polymarket, Robinhood, Coinbase and Hyperliquid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You move fast&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in fintech&amp;nbsp; or building a trading product&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A STEM background or quantitative degree&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-LS2&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ranges will change based on country and state of residence, which are reflected in Geographical Zones defined by Fanatics Betting and Gaming. The range incorporates all of our Geographical Compensation Zones and is subject to change as the Zone associated with the actual offer is confirmed. In addition to the base and bonus, full-time employment, and more. For information about our benefits, please visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&quot;&gt;https://benefitsatfanatics.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£70,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£93,000 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our &lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum&#39;s mission is to build the first useful quantum computers: machines capable of delivering the breakthroughs the field has long promised. Since our founding in 2016, our singular focus has been to build and deploy million-qubit, fault-tolerant quantum systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Quantum computers harness the laws of quantum mechanics to solve problems that even the most advanced supercomputers or AI systems will never reach. Their impact will span energy, pharmaceuticals, finance, agriculture, transportation, materials, and other foundational industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our architecture&amp;nbsp;and approach&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;based on silicon photonics. By&amp;nbsp;leveraging&amp;nbsp;the advanced semiconductor manufacturing industry, including partners like GlobalFoundries, we use the same high-volume processes that already produce billions of chips for telecom and consumer electronics. Photonics offers natural advantages for scale: photons&amp;nbsp;don&#39;t&amp;nbsp;feel heat, are immune to electromagnetic interference, and integrate with existing cryogenic cooling and standard fiber-optic infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;That approach has since been tested at the highest level of scrutiny the U.S. government applies to emerging technology, and it has held up. In 2025,&amp;nbsp;PsiQuantum&amp;nbsp;closed a&amp;nbsp;$1 billion&amp;nbsp;funding round that valued the company at&amp;nbsp;$7 billion. In 2026, the U.S. Department of Commerce signed a $100 million Letter of Intent under the CHIPS and Science Act, followed by a $125 million agreement with DARPA under Stage C of its Quantum Benchmarking Initiative,&amp;nbsp;PsiQuantum&#39;s&amp;nbsp;most valuable U.S. government agreement to date. This year, we also broke ground on our utility-scale quantum computer in Brisbane, Australia, and continued building out our Chicago site. Victor Peng, our CEO, and co-founder Jeremy O&#39;Brien, now Executive&amp;nbsp;Chairman, lead a team and board that reflects how seriously the world is taking this build, joined this year by Intel&#39;s Lip-Bu Tan and Atomico&#39;s Niklas&amp;nbsp;Zennström.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum&amp;nbsp;also develops the algorithms and software needed to make these systems commercially valuable. Our application, software, and industry teams work directly with leading Fortune 500 companies, including&amp;nbsp;Airbus,&amp;nbsp;Lockheed&amp;nbsp;Martin, Mercedes-Benz, Boehringer Ingelheim, and Mitsubishi Chemical, to prepare quantum solutions for real-world impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Quantum computing is not an extension of classical computing. It&amp;nbsp;represents&amp;nbsp;a fundamental shift, and a path to mastering challenges that cannot be&amp;nbsp;solved&amp;nbsp;any other way. The potential is enormous, and we now have&amp;nbsp;the funding,&amp;nbsp;the government&amp;nbsp;validation, and&amp;nbsp;the sites&amp;nbsp;under construction to make it real.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;PsiQuantum is seeking a Senior Quantum Algorithms Researcher to join the Quantum Algorithms team within our Applications Development department. This role offers the opportunity to help define how large-scale, fault-tolerant quantum computers will be applied to consequential real-world problems in chemistry, pharmaceuticals, and materials science.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;449&quot;&gt;At PsiQuantum, we believe in the transformative potential of quantum computing to solve problems beyond the reach of classical computation. For the first quantum computers to be useful, we believe they must be fault tolerant.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;677&quot;&gt;This conviction shapes our approach to applications research. Rather than developing algorithms for near-term or intermediate-scale devices, we focus on quantum algorithms designed for the fault-tolerant regime, where, specifically, the cost of a quantum algorithm is determined by its runtime on a fusion-based, fault-tolerant quantum computer built on silicon photonic hardware.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1060&quot;&gt;In the Quantum Algorithms team, we adapt and develop quantum algorithms, scope and identify promising use cases, and analyze resource requirements. In your role, you will translate computational tasks into abstract specifications for quantum algorithms, analyze their asymptotic performance, and help define meaningful problem instances that lie beyond the practical reach of classical computation. You will also work closely with PsiQuantum’s Compilation team to develop explicit instantiations of these algorithms and understand their resource requirements on our architecture.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1642&quot;&gt;We are particularly interested in candidates with deep expertise in quantum simulation. Relevant areas may include simulated time-evolution algorithms, quantum algorithms for estimating the energies of molecular or periodic systems, and methods for preparing candidate ground states of model Hamiltonians. More broadly, the successful candidate will bring substantial expertise in a specific subfield of quantum algorithms, together with the ability to connect fundamental algorithmic research to computationally and industrially relevant problems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2193&quot;&gt;In this position, you will be expected not only to conduct outstanding individual research but also to formulate and lead broader research programs that encompass the work of other researchers and collaborators. You will contribute to cross-team initiatives across PsiQuantum’s applications, architecture, and compilation efforts, helping to connect algorithm design with the practical requirements of fault-tolerant quantum computation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;2633&quot;&gt;The role may also include external engagements. You will have the opportunity to lead projects with industrial and research partners, working with domain experts to identify important computational challenges, extract well-defined problem formulations, and map those problems to appropriate quantum algorithms. This requires the ability to communicate across disciplinary boundaries and to move fluently between real-world applications, mathematical abstractions, algorithmic complexity, and implementation-level resource analysis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3167&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate combines deep technical expertise with scientific leadership, intellectual independence, and a strong collaborative mindset. They will be comfortable shaping open-ended research directions, evaluating the practical significance of algorithmic advances, and guiding projects from the initial identification of an application through to a concrete fault-tolerant quantum algorithm and resource estimate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Propose initiatives into research and development of quantum algorithms tailored for fault-tolerant quantum computers; act as primary contributor to research programs beyond the current state of the art in quantum algorithms design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Work closely with external partners to instantiate, validate and optimize quantum algorithms for use cases across a variety of domains, such as life sciences, industry and sustainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Establish families of benchmarks and problem instances to validate post-classicality of quantum algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Guide both the simulation and analysis of resource requirements for fault tolerant implementation of quantum algorithms in photonic quantum computing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience/Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;8+ years of research experience (academia or industry) in the field of quantum computing, with focus on algorithms and applications.  &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;A degree in Physics, Math or Computer Science or equivalent is required. PhD in Physics, Math or Computer Science, with a focus on quantum information theory or quantum computation will be preferred. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience with quantum algorithms and compiling in the regime of fault tolerant gates preferred .&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience working with partners in academia or industry to analyze real-world quantum applications of interest preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Proven team player with an ability to work effectively across departments, sites and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently and contribute to fast-moving start-up environment. &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience programming in Python, C++ or similar languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;PsiQuantum provides equal employment opportunity for all applicants and employees. PsiQuantum does not unlawfully discriminate on the basis of race, color, religion, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), gender identity, gender expression, national origin, ancestry, citizenship, age, physical or mental disability, military or veteran status, marital status, domestic partner status, sexual orientation, genetic information, or any other basis protected by applicable laws.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Note: PsiQuantum will only reach out to you using an official PsiQuantum email address and will never ask you for bank account information as part of the interview process. Please report any suspicious activity to &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; ----- target=&quot;_blank&quot; ----- ----- data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are not accepting unsolicited resumes from employment agencies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;The ranges below reflect the target ranges for a new hire base salary.&amp;nbsp;Actual compensation may vary outside of these ranges and is dependent on various factors including but not limited to a candidate&#39;s qualifications including relevant education and training, competencies, experience, geographic location, and business needs. Base pay is only one part of the total compensation package. Full time roles are eligible for equity and benefits. Base pay is subject to change and may be modified in the future.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Daresbury, United Kingdom &lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;£78,900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;£92,900 GBP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Level Up Your Career with Zynga!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Zynga, we bring people together through the power of play. As a global leader in interactive entertainment and a proud label of Take-Two Interactive, our games have been downloaded over 6 billion times—connecting players in 175+ countries through fun, strategy, and a little friendly competition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;From thrilling casino spins to epic strategy battles, mind-bending puzzles, and social word challenges, our diverse game portfolio has something for everyone. Fan-favorites and latest hits include FarmVille™, Words With Friends™, Zynga Poker™, Game of Thrones Slots Casino™, Wizard of Oz Slots™, Hit it Rich! Slots™, Wonka Slots™, Top Eleven™, Toon Blast™, Empires &amp;amp; Puzzles™, Merge Dragons!™, CSR Racing™, Harry Potter: Puzzles &amp;amp; Spells™, Match Factory™, and Color Block Jam™—plus many more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2007 and headquartered in California, our teams span North America, Europe, and Asia, working together to craft unforgettable gaming experiences. Whether you&#39;re spinning, strategizing, matching, or competing, Zynga is where fun meets innovation—and where you can take your career to the next level.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join us and be part of the play!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define and elevate the artistic vision.&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the visual direction of new and existing casual mobile games, exploring distinctive and engaging art styles that support gameplay, strengthen the player experience and bring both new and established IP to life.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through hands-on creativity.&lt;/strong&gt; Create high-quality concepts, mock-ups and game-ready assets across 2D, 3D and AI-assisted workflows. Set the benchmark for artistic excellence through your own work, from early exploration to final in-game implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion AI-driven creative workflows.&lt;/strong&gt; Explore and integrate AI-assisted tools into the art production process, combining technical expertise with strong artistic judgment. Develop efficient, repeatable workflows that accelerate iteration while maintaining creative quality and visual consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prototype, iterate and innovate.&lt;/strong&gt; Rapidly develop and test visual concepts, using player insights, feedback and performance data to refine the artistic direction. Embrace experimentation and adapt quickly to identify the strongest creative opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide artistic leadership and mentorship.&lt;/strong&gt; Act as a creative reference for artists across game art, VFX, UI and animation. Share expertise, provide constructive feedback and help raise the overall quality of the team&#39;s work through collaboration and mentorship, without the need for direct people management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across disciplines.&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with game designers, developers, producers and marketing teams to ensure artistic decisions align with gameplay objectives, technical requirements and the overall player experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive quality and consistency.&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and maintain high visual standards throughout development, ensuring that art assets, styles and creative solutions deliver a cohesive, polished and engaging experience for players.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills to create thrills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience as a Lead or Principal Artist in the gaming industry, with a strong portfolio demonstrating artistic excellence and creative ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI-assisted art creation and a passion for exploring emerging creative technologies, combining technical expertise with 2D and 3D mastery to deliver compelling visual styles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional artistic skills and hands-on expertise across both 2D and 3D art production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong art direction capabilities, with the ability to define, develop and execute compelling visual styles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience with AI-assisted art creation and a passion for exploring emerging creative technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An excellent understanding of casual mobile game aesthetics, visual trends and player expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to rapidly prototype, iterate and adapt creative work in a fast-paced development environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of game art pipelines, technical constraints and in-game asset implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A player-focused mindset, with the ability to connect artistic decisions to gameplay and engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence creative direction, mentor fellow artists and elevate artistic quality without formal management responsibilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to work effectively across multiple disciplines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in small, agile teams, new game development or rapid prototyping environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience implementing art assets directly in Unity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in world building, animation, VFX or video production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing new IP or adapting established IP for new game experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building or optimizing AI-assisted art production pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience contributing to the visual direction of successful casual mobile games.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal opportunity employer, which means we are committed to creating and celebrating diverse thoughts, cultures, and backgrounds throughout our organization.&amp;nbsp; Employment with us is based on substantive ability, objective qualifications, and work ethic – not an individual’s race, creed, color, religion, sex or gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin or ancestry, alienage or citizenship status, physical or mental disability, pregnancy, age, genetic information, veteran status, marital status, status as a victim of domestic violence or sex offenses, reproductive health decision, or any other characteristics protected by applicable law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an equal opportunity employer, we are committed to providing the necessary support and accommodation to qualified individuals with disabilities, health conditions, or impairments (subject to any local qualifying requirements) to ensure their full participation in the job application or interview process. Please contact us at ----- to request any accommodations or for support related to your application for an open position.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware that Zynga does not conduct job interviews or make job offers over third-party messaging apps such as Telegram, WhatsApp, or others.&amp;nbsp; Zynga also does not engage in any financial exchanges during the recruitment or onboarding process, and will never ask a candidate for their personal or financial information over an app or other unofficial chat channel.&amp;nbsp; Any attempt to do so may be the result of a scamp or phishing attack, and you should not engage.&amp;nbsp; Zynga’s&amp;nbsp; in-house recruitment team will only contact individuals through their official Company email addresses (i.e., via a zynga.com, take2games.com, naturalmotion.com, smallgiantgames.com, themavens.com, gram.gs email domain).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Wheely&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wheely is redefining premium transportation across major cities in Europe, the US, and the Middle East. We blend cutting-edge technology with the craft of five-star chauffeuring to deliver an experience trusted by more than 100,000 active riders and 1,200 corporate accounts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a profitable, fast-growing scale-up with $43M raised and over $100M in annual revenue. Having recently launched in New York City, we’re expanding rapidly across the US and EMEA. If you take pride in your craft and want to help shape the next chapter of our growth, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Staff Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Platform team that creates the foundation that allows our entire engineering organisation to move fast. This means building shared tooling, managing migrations (including our move from a Ruby monolith), and evolving our infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior leadership role for a deeply technical leader who combines strong backend and infrastructure expertise with the ability to build and scale high-performing teams. You will be responsible for the architecture, reliability, and performance of all backend systems powering Wheely’s platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work closely with product, data, and infrastructure leaders to ensure our systems are fast, resilient, and scalable — enabling us to deliver the most reliable and premium ride-hailing experience in the world.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technical vision, architecture, and standards across backend systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure system reliability, scalability, and performance at global consumer scale&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make high-quality architectural decisions across distributed systems, APIs, and data infrastructure&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve system performance, latency, and fault tolerance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, accountability, and engineering excellence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support domain-based team structures (e.g. pricing, matching, supply engagement)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of experience in software engineering, with strong backend expertise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of designing and operating large-scale distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of backend architecture, infrastructure, and platform concerns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High technical judgment and attention to detail&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in consumer-scale products or marketplaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in performance-critical systems (low latency, high availability)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We Offer&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Office-based role in West London, four days a week with flexible start and finish times, plus one remote day of your choice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary starting from £160,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee stock options plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical and dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Life and critical illness cover&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Latest-generation MacBook Pro and 4k display&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly credit towards Wheely journeys&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cycle to Work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional development stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support, including visa sponsorship and allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;All of your personal information will be collected stored and processed in accordance with&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://wheely.com/en/legal/uk/for-candidates/privacy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Wheely’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Hudl, we build great teams. We hire the best of the best to ensure you’re working with people you can constantly learn from. You’re trusted to get your work done your way while testing the limits of what’s possible and what’s next. We work hard to provide a culture where everyone feels supported, and our employees feel it—their votes helped us become one of the &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/blog/hudl-2026-top-100-inspiring-workplaces?utm_medium=internal&amp;amp;utm_source=job-ad&amp;amp;utm_campaign=26_NA_talent_job-ad&amp;amp;utm_content=1org_learn-more_blog-link_learn-more_2blog_organic_3ctw&quot;&gt;Top 100 Inspiring Workplaces&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We think of ourselves as the team behind the team, supporting the lifelong impact sports can have: the lessons in teamwork and dedication; the influence of inspiring coaches; and the opportunities to reach new heights. That’s why we help teams from all over the world see their game differently. Our products make it easier for coaches and athletes at any level to capture video, analyze data, share highlights and more.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ready to join us?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 56.25% 0 0 0; position: relative;&quot;&gt;&lt;iframe style=&quot;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: 0;&quot; src=&quot;https://player.vimeo.com/video/1095624224?h=9e8cdc9dbe&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479&quot; width=&quot;&quot; height=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring an Engineering Manager to join our Applied Machine Learning team to lead our squads across American football and ice hockey. You’ll drive game-changing initiatives using computer vision and deep learning at scale to automatically generate game data, event detection and player tracking - delivering critical, real-time insights directly to coaches during games as well as powering post-game analysis products. Our systems process thousands of games in parallel during peak hours, using models grounded in recent research.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Engineering Manager, you’ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver for customers and manage teams.&lt;/strong&gt; Directly manage members across two established squads, helping them meet quarterly commitments, resolve unknowns and engage stakeholders to prioritise high-impact deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical and modeling excellence.&lt;/strong&gt; Set high standards across both engineering and data science, balancing model precision with execution speed and cost-effectiveness in cloud infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve complex real-world challenges.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead your team to maintain model accuracy across diverse, real-world camera footage and environmental conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally.&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with product stakeholders, cross-functional partners and leaders to align roadmap priorities and resolve dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cultivate an empowered environment.&lt;/strong&gt; Foster a high-performing, supportive environment that enables your squads to operate at their highest potential and grow professionally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Time spent collaborating with your teammates in-office will be a regular part of how you work. We’re currently considering applicants within commuting distance of London. You’ll be expected to work more days in-office than remote, but will have the freedom to coordinate your specific in-office schedule with your team. We&#39;re also open to remote candidates in the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Must-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A proven leader.&lt;/strong&gt; You have experience managing teams of individual contributors, including engineers and data scientists, and you love helping teammates grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production AI/ML and computer vision experience. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ve built and deployed machine learning systems and computer vision models at scale in production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Balanced between engineering and modeling&lt;/strong&gt;. You can push data science modeling forward while building scalable software, keeping a sharp eye on system efficiency, speed and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A strong communicator. &lt;/strong&gt;You easily break down complex technical trade-offs for anyone across the company and naturally build strong relationships with cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sports tech background. &lt;/strong&gt;You have experience applying AI, machine learning or computer vision to sports performance or analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real-time systems experience.&lt;/strong&gt; You’ve built or fine-tuned real-time data processing pipelines or high-volume parallel cloud workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Role&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion work-life harmony&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ll give you the flexibility you need in your work life (e.g., flexible vacation time above any required statutory leave, company-wide holidays and timeout (meeting-free) days, remote work options and more) so you can enjoy your personal life too.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guarantee autonomy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We have an open, honest culture and we trust our people from day one. Your team will support you, but you&#39;ll own your work and have the agency to try new ideas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Encourage career growth. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We&#39;re lifelong learners who encourage professional development. We&#39;ll give you tons of resources and opportunities to keep growing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Provide an environment to help you succeed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;. We&#39;ve invested in our offices, designing incredible spaces with our employees in mind. But whether you&#39;re at the office or working remotely, we&#39;ll provide you the tech you need to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support your wellbeing. &lt;/strong&gt;Depending on location, we offer medical and retirement benefits for employees—but no matter where you&#39;re located, we have resources like our Employee Assistance Program and employee resource groups to support your mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Compensation&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hudl.com/jobs/hudl-applicant-and-candidate-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Hudl Applicant and Candidate Privacy Policy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office requirement&lt;/strong&gt;: Hybrid, 1 day a week&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type&lt;/strong&gt;: Fixed-term contract – 9 months (Caregiver Leave Cover)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI we’re always looking for &lt;strong&gt;extraordinary people&lt;/strong&gt; who thrive on making an extraordinary impact. Right now we’re looking for a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Senior Research Analyst &lt;/strong&gt;to play a key role in our &lt;strong&gt;Research Services – Agency team in London, on a 9-month fixed-term contract covering parental leave. &lt;/strong&gt;If that’s you, and making a difference gets you out of bed in the morning, keep reading. It could be the start of something, well, extraordinary.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As our Senior Research Analyst, you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our &lt;strong&gt;Senior Research Analyst &lt;/strong&gt;you’ll&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;lead in the management of projects during all stages of the research process (client kick off, survey design to reporting), working across a range of research approaches. Our Senior Analysts are the face of our research, and working directly with research partners and clients is integral to the role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be doing that for the agency world. Our clients are global agency networks and independent agencies, and no two projects look the same: at one end, large and complex multi-market trackers; at the other, fast-turnaround one-off studies. The subject matter moves around just as much, so you’ll be getting up to speed on unfamiliar categories quickly and switching between them at pace. Variety is the spice of life, and this role has plenty of it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It’s also fun; shaking things up is what working for a growing company is all about. So you’ll need to be flexible, comfortable with continuous change, and working in a high-tempo environment as we grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do I need to bring with me?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;💼&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll need to be able to demonstrate the core skills this role requires. You don&#39;t have to tick &lt;em&gt;all&lt;/em&gt; the boxes right away; the important thing is that you’re willing to learn. Here’s what the team will be looking for:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;2+ years experience in a market research role, including a significant amount of time with a research agency or media / advertising agency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert at producing insight driven client deliverables, narrative based reporting with experience bringing data to life through storytelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to present succinctly and accurately, ensuring that points are understood as well as outlining questions/points to be addressed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident in working with large, and sometimes complex, datasets,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial acumen is essential, both understanding of client businesses and putting deliverables into a commercial context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of how advertising and media agencies use consumer insights to shape strategy, planning and creative&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Broad curiosity and the ability to switch subjects fast – one project might be drinks, the next automotive, the next something you’ve never looked at before&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional attention to detail. Our clients make big decisions on the back of our data, so accuracy is non-negotiable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You get stuck in, take ownership, and give clients an excellent experience from kick off to delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Equally important is attitude. We want people who &lt;strong&gt;think big&lt;/strong&gt; (to make an impact), &lt;strong&gt;ask why&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;(to find a better way), and &lt;strong&gt;show respect&lt;/strong&gt; (to everyone, at every level, all the time). Those are our values, exemplified by our leadership team, and they’re a big part of what we’re looking for in you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What We Offer 📝&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI, you’ll find meaningful work, visible impact, and a culture that empowers you to do your best. Our package includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time to recharge – 25 days’ annual leave, plus office closures over the holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellbeing – Health cash plan, enhanced family benefits, carer days, and mental health support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial benefits – Competitive salary, 4% pension matching, and recognition programs that celebrate success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; balance – Flexitime, early Friday finishes, hybrid and remote options, plus a “work from home” budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth – Accredited learning, leadership development, and global career mobility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Community &amp;amp; impact – DE&amp;amp;I initiatives, volunteering opportunities, donation matching, and payroll giving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Put all that together and GWI is the friendliest, most fulfilling place any of us has ever worked.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interview steps 👟&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preliminary phone call&lt;/strong&gt; with the Talent Team&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;(no video required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First video interview&lt;/strong&gt; with the hiring managers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Second (and final*) video interview&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;with the hiring panel, often including a presentation, followed by a&lt;strong&gt; values conversation &lt;/strong&gt;with members of the wider GWI community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*Don’t be alarmed if there are other stages in the process; it’s all part of the plan for some of our roles.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What exactly is GWI? 👀&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GWI is modernized consumer research; global, on-demand, and accessible to everyone, not just data experts. Our platform is designed for companies looking for fresh and insightful data about their consumers’ values, purchase journeys, media usage, and social media habits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With data representing the views of nearly 3 billion people across 50+ countries, GWI has become the go-to for agencies, brands, and media companies that want to know what really drives their audience to action.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Since launching in 2009 we’ve grown at a healthy pace, and to maintain this growth we need more extraordinary people. Hence this ad. Hence you.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Diversity, Equity &amp;amp; Inclusion 🌍&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity is fundamental to who we are—as a data company and as a workplace. Our data reflects global realities, and so must our teams. We strive to build a workforce as diverse and inclusive as the insights we deliver.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Disability Confident employer, we welcome applications from disabled candidates and are committed to making adjustments throughout the hiring process—whether that&#39;s extra time, materials in advance or a different format, breaks, an adjusted interview format, assistive tools, or flexible scheduling. We&#39;re happy to discuss whatever would work best for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We actively encourage applications from underrepresented and marginalised communities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI, you&#39;ll find a place to contribute meaningfully, grow professionally, and belong fully.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/2g0akAyAlUU?si=dIgYyrKaAlNZK-NQ&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#li-hybrid&lt;br&gt;#LI-&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior People Business Partner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;: London&amp;nbsp;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office requirement&lt;/strong&gt;: Minimum 2 days in the office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employment type&lt;/strong&gt;: Permanent&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As our Senior People Business Partner you’ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Report to the VP, People and Culture, and partner closely with our Chief Revenue Officer, Chief Marketing Officer and their senior leaders to own the talent agenda for our Go-To-Market (GTM) teams, translating the business and People &amp;amp; Culture (P&amp;amp;C) strategy into an impactful plan that drives business growth, high performance, engagement and inclusion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;br&gt;You’ll:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of Revenue and Marketing, collaborating with your business leaders to translate commercial strategy (growth targets, territory changes, GTM shifts) into people plans that deliver growth, efficiency, engagement and inclusion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use internal and external data insights to proactively identify strategic and operational opportunities and address challenges, connecting the dots and influencing key business and talent decisions relating to org design and talent management (including performance, reward, recognition and growth).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide consultation and coaching for leaders and managers on performance, talent development and employee relations, aligning to the GWI approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support compensation design specific to sales roles (OTE structures, commission plans, territory/quota-linked incentives) in partnership with Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion culture and engagement initiatives adapted to the realities of a target-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive performance management tailored to sales, quota attainment, ramp time, pipeline metrics, alongside broader frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Talent Acquisition and Learning and Development on sales hiring plans, talent mobility and skill development, ensuring quality of hire and speed-to-productivity to drive a skills first approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cyclical processes for your business area including performance, compensation, headcount planning and budgeting, in partnership with Finance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What do I need to bring with me?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven senior people business partnering experience, with direct exposure to Sales, Revenue, or another quota-carrying commercial functions, in a progressive Tech global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity and pace, commercial teams move fast, and priorities shift with the pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong employee relations and UK employment law knowledge, with a practical, pragmatic approach to policy application.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercial fluency - understands how value is created, for our customers and for our business, and uses that knowledge to drive smarter decisions, stronger performance, and sustainable growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data judgement - able to critically evaluate, interpret, and apply data to make sound, informed decisions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI fluency - collaborates with AI effectively, ethically, and safely, using it as a thinking partner to solve problems. Stays curious about its evolving capabilities and limits, without losing sight of human judgement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive problem-solver - identifies challenges, understands their root causes and develops practical, effective solutions. Thinks critically using data and insights to guide decisions and approaches problems with curiosity and creativity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emotionally intelligent - understands own emotions and impact, reads the room accurately, and uses this insight to communicate clearly, handle challenge well, and build strong, psychologically safe working relationships, especially when things are difficult, fast-moving, or high-stakes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good management skills with an ability to role model high standards at a team, department and company level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset - sees challenges, obstacles and failures as opportunities to develop themselves further. Able to push self forward and go above and beyond what is expected.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What We Offer 🧘&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GWI, you’ll find meaningful work, visible impact, and a culture that empowers you to do your best. Our package includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time to recharge – 25 days’ annual leave, plus office closures over the holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health &amp;amp; wellbeing – Health cash plan, enhanced family benefits, carer days, and mental health support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial benefits – Competitive salary, 4% pension matching, and recognition programs that celebrate success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; balance – Flexitime, early Friday finishes, hybrid and remote options, plus a “work from home” budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth – Accredited learning, leadership development, and global career mobility.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Community &amp;amp; impact – DE&amp;amp;I initiatives, volunteering opportunities, donation matching, and payroll giving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Put all that together and GWI is the friendliest, most fulfilling place any of us has ever worked.&lt;/p&gt;
