&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.5;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &#39;trebuchet ms&#39;, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;ALAIKA is an equal-opportunity employer. We hire on merit and welcome applications from people of all genders, backgrounds, ages, and identities.&amp;nbsp;Our team spirit celebrates diversity. We want you to be your true “you” and offer everyone an open culture and safe space&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Advise. Invest. Build. Meet ALAIKA —&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;a new kind of Financial Services firm — globally scaling,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;headquartered&amp;nbsp;in&amp;nbsp;Munich.&amp;nbsp;The work&amp;nbsp;is hard. The bar is high.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Partner&amp;nbsp;in 3-4&amp;nbsp;years possible&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;, for the ones who can keep up and actually build a&amp;nbsp;business themselves&amp;nbsp;on our platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:300}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
