&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Merchant EMEA Engineering builds the technology that helps merchants join, grow, and operate successfully across our markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our organization brings together the strengths of Wolt and Deliveroo and supports merchants across 37 countries. We work across the merchant journey, including onboarding, business growth and support, analytics and recommendations, menu and order management, integrations, and merchant applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams sit close to the business. Rather than primarily building foundational platforms, we build products and features on top of our existing platforms to solve real merchant and market needs, including local business requirements, growth opportunities, and operational challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📍This open role is based in our tech hubs in &lt;strong&gt;Helsinki&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Please note:&lt;/strong&gt; This role requires being based in Berlin/Helsinki on a hybrid basis. We are currently unable to offer fully remote work, visa sponsorship, or relocation support for this opportunity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Fullstack Engineer, you&#39;ll contribute to products and services used across the merchant experience.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain production software across backend services and user-facing applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work on areas such as merchant onboarding, analytics, recommendations, menu and order management, integrations, or merchant-facing tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reliable APIs, data models, services, and user-facing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with product managers, designers, operations, and other engineers to turn business needs into practical technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own features from implementation through production and ongoing maintenance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to technical design discussions and improve the quality, scalability, observability, and maintainability of our systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted development tools effectively as part of your engineering workflow, while critically evaluating their output and taking ownership of the final solution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be willing to work outside your primary area of expertise when needed to solve the problem end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How We Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineers take responsibility for the features and services they work on, from development to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; We work closely across engineering, product, design, data, and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pragmatism:&lt;/strong&gt; We value simple and maintainable solutions that create business impact without unnecessary complexity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility:&lt;/strong&gt; We care more about solving the problem than strict frontend or backend boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our backend services primarily use &lt;strong&gt;Go and Kotlin&lt;/strong&gt;, while our frontend applications use technologies such as &lt;strong&gt;TypeScript and React&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also work with technologies including Kafka, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, AWS, Kubernetes, Docker, gRPC, and modern cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Humble Expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for engineers who have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An AI-first mindset, with a deep experience in leveraging modern AI tools and solid engineering principles to solve problems end-to-end, independently of any specific technology stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building production software in backend, frontend, or fullstack environments end-to-end and at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in at least one area of the stack, with a willingness to contribute outside that area when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with a modern backend language such as Go, Kotlin, Java, or similar, and/or modern frontend technologies such as TypeScript and React.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of APIs, databases, testing, and software design fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work independently on well-scoped problems and collaborate effectively with others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good communication skills and a pragmatic, collaborative mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do &lt;strong&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt; need to be equally strong in frontend and backend. We welcome different balances of experience. You might be primarily a backend engineer who is comfortable making frontend changes when needed, or a frontend-focused engineer who is happy to work with APIs and backend services.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;What matters most is that you are comfortable working across boundaries to deliver the right solution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in one or more of the following areas would be a plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Merchant-facing or internal operational tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analytics, recommendations, or decisioning systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Grocery, retail, restaurants, logistics, or marketplace technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrations with external business systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kafka or other streaming technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud infrastructure such as AWS, Kubernetes, or Docker.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll work on products that directly affect how merchants interact with Wolt Deliveroo and DoorDash across Europe.&amp;nbsp;The scope is broad and close to the business, giving you the opportunity to work on meaningful problems across different parts of the merchant journey while developing your skills across the stack.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about our recruitment process here.&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.wolt.com/en/how-we-hire&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc?si=FzuwoSOLcv5WZVRN&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Risk &amp;amp; Fraud Prevention Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Berlin, Germany · Office-first · Permanent, full-time&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Global Fraud Prevention protects SumUp&#39;s banking products, from issued cards to cash in and cash out flows, keeping millions of merchants and consumers safe from financial crime. This role plays a key part in building stronger fraud observability and smarter decisioning for fast growing card issuing and banking volumes across the globe. Complex fraud data gets turned into practical controls here, working closely with fraud operations, data science, product, and engineering teams, as well as card payment networks, to stay ahead of evolving fraud patterns and comply with regulatory requirements in 38 active Sumup markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain fraud observability dashboards covering issued card, cash in, and cash out flows across merchant and consumer banking products&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Configure and refine decision engine rules to catch fraud early without adding unnecessary friction for genuine customers&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Investigate fraud anomalies and turn findings into clear, actionable recommendations for fraud operations and engineering teams&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with data science and engineering teams to improve risk logic and explore new data sources and automation opportunities&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate PSD2, the upcoming PSD3, card scheme and other regulatory requirements into practical, workable controls&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share regular fraud performance updates with stakeholders across risk, compliance, and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced SQL skills for querying and manipulating large datasets&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience configuring fraud decision engines or systems based on rules&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grounding in applied statistics and modelling, including A/B testing, classification, and regression&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive in shaping structure and processes within a fast changing, ambiguous environment&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of EU banking fraud schemes, card network rules, and PSD2&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, spoken and written&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🍽Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 39 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt; our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 4,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt; Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt; TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;The Engagement tribe sits at the heart of SumUp&#39;s merchant experience, responsible for the product surfaces that 4.3 million business owners interact with every day, from the information they see about their business to the actions they take to grow it. As our Senior Product Manager, you&#39;ll own the merchant facing SuperApp end to end, a rare individual contributor role spanning product strategy, UX quality, and squad delivery, on the single surface the wider product organisation depends on to build and ship effectively. If you&#39;re looking for a role where your product decisions have a direct impact on how millions of businesses run and scale every day, this is it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Own the end to end product experience of our SuperApp across iOS, Android and web dashboard, raising the bar on UX quality, information architecture, and navigation for the surfaces merchants rely on most&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Spot and execute activation, upsell, cross sell, and retention opportunities that measurably grow engagement and long term value for merchants&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Shape the product strategy that makes the SuperApp an essential, everyday tool for small business owners running their business globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Act as the main point of contact for stakeholders across the business who depend on the SuperApp to reach merchants, partnering closely with design and data on priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Build strong working relationships across engineering, design, and commercial teams, turning direct merchant insight into a clear, prioritised roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You&#39;ll be great for this role if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;ul1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Track record leading a product squad end to end, from strategy through to shipped outcomes in engagement, retention, or monetisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Strong technical or analytical foundation, whether from an engineering background or hands on experience as a data or business analyst, with the ability to think in systems and structure ambiguous problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Comfort working fluently with both qualitative and quantitative data to inform decisions, rather than relying on others to surface the answer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Strong visual and UX judgement, with experience partnering closely with design and giving clear, constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Ability to build a well reasoned product strategy independently, without needing a dedicated research or strategy function to get there&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li2&quot;&gt;Experience advocating for merchants, with a track record of translating their everyday problems into practical product decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setu&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🚀 Enrolment onto our Virtual Stock Option programme: you will own a stake in SumUp&#39;s future success&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education 💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;🏙 Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 37 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 3,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset. &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a class=&quot;text-primary underline cursor-pointer&quot; href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Run &amp;amp; Grow:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Run &amp;amp; Grow is where SumUp builds the platforms and capabilities that help merchants discover, join, use, and continue growing with our products. The tribe brings together engineering, product, design, and revenue operations teams around two connected goals: helping SumUp serve and retain merchants, and accelerating acquisition, activation, and engagement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our work sits at the heart of SumUp’s growth engine. We turn complex challenges across merchant acquisition, identity, marketing technology, commercial systems, operations, risk, and compliance into reliable products and services that other teams can build on. The systems we create help SumUp move faster, make better decisions, and deliver a simpler experience to millions of small businesses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Joining Run &amp;amp; Grow means working on high-impact engineering problems with a broad view of the business. You’ll collaborate across disciplines and teams, shape the foundations behind important merchant journeys, and help create a more connected, scalable way for SumUp to run and grow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and operate production-grade backend services, APIs, and integrations, primarily using Go.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build event-driven workflows and distributed systems using technologies such as Kafka and asynchronous processing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define clear service boundaries, data models, schemas, and API contracts that other teams can use confidently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build capabilities supporting merchant acquisition, identity, marketing technology, operations, risk, and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical work end to end, from discovery and system design through implementation, testing, deployment, and production follow-up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Modernise existing services and improve reliability through observability, security, failure handling, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Product, Data, Operations, Compliance, Risk, Sales, Marketing, and other engineering teams to turn complex requirements into practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review code and designs, make pragmatic technical trade-offs, share knowledge, and mentor engineers around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
