&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About&amp;nbsp;CoreView &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;CoreView is the global leader in Microsoft 365 (M365) tenant resilience, serving over 23 million users worldwide. We empower the world’s leading organizations to master the complexity of Microsoft M365.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Through robust security and precise governance, we help ensure that our client’s environments stay cyber-resilient and productive, no matter how complex they are.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our unified, cloud-native platform delivers powerful automation, rapid value, and end-to-end visibility across the entire M365 ecosystem. Backed by world-class support and a collaborative, innovative culture,&amp;nbsp;CoreView&amp;nbsp;is a place where your ideas matter, and your work truly&amp;nbsp;impacts&amp;nbsp;global enterprises.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-testid=&quot;description-overview-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-content-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CoreView is seeking a&amp;nbsp;Director, Channel Sales – EMEA&amp;nbsp;to lead and scale its regional channel strategy across Europe, working closely with the&amp;nbsp;VP Sales, EMEA&amp;nbsp;to drive partner-led growth.&amp;nbsp;The Director will own the execution and evolution of CoreView’s&amp;nbsp;partner strategy across Northern, Southern, and Central Europe.&amp;nbsp;This role will&amp;nbsp;be responsible for managing and developing CoreView’s EMEA channel motion through a team of&amp;nbsp;direct reports based in the UK, France, and Germany, while also building strong relationships with key partners across the region.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Director, Channel Sales - EMEA will play a critical role in expanding CoreView’s partner ecosystem, increasing partner-sourced and partner-influenced revenue, and strengthening go-to-market execution with GSI, System Integrators, resellers, distributors, and strategic partners. This is a highly visible leadership role requiring a strong mix of strategic thinking, commercial focus, team leadership, and hands-on channel execution.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This individual should bring deep experience in channel sales within B2B SaaS or enterprise software, ideally in industries related to cybersecurity.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in cybersecurity is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in channel sales, partner management, or indirect sales leadership within B2B SaaS, enterprise software, or cybersecurity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success leading channel or partner teams across multiple EMEA markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with resellers, distributors, service providers, and strategic alliance partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of driving partner-sourced pipeline and revenue growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building and executing partner business plans, joint go-to-market strategies, and regional growth plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead a distributed team across multiple countries and create strong operating cadence and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial and operational discipline, including forecasting, pipeline management, and performance tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working cross-functionally with direct sales, marketing, pre-sales, customer success, and operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence with the ability to build credibility internally and externally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, stakeholder management, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a high-growth, fast-paced, and evolving software business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;requirements-overview-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-content-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Soft Skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strategic but hands-on mindset.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong leadership and coaching capability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;High level of ownership and accountability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborative and cross-functional working style.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Commercially driven with strong business acumen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong organisational and prioritisation skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Comfortable navigating complexity across regions, teams, and partner types.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Confident communicator with strong executive-level presence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Resilient, adaptable, and able to operate effectively in a scaling environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Credit&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience selling through or alongside&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Microsoft-focused partners or CSPs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Background in Microsoft 365 ecosystem and governance solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience in a business scaling its indirect route to market across enterprise customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Additional European language skills, particularly French or German.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-testid=&quot;responsibilities-overview-section&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;pad-b-8 b-heading&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section-content-container&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define and execute the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;EMEA channel sales strategy aligned to CoreView’s regional revenue goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead, coach, and develop channel sales team members located in UK, France, and Germany.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and expand CoreView’s ecosystem of resellers, distributors, and strategic partners across EMEA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Identify, recruit, onboard, and activate new partners in priority markets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Drive&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;partner-sourced and partner-influenced pipeline and revenue growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Create and manage strategic partner business plans to improve market coverage and commercial performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop strong executive relationships with key partners and act as a senior point of contact where needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Improve consistency and execution across partner planning, pipeline reviews, QBRs, enablement, and joint go-to-market activity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work closely with sales teams to strengthen co-sell execution and improve partner engagement in active opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner with marketing on regional partner campaigns, events, demand generation, and enablement initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate with pre-sales, customer success, and operations teams to ensure effective partner support and execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Monitor partner performance and make data-driven decisions around investment,prioritisation, and growth opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own channel forecasting and provide regular reporting on partner pipeline, contribution, performance, and risk areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Help build scalable processes and frameworks for partner management, territory planning, and regional channel performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Provide market feedback on partner trends, competitive insights, and regional opportunities to internal leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;#LI-CW1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coreview Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ownership Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Take ownership. Drive outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;One Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;One team, one goal, embracing diversity&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;achieve&amp;nbsp;more together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
