&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/?utm_source=newswire&amp;amp;utm_medium=press-release&amp;amp;utm_campaign=PlatformforAISuccess&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Dataiku&lt;/a&gt; is the Platform for AI Success, the enterprise orchestration layer for building, deploying, and governing AI. In a single environment, teams design and operate analytics, machine learning, and AI agents with the transparency, collaboration, and control enterprises require. Sitting above data platforms, cloud infrastructure, and AI services, Dataiku connects the full enterprise AI stack - empowering organizations to run AI across multi-vendor environments with centralized governance.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The world’s leading companies rely on Dataiku to operationalize AI and run it as a true business performance engine delivering measurable value. For more, visit the Dataiku &lt;a href=&quot;https://blog.dataiku.com/?_gl=1*17edvf4*_ga*MjA1Mjk5NzY4OC4xNjY3MjMyMDUz*_ga_B3YXRYMY48*MTY2OTA1MDY5NS4xMi4xLjE2NjkwNTA2OTguNTcuMC4w&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/dataiku&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Manager, Global Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re ~1,300 builders across 18 countries. We share context openly, work across functions and borders, question defaults, and own our outcomes. Our People team runs on Dataiku too, with AI agents and automated workflows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; EMEA - Remote · &lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; Global Total Rewards Lead&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own Dataiku’s global benefits programs across all countries where we operate. The goal: benefits that help us win AI talent, feel consistent and fair wherever people work, meet local requirements, and stay financially sustainable.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our People function is lean and decentralized. You’ll set benefits strategy with the Global Total Rewards Lead, partner directly with Finance, Legal, Payroll and our brokers, lead day-to-day benefits operations, and have real autonomy. This is a builder role: you’ll challenge how benefits work today and use AI to make them simpler to run and easier for employees to use.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Shape the strategy.&lt;/strong&gt; Define and evolve our global benefits philosophy with the Global Total Rewards Lead, balancing market competitiveness, consistency across countries and cost discipline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Own the global portfolio.&lt;/strong&gt; Design and manage health, retirement, insurance, leave and wellbeing programs across our entities and EOR countries, setting a clear global floor with smart local variation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Run renewals and vendors.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead annual renewals, broker and carrier relationships, and RFPs. Negotiate on data, not habit, and hold vendors to clear service levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Keep us compliant.&lt;/strong&gt; Make sure plans meet local rules in every country. You’ll own US compliance directly (ERISA, ACA, COBRA, nondiscrimination testing, Form 5500) as well as statutory and collective-agreement obligations in Europe and beyond.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Manage cost.&lt;/strong&gt; Own the global benefits budget and forecasts with Finance. Model plan changes, track claims and utilization trends, and bring clear trade-offs to decision-makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Lead benefits operations.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the team that runs enrollment, life events, leaves, payroll and HRIS integrations, and EOR coordination. Build processes that scale without adding headcount.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Use AI to reinvent the experience.&lt;/strong&gt; Automate enrollment, eligibility checks, reconciliations and employee questions with AI agents and workflows. Make it easy for employees to understand and use what we offer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Support growth and change.&lt;/strong&gt; Set up benefits for new countries, entity conversions from EOR, and acquisitions, with clean harmonization plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Communicate clearly.&lt;/strong&gt; Build benefits guides, open-enrollment campaigns and manager resources that people actually read.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Extensive global benefits experience in a global, high-growth tech or enterprise software company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Deep expertise in benefits design, renewals, vendor/broker management and benchmarking across multiple countries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong, hands-on US benefits compliance experience, plus experience with European programs and statutory requirements, including UK and French benefits and pensions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience managing benefits through both owned entities and Employer of Record providers (e.g. Deel, Remote).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; A track record of building or transforming benefits programs, not just administering them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Experience leading a team and influencing senior stakeholders in lean, fast-moving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Strong analytical skills for cost modeling and claims analysis, and real curiosity for AI and automation (Workday a plus).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why join us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Real impact:&lt;/strong&gt; shape benefits for a global AI company helping the world’s largest enterprises make AI work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; the autonomy to build, with direct access to Total Rewards, Finance and People leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &lt;strong&gt;Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; help reinvent how People programs are delivered, with AI-powered workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote #LI-FR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What are you waiting for!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;At Dataiku, you&#39;ll be part of a journey to shape the ever-evolving world of AI. We&#39;re not just building a product; we&#39;re crafting the future of AI. If you&#39;re ready to make a significant impact in a company that values innovation, collaboration, and your personal growth, we can&#39;t wait to welcome you to Dataiku! And if you’d like to learn even more about working here, you can visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/dataiku/&quot;&gt;Dataiku LinkedIn page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Our practices are rooted in the idea that everyone should be treated with dignity, decency and fairness. Dataiku also believes that a diverse identity is a source of strength and allows us to optimize across the many dimensions that are needed for our success. Therefore, we are proud to be an equal opportunity employer.&amp;nbsp;All employment practices are based on business needs, without regard to race, ethnicity, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, religion, age, neurodiversity, disability status, citizenship, veteran status or any other aspect which makes an individual unique or protected by laws and regulations in the locations where we operate. This applies to all policies and procedures related to recruitment and hiring, compensation, benefits, performance, promotion and termination and all other conditions and terms of employment. If you need assistance or an accommodation, please contact us at: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; ----------
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Protect yourself from fraudulent recruitment activity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;em&gt;Dataiku will never ask you for payment of any type during the interview or hiring process. Other than our video-conference application, Zoom, we will also never ask you to make purchases or download third-party applications during the process. If you experience something out of the ordinary or suspect fraudulent activity, please review our page on identifying and reporting fraudulent activity&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.dataiku.com/legal/dataiku-recruitment-scams/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;This is a &lt;strong&gt;permanent full-time&amp;nbsp;remote &lt;/strong&gt;opportunity &lt;strong&gt;for those based in the UK.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nearform&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Nearform is an independent team of data &amp;amp; AI experts, engineers, and designers who build intelligent digital solutions and capability at pace. We create AI-enabled solutions that enhance digital experiences, empower developers, and deliver measurable results. In these ways, we partner with ambitious enterprises to deliver enduring impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our deep expertise in solving the world’s most complex digital problems, along with our collaborative, people-first approach, enables enterprises to build breakthrough products and modernise legacy systems by unleashing the power of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, our team of 500 experts in 20+ countries is trusted by leading enterprises including Lululemon, Puma, Sun Life, Starbucks, Travelex, Virgin Media 02, and Walmart.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our Delivery Management function, you will help our clients build solutions and platforms, launch new product ventures, and fundamentally change how they operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work as part of a highly skilled, multidisciplinary team, typically consisting of designers, developers, DevOps engineers, and members of the client team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re a Delivery Manager, Technical Lead, or Technical Director, you will act as the bridge between client needs and timelines, ensuring the delivery of innovative, scalable solutions.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Technical Director role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Director at Nearform, you will provide strategic and technical leadership across multiple projects, ensuring alignment with business goals while fostering innovation and excellence. Your role will involve technical vision-setting, client engagement, and team leadership to drive both project success and long-term growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Strategy &amp;amp; Leadership – Define and communicate a clear technical vision, ensuring best practices in architecture, software development, and emerging technologies. Act as the final authority in critical design and delivery decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Client Engagement &amp;amp; Advisory – Serve as a trusted advisor to CIOs, CTOs, and senior stakeholders. Lead discovery workshops, translate business objectives into technical strategies, and develop tailored solution proposals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Project Execution &amp;amp; Delivery – Oversee technical execution, ensuring quality, scalability, and maintainability. Monitor project health, identify risks, and ensure successful outcomes through proactive leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Leadership &amp;amp; Talent Development – Work with resourcing teams to ensure the right talent is staffed on projects. Foster a culture of excellence, mentorship, and innovation across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Operational Oversight – Manage project burn-down, optimize resource allocation, and identify revenue growth opportunities while maintaining financial accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry Influence &amp;amp; Thought Leadership – Stay ahead of industry trends, contribute to open-source projects, and engage in public speaking, blog writing, and mentorship. Champion Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion (DEI) and sustainability initiatives within Nearform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for in this person&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of technical leadership experience, ideally within consulting, SaaS, or large-scale digital transformation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in software architecture, cloud platforms, and modern development practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of guiding technical decisions on complex, high-impact projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading pre-sales, discovery, and solution design discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to communicate complex technical concepts to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative mindset, able to align business needs with technical strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management and negotiation skills to influence at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with AI, databases, distributed systems, and modern software engineering best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading and mentoring senior software development teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A passion for continuous learning, innovation, and professional excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience working in a fully remote, globally distributed environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in financial oversight of technology projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to open-source projects or technical thought leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior exposure to AI-driven solutions and emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Company Bonus -&lt;/strong&gt; We all help Nearform to hit company goals so we all receive a share of the profits on an annual basis in line with company performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Remotely and Flexibly -&lt;/strong&gt; We have a genuine dedication to work/life balance. Our flexible working culture allows you to work around what matters - school run, no problem!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Time Off Package -&lt;/strong&gt; We offer an annual leave of 25 days plus public holidays. We also offer sick leave, marriage leave and many more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Working Allowance -&lt;/strong&gt; Every 2 years, you will have a budget of up to €1250 (equivalent in GBP) to help you set up a comfortable and productive workspace in addition to your essential equipment provided by Nearform when you join.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training and Development Allowance -&lt;/strong&gt; Nearform is committed to supporting and investing in employees’ ongoing learning and professional development. You will be encouraged to pursue relevant learning opportunities that support your growth and the growth of others, subject to manager approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare -&lt;/strong&gt; It’s important to always take care of your health, so we offer additional private healthcare here at Nearform. If you wish to learn more about the plan offered feel free to reach out to our team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension &amp;amp; Insurances -&lt;/strong&gt; We offer a pension match of up to 5% and Income Protection and Death in Service for peace of mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Call&lt;/strong&gt; (30 mins, Zoom)&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;An introductory conversation with a member of our Talent Team to learn more about your background, experience, and career goals. We&#39;ll also provide a high-level overview of Nearform and answer any questions you may have. This step helps us assess initial alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hiring Manager Interview &lt;/strong&gt;(1 hour, Zoom)&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;A conversation with the Head of Delivery or CTO focused on your approach to delivery management, client collaboration, and technical problem-solving in an enterprise development setting. We&#39;ll also share more details about Nearform and the potential projects you may join.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Panel Interview&lt;/strong&gt; (1.5 hours, Zoom)&lt;br&gt;A discussion with 2 Technical Directors focusing on your team leadership and delivery management approach in more detail. This includes scenario-based questions on team management, delivering technical work, and client collaboration, assessing how you drive success in an enterprise development environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final Interview&lt;/strong&gt; (45 mins, Zoom)&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;A final chat with the Managing Director for the region to discuss the plans for this role, Nearform’s strategy, and any questions you may have.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about building high-quality applications, solving complex challenges, and driving innovation in enterprise development, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now via our careers page at Nearform and be part of a team that values technical excellence, collaboration, and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our recruitment process, we conduct manual and electronic identity verification checks to confirm the identity of prospective employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nearform is committed to shaping a better world in all that we do. Our global team is built based on respect, inclusivity, diversity and excellence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you require any adjustments to the interview process as part of your application, please let someone from our Talent Team know so they can help.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p data-start=&quot;47&quot; data-end=&quot;312&quot;&gt;This is a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;57&quot; data-end=&quot;93&quot;&gt;full-time, permanent opportunity&lt;/strong&gt; for candidates &lt;strong data-start=&quot;109&quot; data-end=&quot;182&quot;&gt;based in the UK and authorised to work without sponsorship.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;314&quot; data-end=&quot;453&quot;&gt;This position also requires &lt;strong data-start=&quot;342&quot; data-end=&quot;393&quot;&gt;travel to client sites &lt;/strong&gt;with&lt;strong data-start=&quot;400&quot; data-end=&quot;452&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;travel expenses covered by the company&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nearform&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nearform is an independent team of data &amp;amp; AI experts, engineers, and designers who build intelligent digital solutions and capability at pace. We create AI-enabled solutions that enhance digital experiences, empower developers, and deliver measurable results. In these ways, we partner with ambitious enterprises to deliver enduring impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our deep expertise in solving the world’s most complex digital problems, along with our collaborative, people-first approach, enables enterprises to build breakthrough products and modernise legacy systems by unleashing the power of AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, our team of 500 experts in 20+ countries is trusted by leading enterprises including Lululemon, Puma, Sun Life, Starbucks, Travelex, Virgin Media 02, and Walmart.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our Engineering function, you will work closely with clients to translate complex business requirements into innovative digital products. &lt;br&gt;Whether you are a Senior Engineer, Tech Lead, or DevOps Engineer, you will collaborate with distributed teams, leveraging cutting-edge technologies to build secure, high-performance applications. Our Nearform engineers are known for building high quality, scalable solutions that solve real world problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Technical Lead Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Lead at Nearform, you will be responsible for leading and guiding development teams while working directly with clients to translate business and technical requirements into impactful applications. However, as you’ll likely work on a variety of projects in your time here, your responsibilities may also include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical and line-management leadership to your development team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take responsibility for the successful delivery of projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and resolve blockers before they become issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure best practices in software development, DevOps, and agile methodologies are upheld within the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with clients, translating requirements into technical briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and define architectural decisions ensuring scalability, security, and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide updates to client and Nearform leadership to ensure clear understanding of project status and drive good decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we are looking for in this person:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant experience in software engineering and 2+ years of experience leading projects and mentoring as a Technical Lead. For this particular role, we are looking for professional experience Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AI application development and Agentic frameworks and platforms (e.g., LangGraph, Agentspace, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working directly with clients or customers to understand technical requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience working with Kubernetes for container orchestration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong CI/CD experience, including hands-on work with Terraform, Helm, and other cloud-native IaC technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of observability practices, with practical experience using OpenTelemetry (OTel) and related tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading software engineering teams through technical delivery and either direct line management or mentoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of agile ways of working, best practices and design patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of test-driven development and testing best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of version control tools, e.g. Git.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of DevOps practices and cloud technologies (AWS, Azure, GCP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of operational concerns (such as monitoring, performance testing, security considerations, accessibility, GDPR)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathy and people skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks we offer at Nearform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Annual Company Bonus -&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;We all help Nearform to hit company goals so we all receive a share of the profits on an annual basis in line with company performance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Remotely and Flexibly -&lt;/strong&gt; We have a genuine dedication to work/life balance. Our flexible working culture allows you to work around what matters - school run, no problem!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Time Off Package -&lt;/strong&gt; We offer an annual leave of 25 days plus public holidays. We also offer sick leave, marriage leave and many more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Remote Working Allowance - &lt;/strong&gt;Every 2 years, you will have a budget of up to €1250 (equivalent in GBP) to help you set up a comfortable and productive workspace in addition to your essential equipment provided by Nearform when you join.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Training and Development Allowance -&lt;/strong&gt; Nearform is committed to supporting and investing in employees’ ongoing learning and professional development. You will be encouraged to pursue relevant learning opportunities that support your growth and the growth of others, subject to manager approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Healthcare -&lt;/strong&gt; It’s important to always take care of your health, so we offer additional private healthcare here at Nearform. If you wish to learn more about the plan offered feel free to reach out to our team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pension &amp;amp; Insurances&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;-&lt;/strong&gt; We offer a pension match of up to 5% and Income Protection and Death in Service for peace of mind.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Interview Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Talent Call&lt;/strong&gt; (30 mins via Zoom)&lt;br&gt;An initial conversation with a member of our Talent Team to explore your background, leadership experience, and career goals. We’ll provide an overview of Nearform, discuss potential alignment, and answer any questions you may have. This step helps us assess initial alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Panel Interview&lt;/strong&gt; (60 mins via Zoom)&lt;br&gt;A conversation with two of our Technical Directors focused on your approach to teamwork, client collaboration, and problem-solving in an enterprise development setting. We&#39;ll also share more details about Nearform and the potential projects you may join.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Lead Assessment&lt;/strong&gt; (90 mins via Zoom)&lt;br&gt;A structured assessment led by a senior Technical Lead or Head of Engineering, designed to evaluate key aspects of a Technical Lead role. This session includes a selection of tasks to cover:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Architecture Design - We want to see how you approach a high-level problem, demonstrating your design thinking and decision-making process.&lt;br&gt;Technical Implementation - How do you turn a design into reality, taking into account business needs?&lt;br&gt;Code Standards and Feedback - We want to see not just your own skills, but also how you improve those around you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;There may also be an additional interview with the client depending on the project.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to Join Us?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re passionate about building high-quality applications, solving complex challenges, and driving innovation in enterprise development, we’d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Apply now via our careers page at Nearform and be part of a team that values technical excellence, collaboration, and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of our recruitment process, we conduct manual and electronic identity verification checks to confirm the identity of prospective employees.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Nearform is committed to shaping a better world in all that we do. Our global team is built based on respect, inclusivity, diversity and excellence.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you require any adjustments to the interview process as part of your application, please let someone from our Talent Team know so they can help. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O&lt;em&gt;ur salary range &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;starts from £90,000 + bonus &amp;amp; benefits &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;and will be discussed during the initial interview based on your experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;SingleStore is looking for an accomplished sales professional to join our Sales Team. AI is moving from experimentation into production, and this role is an opportunity to break into AI while doing meaningful enterprise selling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Account Executive, AI Hunter, your job is simple: create new SingleStore customers. You will find companies building AI applications where data access, real-time context, memory, retrieval, or operational scale is becoming a constraint—and turn those challenges into new SingleStore customers. You will own a broad territory, build a majority self-sourced pipeline, create demand in an emerging category, and close greenfield enterprise opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a true hunting role. You will engage customers before they have a defined project, develop customer-specific points of view, create urgency around business and technical problems, work with technical experts to land first production workloads, and build a measurable new-logo business with broad ownership. The ideal candidate is a measurable enterprise hunter who is competitive, curious, technically credible, resilient, and able to sell business outcomes. Direct AI sales experience is valuable, but proven selling ability and technical curiosity matter more than a narrow “AI seller” title.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Role and Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute a territory strategy for net-new customer acquisition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect fearlessly across a broad account universe using proactive, persistent outbound, account-based, partner, and market-education motions; stay resilient and effective through rejection and ambiguity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Form account hypotheses, map the buying center, and earn first meetings with relevant points of view tailored to the customer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage executive, business, technical, security, and procurement stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead great business-first discovery, connect AI and data challenges to fundable goals, and build quantified ROI, TCO, or operational-impact cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and develop champions, multi-thread the buying group, earn executive and economic-buyer access, and maintain stakeholder alignment; own the stakeholder plan, mutual action plan, close plan, value case, stage gates, forecast, and commercial outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex sales cycles through technical validation, security, legal, procurement, negotiation, and close.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Solutions and Forward Deployment Engineers and cross-functional teams to validate technical fit and establish the first production workload.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate competitive displacement and maintain disciplined activity management, CRM hygiene, reporting, qualification, forecasting, and opportunity management; showcase clear metrics such as pipeline created, meetings, conversion, quota attainment, and new-logo performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be AI fluent: use AI and research tools productively and responsibly while applying judgment, validating outputs, and separating facts from hypotheses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel within the assigned territory as required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Required Skills and Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of quota-carrying B2B enterprise software sales experience, ideally selling to large or technically sophisticated organizations; experience in data, cloud, analytics, AI, or adjacent technical domains is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Repeated, quantified quota success with clear ownership of new-logo wins and self-sourced pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing complex, multi-stakeholder deals involving executives, technical evaluators, security, legal, finance, procurement, and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to sell measurable business outcomes and build ROI, TCO, or operational-impact cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical fluency in an adjacent domain such as databases, data infrastructure, analytics, AI/ML, cloud, Kubernetes, developer tools, cybersecurity, observability, or open-source software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong qualification, account planning, forecasting, CRM, negotiation, and deal-management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning velocity and coachability, demonstrated through specific behavior change after feedback; ability to explain technical concepts clearly to technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence, customer trust, resilience, intellectual honesty, and excellent communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.A., B.S. degree or equivalent in a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Fortune 500 or security-sensitive organizations, cloud ecosystems, open-source or consumption-based products, or emerging categories is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To all recruitment agencies: SingleStore does not accept agency resumes. Please do not forward resumes to SingleStore employees. SingleStore is not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with the Company.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;SingleStore values individuals for their unique skills and experiences, and we’re proud to offer roles in a variety of locations across the United States. Salary is based on permissible, non-discriminatory factors such as skills, experience, and geographic location, and is just one part of our total compensation and benefits package. Certain roles are also eligible for additional rewards, including merit increases and annual bonuses. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;SingleStore’s salary range for this role is [£140,000 - £230,000]&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;For candidates residing in California, please see our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.singlestore.com/singlestore-california-recruitment-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;. For candidates residing in the EEA, UK, and Switzerland, please see our&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.singlestore.com/recruitment-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt; EEA, UK, and Swiss Recruitment Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Cato Networks is the converged network and security cloud for the AI era.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As AI reshapes cybersecurity, enterprises face a dual challenge: unlocking AI’s potential while defending against AI-driven attacks. Cato addresses both through a unified, cloud-native platform, providing the visibility and context to prioritize risks and stop threats in real time across users, applications, data, and AI agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Join us as we scale: take on ambitious technological challenges and shape the next generation of enterprise security at a company trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:225,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot; data-en-clipboard=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Sales Engineer to be a technical resource for Cato Network’s field sales force in the Nantes area. In this role, you will actively drive and manage the technology evaluation stage of the sales process, working in conjunction with the sales team as the key technical advisor and product advocate for our solutions. You should be skilled at building relationships and explaining technology and product positioning to both business and technical users as well as passionate about understanding technical issues to ensure complete customer satisfaction through all stages of the sales process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Provide technical validation of Cato Networks solutions to prospects&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Development and delivery of product demonstrations&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Presenting the product to customers and at field events such as conferences, seminars, etc.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Respond to functional and technical elements of RFIs/RFPs&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Convey customer requirements to Product Management teams&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Travel throughout sales territory&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Requirements&lt;/u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;4+ years of Pre-Sales or Consulting experience working with network and/or cloud security products in a customer-facing role&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Proven track record in software sales&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Comprehensive understanding of networking technology, including:&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;LAN and WAN technologies&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Switching and routing&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Security (Firewalls and Filtering technologies)&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Cloud&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Strong presentation skills and written communication in emails, RFPs, and reports&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Organised, analytical, creative and adaptive in approach and finding solutions&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-AC1&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Harness is the AI Software Delivery Platform company, led by technologist and entrepreneur Jyoti Bansal (founder of AppDynamics, acquired by Cisco for $3.7B). Harness has raised approximately $570M in funding and is valued at $5.5B, backed by leading investors including Goldman Sachs, Menlo Ventures, IVP, Unusual Ventures, Citi Ventures, and more. As AI accelerates code creation, the real bottleneck has shifted to everything after the code – testing, deployments, application security, reliability, compliance, and cost optimization. Harness brings AI and automation to this “outer loop,” helping teams ship software faster while maintaining security and governance throughout the entire software delivery lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Powered by Harness AI and the Software Delivery Knowledge Graph, the Harness Platform applies deep context and intelligent automation across the software delivery lifecycle with governance and policy-driven controls embedded throughout the platform.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Over the past year, Harness powered over 185M deployments, 82M builds, 18T flag evaluations, 8M security scans, 9.1B optimized tests, 3T protected API calls, and helped manage $2.8B in cloud spend — enabling customers like United Airlines, Morningstar, and Choice Hotels to accelerate releases by up to 75%, reduce cloud costs by up to 60%, and achieve 10x DevOps efficiency.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With a global team across 26 offices and 27 countries, Harness is shaping the future of AI software delivery — and we’re looking for exceptional talent to help us move even faster.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The Senior Sales Engineer lives and works in the intersection between sales and engineering. The ideal candidate must be able to articulate technology and product positioning at the executive, business and technical levels. Sales Engineers are the primary technical support for the sales force and are responsible for actively driving and managing the technology evaluation stage of the sales process. They are there to ensure success with all Harness customers and strategize with their sales counterparts to steer customers to a commercial relationship.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;World class presentation skills in delivering presentations/demos of our platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work with customers directly to debug common errors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to tie business problems to technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capable of understanding and articulating technology value propositions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive complex technical engagements with customers to prove the value of Harness solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for delivering a great product demonstration which tells a story of how our software provides value to our customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will be responsible for representing the product to customers and at field events such as conferences, seminars, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will remain knowledgeable and up-to-date on changes and developments on our technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You either actively develop software, have a prior background as a developer, or worked with developers in a DevOps role&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong cloud knowledge, you worked with infrastructure automation such as Terraform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to respond to functional and technical elements of RFIs/RFPs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to convey customer requirements to Engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to travel throughout a sales territory with minimal restrictions and occasionally on short notice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This role will be located in commuting distance to Paris&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Harness in the news:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.harness.io/blog/240m-financing-to-bring-ai-to-everything-after-code&quot;&gt;Accelerating Our Mission to Bring AI to Everything After Code&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.cnbc.com/2025/12/11/harness-is-worth-5point5-billion-in-round-led-by-goldman-sachs.html&quot;&gt;Goldman Sachs leads investment in software delivery startup Harness at $5.5 billion valuation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LvOYXKAyAqs&quot;&gt;How Harness runs 16 “startups within a startup” at scale | Jyoti Bansal&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.digit.fyi/ai-visibility-crisis-fuelling-security-nightmare/&quot;&gt;Harness Research Shows AI Visibility Crisis Fueling Security Nightmare&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.harness.io/blog/we-made-inc-s-2025-power-partners-list-again---heres-why-it-matters&quot;&gt;Harness has been named to the Inc. Power Partner list for software delivery success&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex or national origin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Harness, we care about your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal data. For additional information on this topic, you can visit our privacy Portal: &lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://harness-privacy.relyance.ai/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://harness-privacy.relyance.ai/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Note on Fraudulent Recruiting/Offers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have become aware that there may be fraudulent recruiting attempts being made by people posing as representatives of Harness. These scams may involve fake job postings, unsolicited emails, or messages claiming to be from our recruiters or hiring managers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note, we do not ask for sensitive or financial information via chat, text, or social media, and any email communications will come from the domain ----- Additionally, Harness will never ask for any payment, fee to be paid, or purchases to be made by a job applicant. All applicants are encouraged to apply directly to our open jobs via our website. Interviews are generally conducted via Zoom video conference unless the candidate requests other accommodations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you believe that you have been the target of an interview/offer scam by someone posing as a representative of Harness, please do not provide any personal or financial information and contact us immediately at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ---------- You can also find additional information about this type of scam and report any fraudulent employment offers via the Federal Trade Commission’s website (&lt;a href=&quot;https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/job-scams)&quot;&gt;https://consumer.ftc.gov/articles/job-scams)&lt;/a&gt;, or you can contact your local law enforcement agency.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;te-floating-button-container&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;Artefact is an AI-native company fusing engineering-grade delivery with strategic consulting to drive high-impact results. We specialize in accelerating end-to-end data and AI transformation, helping enterprises turn marketing into a predictable engine for business growth across the value chain. From strategy to implementation, Artefact delivers bespoke, scalable AI solutions tailored to our clients&#39; core business challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Paris, Artefact operates across 27 countries with a global team of over 2,500 employees, partnering with leading international brands across luxury, retail, FMCG, industry, healthcare, and finance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To support our rapid expansion, we are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff to the Group CMO (Intern)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Global Marketing team starting in &lt;strong&gt;January 2027&lt;/strong&gt; for a minimum of 6 months.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you passionate about B2B marketing, tech innovation, and generative AI? Do you want to work in an environment where your contributions directly accelerate business growth?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Chief of Staff to the Group CMO (Intern)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will play a central role in driving Artefact’s flagship initiative: &lt;strong&gt;&quot;AI-Augmented Marketing&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;. This global project reshapes how our international marketing teams operate by embedding analytical rigor, agentic AI workflows, and operational excellence into everyday execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working directly alongside the Group CMO, you will collaborate closely with regional marketing teams, data scientists, and business analysts worldwide. Fluency in English is essential, as you will lead international workshops, align stakeholders, and scale best practices across all Artefact entities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic orchestration:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the Group CMO in executing the global &lt;em&gt;AI-Augmented Marketing&lt;/em&gt; roadmap across three core pillars :&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytics &amp;amp; strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Derive actionable insights from the marketing data platform to guide executive decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic content workflows:&lt;/strong&gt; Automate content operations by building and deploying an AI skill/agent library using tools such as Gemini Enterprise, Claude, and Lovable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global enablement:&lt;/strong&gt; Scale adoption across international hubs by designing learning modules, documenting playbooks, and running hands-on training sessions in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-market &amp;amp; revenue operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage AI tools and skills to optimize inbound and outbound funnels, drive pipeline velocity, and enhance Marketing-Sales alignment for sustained lead generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance measurement &amp;amp; reporting:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, maintain, and optimize full-funnel B2B performance dashboards (awareness, activation, ABM) to measure campaign ROI and surface continuous improvement opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Operational excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Own and update cross-functional tracking tools, operational dashboards, and meeting cadences to maintain project momentum and organizational alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-impact copywriting &amp;amp; editorial:&lt;/strong&gt; Produce high-converting editorial assets (internal/external newsletters, landing pages, case studies, and thought leadership articles) while safeguarding brand tone and positioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Profile &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Master’s student from a top-tier Business School (&lt;em&gt;Grande École de Commerce&lt;/em&gt;) or equivalent university program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong data-driven problem-solving abilities; comfortable working with analytics platforms, data modeling, and reporting frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Tech native:&lt;/strong&gt; A genuine passion for emerging technologies, generative &amp;amp; agentic AI tools, and B2B growth marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; copywriting:&lt;/strong&gt; Bilingual or fluent in English (both written and spoken) with exceptional writing skills across long-form, web, and newsletter formats.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project management:&lt;/strong&gt; High organizational agility, rigorous attention to detail, and the ability to prioritize competing deadlines in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactive, autonomous, results-oriented, and excited to collaborate with cross-functional, international teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional Details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start date:&lt;/strong&gt; January 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration:&lt;/strong&gt; 6 months minimum&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Paris Headquarters (with hybrid flexibility)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt; : 1200€&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Opportunity:&lt;/strong&gt; High potential for conversion into a permanent contract (CDI) based on mutual fit and performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Artefact is an equal opportunity employer. We recruit solely based on merit and business needs, fostering an inclusive environment free from discrimination of any kind.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

