&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application process, please let us know.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;The Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Sr. Director, Evergreen Subscription Sales leads the strategy, vision, and execution of Evergreen subscription sales across EMEA. This role translates global portfolio direction and company objectives into segment-specific commercial strategies, sales motions, operating models, and performance mechanisms that increase subscription adoption, recurring revenue, pipeline progression, customer value, and commercial effectiveness worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Senior Director leads a global Evergreen Subscription Sales organisation and establishes the priorities, standards, resources, and operating cadence required to execute consistently across regions. The role partners with the Strategics and GSI segment leadership teams, Regional Sales, Account Executives, alliance and partner leaders, and executive stakeholders across Product, Finance, Customer Success, Marketing, Services, and Operations. The role has broad responsibility and significant operational latitude within the defined segments, while the Global VP retains overall ownership of the Evergreen portfolio strategy and global portfolio direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Global Segment Strategy, Vision, and Commercial Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop the global Evergreen subscription sales strategy, vision, and multi-year roadmap for EMEA within the context of global portfolio and company objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate global portfolio direction into integrated segment objectives, priorities, policies, resource plans, sales motions, and operating mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and own global objectives for subscription adoption, recurring revenue growth, qualified pipeline progression, sales productivity, customer value, retention, and expansion across the two segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define global coverage, prioritisation, account, and partner strategies that reflect the needs of strategic customers, GSI relationships, regional markets, and field organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate with executive leadership in strategic planning, business reviews, forecasting, and decisions affecting the company’s commercial position in the Strategics and GSI segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make final implementation decisions within delegated authority and ensure operational effectiveness across the global Evergreen Subscription Sales organisation and its cross-functional programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide informed input into global portfolio strategy, commercial policy, pricing and packaging discussions, and company-wide methods based on segment performance, customer insight, and market dynamics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Segment Sales Partnership and Executive Commercial Execution&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the global Evergreen Subscription Sales overlay for the Strategics and GSI segments, establishing engagement standards and aligning with segment leaders, Regional Sales, and Account Executives on priorities, coverage, and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage early in the most strategic and complex customer and partner opportunities to shape commercial strategy, subscription adoption, deal structure, and long-term account or ecosystem value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop repeatable Evergreen sales plays for strategic accounts and GSI-led motions, and drive consistent adoption across relevant regions and field teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and challenge segment and field leaders on Evergreen value propositions, customer outcomes, competitive differentiation, executive engagement, and commercial execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish executive-level inspection of global pipeline health, opportunity progression, forecast inputs, adoption, financial performance, and execution risks; drive corrective action where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with executive customers, GSI partners, alliances, and internal leaders, representing the company in critical negotiations and strategic engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the global voice of Strategics and GSI customer and partner insight, ensuring market feedback informs portfolio evolution, commercial strategy, and operating priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Global Organisational Leadership and Talent Development&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the global Strategics and GSI Evergreen Subscription Sales organisation through subordinate managers, senior leaders, and experienced professionals, as established by the organisation design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the organisation’s structure, priorities, objectives, operating cadence, and performance expectations in alignment with global portfolio and company-wide direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build organisational capability through coaching, leadership development, succession planning, workforce planning, and performance management across geographies and segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a global culture of accountability, commercial excellence, customer focus, inclusion, innovation, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of new methods, scalable sales capabilities, and global practices that improve Evergreen effectiveness across the two segments and contribute to broader company solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clarity and momentum through growth, transformation, organisational change, and evolving subscription and commercial models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Cross-Functional, Segment, and Policy Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Management to shape portfolio priorities, commercial readiness, and product or solution responses to Strategics and GSI customer and market requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Finance and Operations on global business planning, forecasting, performance management, resource allocation, and budgets with functional or multi-department impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Customer Success, Services, Marketing, and Sales Operations to optimise the end-to-end customer lifecycle and improve adoption, expansion, and partner outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence functional policies, processes, evaluation criteria, enablement, and operating standards that improve commercial effectiveness across the Strategics and GSI segments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reconcile competing perspectives across segments, regions, functions, customers, and partners and make decisions on sensitive, high-impact matters while preserving relationships and advancing business results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Strategics and GSI priorities, risks, and customer or partner insight in global governance and executive planning forums.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-ONSITE&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU CAN EXPECT FROM US:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;: We celebrate those who think critically, like a challenge, and aspire to be trailblazers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth&lt;/strong&gt;: We give you the space and support to grow along with us and to contribute to something meaningful. We have been named Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in Technology™, Fortune&#39;s Best Workplaces in the Bay Area™, and certified as a Great Place to Work®!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;/strong&gt;: We build each other up and set aside ego for the greater good.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;And because we understand the value of bringing your full and best self to work, we offer a variety of perks to manage a healthy balance, including flexible time off, wellness resources, and company-sponsored team events. Check out &lt;a href=&quot;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/&quot;&gt;http://benefits.everpuredata.com/ &lt;/a&gt;for more information.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ACCOMMODATIONS AND ACCESSIBILITY:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates with disabilities may request accommodations for all aspects of our hiring process. For more on this, contact us at &lt;a ---------- if you’re invited to an interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;OUR COMMITMENT TO A STRONG AND INCLUSIVE TEAM:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re forging a future where everyone finds their rightful place and where every voice matters. Where uniqueness isn’t just accepted but embraced. That’s why we are committed to fostering the growth and development of every person, cultivating a sense of community through our Employee Resource Groups and advocating for inclusive leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender, gender identity, gender expression, transgender status, sexual stereotypes, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or any other characteristic legally protected by the laws of the jurisdiction in which you are being considered for hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us and bring your best.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bring your bold.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pure and simple.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Typeform, we believe technology should make work simpler, smarter and more human.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior IT Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to help shape the future of IT at Typeform. Someone who combines strong technical expertise with a passion for automation, AI and building better ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t just about keeping systems running. It&#39;s about rethinking how IT operates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll play a key role in building an AI first, service led IT function, improving how we manage internal technology, support our people and automate everyday processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working within a small, high impact team, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to take ownership of meaningful projects, influence our technology roadmap and help us move from reactive support towards smarter, more proactive IT operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and improve our IT operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for complex IT incidents, requests and technical challenges, taking ownership through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain secure, reliable and scalable internal technology systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply ITIL best practices across incident, change, problem and service management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve service performance, documentation, operational processes and the overall employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the wider IT team to balance daily support with longer term engineering projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build smarter systems through AI and automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate repetitive tasks and improve workflows across IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement AI powered solutions that improve service delivery, productivity and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve employee onboarding, offboarding, access management and software lifecycle processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use APIs, integrations, scripting and automation tools to connect systems and remove unnecessary manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore emerging AI technologies and turn promising ideas into practical solutions, with appropriate security and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think like a product owner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of specific IT services and capabilities, from identifying problems through to delivering improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with stakeholders to understand their needs and prioritise improvements based on business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain clear roadmaps and project backlogs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the success of improvements through service quality, efficiency, reliability and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical changes, migrations and improvements with clear communication, risk management and planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across Typeform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, People, Finance, Procurement and Engineering to deliver secure and effective technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical concepts clearly to both technical and nontechnical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge, improve documentation and support the development of other IT team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help create a culture of ownership, continuous improvement and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in corporate IT engineering, systems engineering or IT service management within a modern SaaS or technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITIL certification and practical experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;applying ITIL principles across incident, change, problem and service management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience troubleshooting complex issues across corporate IT systems, identity, access, devices, applications and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands on experience with modern IT environments, particularly Apple devices, Okta, Google Workspace, Slack and Atlassian.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building automation using APIs, scripting, integrations or workflow automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI to improve IT operations, support processes or internal productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving employee lifecycle processes, including onboarding, offboarding, provisioning and access management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem solving skills and the ability to take ownership of technical challenges from investigation through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product mindset, with experience prioritising improvements, managing stakeholders and delivering measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to work effectively across technical and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing AI driven IT workflows or introducing AI into internal service operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI agents, intelligent workflow orchestration and knowledge management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating HR, identity, finance, asset management and IT service platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal tooling, dashboards or operational reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to security, compliance, endpoint management and IT governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading technology migrations or large internal systems improvement projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About OpenTable:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners,&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;70,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced Senior Solutions Engineer to lead complex API integrations and high-impact technical engagements across our partner and restaurant ecosystem. This role independently owns sophisticated implementations, partners cross-functionally to drive successful outcomes, and helps establish strong technical and operational standards across Solutions Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate brings deep experience with APIs and system integrations, thrives in ambiguous and technically complex environments, and can confidently drive initiatives from technical discovery through implementation and launch. They use strong technical judgment to navigate tradeoffs, proactively identify risks and dependencies, and influence scalable improvements across our integrations and developer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex API integrations and technical initiatives from discovery and solution design through implementation and launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently own complex, quarter-length technical projects and high-impact partner implementations, establishing clear milestones, dependencies, and delivery expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary technical advisor for sophisticated partners, restaurant groups, and strategic initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business and partner requirements into clear technical approaches, balancing implementation complexity, scalability, reliability, and partner needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diagnose and resolve sophisticated API and integration challenges using logs, API requests and responses, authentication flows, and system behavior.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate ambiguous technical problems by identifying assumptions, evaluating tradeoffs, and driving decisions toward resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify technical risks, dependencies, and implementation gaps and partner with stakeholders to develop mitigation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product and Engineering teams to clarify scope, investigate technical challenges, and identify appropriate short and long-term solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate changes to delivery expectations, blockers, and technical risks early and clearly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as an escalation point for complex technical issues and implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain deep expertise across our off-the-shelf APIs, integrations, and broader technical ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Service Level Agreements (SLAs) and implementation commitments are met while balancing multiple high-priority initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security teams to ensure integrations follow established security and compliance standards and proactively identify potential risks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Sales, Partnerships, Support, Product, and Engineering teams to connect technical decisions and tradeoffs to business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable troubleshooting approaches, implementation patterns, and technical guardrails that improve consistency and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Engineering domain owners during complex incidents and technical investigations, using available logs and observability tools to drive resolution and identify opportunities to prevent recurring issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scalable troubleshooting guides, implementation playbooks, and technical resources that improve partner self-service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and raise product improvement opportunities based on technical patterns, implementation challenges, and partner feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have significant experience in Solutions Engineering, Sales Engineering, Technical Consulting, Integration Engineering, or a similar customer-facing technical role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have deep experience working with REST APIs, JSON payloads, authentication methods, webhooks, and system integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are experienced in reviewing logs, debugging API requests and responses, and diagnosing complex integration issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have successfully led complex technical implementations from discovery through production launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are comfortable owning complex, quarter-length initiatives and driving work forward across multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can navigate ambiguity, proactively identify risks and dependencies, and drive technical decisions toward resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have excellent communication skills and can translate complex technical concepts and tradeoffs for technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience partnering with Engineering and Product teams to investigate technical challenges and deliver scalable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can balance multiple complex projects and priorities in a fast-paced, global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You demonstrate strong technical judgment and know when to independently drive a solution and when to engage additional expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You contribute technical knowledge and expertise in ways that improve the effectiveness of those around you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in restaurant technology, hospitality technology, SaaS platforms, or system integrations is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to 20 days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous paid parental leave, vacation &amp;amp; time off for your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health &amp;amp; dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on mental health and well-being:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid therapy sessions through SpringHealth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid subscription to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual company-wide week off a year - the whole team fully recharges (and returns without a pile-up of work!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteer time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on your career growth:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development Dollars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to thousands of on-demand e-learnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Discounts inc. Bike2Work, Season ticket loan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection and life assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program - including 24/7 GP &amp;amp; free legal advice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted gym membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events &amp;amp; Thursday happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch 2 days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best connections happen face-to-face, whether you’re sitting down to dinner or having coffee with a coworker. That’s why OpenTable has adopted a hybrid workplace model. This role aligns with that approach, with an expectation of coming into the office two days a week—giving employees the best of both worlds: in-person collaboration and flexibility.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application or interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ember-view setting-item-core__state t-14 t-black--light&quot; data-test-selector=&quot;setting-item-core-state&quot; data-test-promotion-tag-setting-state=&quot;&quot;&gt;#LI-LR1&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ember-view setting-item-core__state t-14 t-black--light&quot; data-test-selector=&quot;setting-item-core-state&quot; data-test-promotion-tag-setting-state=&quot;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an &lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Engineering Manager&lt;/span&gt;, you’ll guide GitLab’s dedicated &lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Software Supply Chain Security (SSCS) Add-On&lt;/span&gt; engineering team as it develops core capabilities including &lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Dependency Firewall, Build Provenance, Malicious Packages detection, and Artifact Signing&lt;/span&gt;. This is a founding management role where you’ll help shape how the team works, partner closely with the Staff Backend Engineer, Product Manager, and SSCS stage management, and turn a defined roadmap into steady, high-quality delivery for enterprise customers with strict security and compliance needs. You’ll focus on developing the team, creating a healthy operating rhythm, and establishing predictable execution for the SSCS SKU.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join a product area where customers in regulated industries are already validating the need, and your work will help GitLab deliver software supply chain security features that customers can rely on. While technical credibility matters, your main focus will be growing a strong backend engineering team, enabling team members in their development, and creating the conditions for long-term delivery and quality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Guide&lt;/span&gt; a backend engineering team building the SSCS Add-On across dependency enforcement, build provenance, malicious package detection, and artifact signing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Be responsible for&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Drive&lt;/span&gt; engineering delivery for general availability milestones by aligning sequencing, scope, and dependencies with the Staff Backend Engineer and Product Manager.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Develop&lt;/span&gt; the team by partnering with Talent Acquisition on sourcing, interview design, candidate evaluation, and hiring decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Run&lt;/span&gt; regular 1:1s, performance reviews, and career development conversations that enable growth and clear expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Advance&lt;/span&gt; engineering quality by monitoring cycle time, defect rates, and test coverage, and by addressing risks early.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Coordinate&lt;/span&gt; quarterly planning and roadmap tradeoff discussions with SSCS stage leadership and Product.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Work with&lt;/span&gt; Finance and other partners on headcount pacing and team planning as the Add-On scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Represent&lt;/span&gt; the SSCS Add-On team within stage leadership discussions and help ensure strong communication across functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Over 3 years of experience guiding&lt;/span&gt; backend product engineering teams in security, DevOps, or platform engineering environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Ability to hire and grow&lt;/span&gt; backend or security engineers in distributed team environments, with practical understanding of the talent landscape for these roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Technical credibility&lt;/span&gt; to contribute to architecture discussions involving package registries, CI/CD pipeline security, and signing infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Experience managing&lt;/span&gt; predictable delivery across multi-quarter product roadmaps and managing cross-team dependencies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Comfort working&lt;/span&gt; in an asynchronous, documentation-driven organization with clear written communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Familiarity with&lt;/span&gt; supply chain security, artifact management, or compliance-focused product areas, or transferable experience from related domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Working knowledge of&lt;/span&gt; concepts related to frameworks and ecosystems such as SLSA and Sigstore.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Ability to build credibility&lt;/span&gt; with engineers, product partners, and customer-facing stakeholders through clear judgment, coaching, and teamwork.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About the team&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;SSCS Add-On team&lt;/span&gt; is a product engineering team within GitLab’s &lt;span class=&quot;textBold&quot;&gt;Software Supply Chain Security&lt;/span&gt; stage. We work on key capabilities in the SSCS Add-On SKU and collaborate closely with product and engineering partners to deliver security features for customers operating in regulated environments. You’ll report to the SSCS Senior Engineering Manager and partner directly with the Staff Backend Engineer and Product Manager. As a distributed team working asynchronously across regions, we are focused on strong delivery practices, team health, and scaling the product area with clarity and accountability. For more on how related teams work, see &lt;a class=&quot;textLink&quot; href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/engineering/development/sec/software-supply-chain-security/pipeline-security/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Team Handbook Page&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Engineering Manager, Architecture Engineering: Async, you&#39;ll lead a distributed group of Site Reliability Engineers and Backend Engineers. You&#39;ll support their development and balance production reliability with platform projects, including zero-downtime Redis upgrades, support for single-tenant and cell-based deployments, and the move from queue-based job orchestration to a durable workflow engine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Lead, hire, and grow a team of site reliability engineers and backend engineers, supporting career development, promotions, and onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Own reliability for the job processing and caching platforms, including service-level objectives, error budgets, alerting, and weekly operational reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Manage capacity planning, support escalations, and incident follow-ups, balancing operational work with roadmap projects and rescoping work when deadlines can&#39;t be met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Run the team&#39;s part of GitLab.com&#39;s first-tier on-call rotation, including shift coverage, onboarding, and handovers, and serve as incident commander for high-severity incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Drive zero-downtime Redis version upgrades and automate operating system patching and reboots.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Adapt job processing to run in single-tenant and cell-based deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;7&quot;&gt;Own the migration from queue-based job orchestration to a durable workflow engine, defining the first use cases, a measurable migration path, and the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;8&quot;&gt;Own quarterly planning and the team roadmap, and clarify shared operational responsibilities with partner teams, including Git storage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Experience managing an engineering team delivering high-performance services at scale, ideally site reliability engineers or infrastructure engineers running production software as a service systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Technical depth in background job processing and caching technologies such as Redis and Sidekiq, sufficient to guide decisions about upgrades, capacity, and failure modes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;Experience managing reliability against service-level objectives, including defining service-level indicators, setting up burn-rate alerting, and planning capacity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;4&quot;&gt;Experience running a 24/7 on-call rotation and coordinating high-severity incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;5&quot;&gt;A track record of balancing operational work and incident follow-ups with roadmap projects, and pushing back on scope when deadlines can&#39;t be met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li value=&quot;6&quot;&gt;Experience leading a fully remote team across time zones in the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and Asia-Pacific.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Async team runs GitLab.com&#39;s background processing layer, from the Sidekiq infrastructure to the shared code that enqueues jobs. Product teams build the jobs; we keep the platform that runs them fast and reliable. Our Redis clusters support caching, sessions, rate limiting, queues, and shared state. We also support data durability through backup and restore verification, object storage, and operational support for Git repository storage. That work includes restore drills, capacity rebalancing, and provisioning. We staff GitLab.com&#39;s first-tier production on-call rotation in 8-hour shifts across the Americas, Europe, the Middle East, Africa, and Asia-Pacific, triaging every paging alert and bringing in the right team when needed.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Backend Engineer to join our Repository Services team in GitLab&#39;s Create stage. The team owns the repository side of Source Code: how code gets into a repository, who may change it, and how those changes are verified. We build this as an access layer on the primitives the Gitaly team provides, for GitLab&#39;s own features and for the artificial intelligence agents now writing and pushing code alongside people.&lt;br&gt;You&#39;ll work in one of GitLab&#39;s oldest and most complex product areas, using Ruby and GraphQL across &lt;a href=&quot;http://GitLab.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab.com&lt;/a&gt;, self-managed instances, and GitLab Dedicated. Repository Services is a new team, and its first months are about reliability and support, so you&#39;ll spend real time on performance and structured query language tuning, caching, rate limiting, testing, observability, and resiliency, with experienced team members to lean on. You&#39;ll collaborate with product management, product design, testing, security, user experience research, technical writing, Gitaly, Code Review, and the other Source Code teams.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop secure, well-tested, performant features and improvements using Ruby and GraphQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work through complex requirements and legacy constraints to deliver clear solutions while protecting the reliability of this critical system.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and maintain backend services, application programming interfaces, data models, and business logic that control how code reaches a repository, who may change it, and how it is verified.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build on the primitives Gitaly provides and work closely with the Gitaly team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Triage and fix bugs and support requests for the features the team owns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate across functions and teams, both asynchronously and synchronously, and involve domain experts when their input will improve the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use artificial intelligence agents for well-scoped work when they can speed up delivery without sacrificing quality, and critically review their output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write maintainable code that follows GitLab&#39;s standards and contribute to constructive code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help strengthen reliability by monitoring production health metrics, participating in Tier 2 on-call, troubleshooting incidents, contributing to root cause analysis, and improving observability and resiliency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge through code review, technical documentation, and everyday collaboration while learning from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience building backend web applications, services, or application programming interfaces, with experience using Ruby and GraphQL.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of relational databases, structured query language, data modeling, caching, background processing, and backend performance practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience contributing to user-facing workflows and maintaining their underlying systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing backend unit and integration tests, with familiarity with the testing pyramid, Git, and collaborative code review processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using artificial intelligence coding agents and reviewing their output, or an interest in building these skills in a complex monorepo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and spoken English communication skills, including sharing useful status updates in a remote, asynchronous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to manage assigned priorities, work through ambiguity, take ownership of your work, and seek guidance when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Repository Services is a small backend team in the Create stage, formed in September 2026 when Source Code split into focused teams. As the split is finalized we expect to own repository mirroring, Git Large File Storage (LFS), protected branches and Branch Rules, push rules, Code Owners (shared with Code Review), and commit and tag signing. We build on Gitaly&#39;s primitives and meet regularly with the Gitaly team, and our work serves &lt;a href=&quot;http://GitLab.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab.com&lt;/a&gt;, self-managed instances, and GitLab Dedicated.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$115,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$194,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Upsun&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsun is the software factory for human-AI workflows. We give teams one unified platform to create, review, deploy, and run software, with AI agents and humans working in sync. Developers, DevOps engineers, and platform teams use Upsun to build and ship with confidence, without wrestling with infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Upsun brings this together through two products: one that shapes the work, and one that runs it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upsun Dispatch™: the AI-first product accelerator.&lt;/strong&gt; Dispatch governs and simplifies collaboration between AI agents and cross-functional human teams, so work gets shaped, reviewed, and moved to production faster. Ship better code, not just more code.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Upsun Cloud: the Cloud Application Platform for AI acceleration.&lt;/strong&gt; Cloud is where that software runs. It helps organizations launch agentic software into production confidently and reliably, with:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Predictable performance, even at scale&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Secure, compliant environments by default&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Real-time observability and profiling built in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Cloning, configuration, and provisioning in seconds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Sandbox environments where AI agents can build and test safely&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;The name says it all. &quot;Up&quot; means uptime, reliability, and acceleration. &quot;Sun&quot; reflects our follow-the-sun-support, a 24x7, globally distributed support team keeping the lights on while you rest. Our core belief is that software should power brighter solutions and greater innovation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s our commonality, our cultural fabric? A curious spirit and a thirst for knowledge; an eagerness for innovative ideas and cultures. We believe we can build anything together in an environment that frees you to do your best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our values:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌿 We make a positive impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;✨ We aim for the stars.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💚 We care for each other.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Impact of a Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;As a Product Manager at Upsun, you own a significant area of Upsun Cloud, our cloud application platform, and the outcomes it delivers for the developers who build on it. The team you join owns the platform&#39;s foundations: the API, the runtime, environments, and the reliability every application running on Upsun depends on. And because Upsun is the cloud application platform humans and robots love, much of what you build will be used by AI agents as much as by people.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This is a hands-on, technically rich role that bridges product strategy and deep infrastructure understanding. You own the strategy and the roadmap for your area, working closely with engineering to define platform behavior, build scalable abstractions, and shape workflows that empower modern development teams. Throughout, you act as the key voice for the user, making sure everything we ship contributes meaningfully to an exceptional developer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategy and roadmap:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the strategy, roadmap, and priorities for your area of Upsun Cloud, balancing established foundations with uncharted territory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Problem definition:&lt;/strong&gt; Synthesize inputs from customers, support, sales, and engineering into clear problem statements, constructively testing underlying assumptions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution definition:&lt;/strong&gt; Explore options with your team, weigh trade-offs, and land on the right scope.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship small, iterate fast:&lt;/strong&gt; Release in increments and shorten the loop between shipping and learning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with engineering (especially infrastructure and systems teams) to deliver platform capabilities that are reliable, scalable, and developer-friendly.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design for humans and agents:&lt;/strong&gt; Build with two audiences in mind—ensuring features, APIs, documentation, and error messages serve both people and AI agents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer and data authority:&lt;/strong&gt; Connect with customers regularly, serve as an internal advocate for their needs, and define metrics that demonstrate value for users and the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence across teams:&lt;/strong&gt; Build alignment across engineering, design, Product Marketing, support, and leadership.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go-to-market:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Product Marketing early so go-to-market strategy helps shape the product, not just the launch.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product management experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience in product management owning a distinct product area, ideally focused on developer platforms, PaaS, or cloud infrastructure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical depth:&lt;/strong&gt; Understanding of building, deploying, and running applications in the cloud, with the ability to collaborate closely with infrastructure engineers on multi-tenant architectures or distributed systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Software development background:&lt;/strong&gt; Familiarity with building software using languages such as Python, Ruby, JavaScript, PHP, Go, or Rust.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD, containers &amp;amp; APIs:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience or close collaboration with CI/CD workflows, Docker/OCI container technologies, and a clear vision for intuitive API design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Daily use of modern AI tools to research, draft, and prototype workflows, paired with a realistic understanding of where current tools and models fall short.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agentic development:&lt;/strong&gt; A strong perspective on autonomous agent architecture and how agentic workflows are transforming modern software engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigating ambiguity:&lt;/strong&gt; Comfort with turning unstructured problem spaces into clear strategies and taking thoughtful action even with incomplete information.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Clear written and verbal communication skills, with a track record of listening, building consensus, and uniting teams around a shared vision.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-informed decision making:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to seek out and evaluate data to guide decisions and track success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Enthusiasm for using and testing the platform capabilities you help build.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience using Kubernetes, or building self-service platforms on Kubernetes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Upsun, remote work isn’t just a trend. It’s our foundation. Upsunners are a global workforce, and we thrive in a multicultural team. We’re committed to open source and an open, welcoming environment. Our team spans more than 30 countries and a wide range of experience levels, and we’re currently hiring for this role in&lt;/span&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Germany, Canada, Spain, France, and the UK&lt;/strong&gt;. &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We’re unable to provide visa sponsorship at this time, but we welcome applications from all qualified candidates who are legally authorized to work in these countries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Our interview process is a chance for us to understand how you think, what you’ve built, and what you want to take on next, and for you to get to know us. Together, we’ll explore where your strengths and interests meet the challenges our teams are solving.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We know a great hire won’t meet every requirement above. If you can see yourself making the team better, we want to hear your story. Few of us would be here if someone hadn’t taken a chance on us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You can expect &lt;strong&gt;5 video interviews&lt;/strong&gt; on Google Meet to follow the order below.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;45 Minutes with Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Hiring Manager (Director, Product)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Team (IC&#39;s)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Product Leaders&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;45 Minutes with Executive (CTO)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All roles require background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;A product you can believe in&lt;/strong&gt; - Join us in transforming how businesses build and manage web applications, driven making a positive impact as a proud &lt;strong&gt;B Corp&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏆 An Award-Winning Workplace&lt;/strong&gt; - We’ve been recognized by Forbes’ Top 30 Companies for Remote Jobs and France’s Best Workplaces for Women.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🗣️ &lt;strong&gt;A culture that values your voice &lt;/strong&gt;- Join a flexible, open, and inclusive work environment where your voice is encouraged, and your ideas shape our growth and evolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A global team &lt;/strong&gt;- Collaborate with colleagues from diverse backgrounds across the world, embracing different perspectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
