&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;On-site | Part-time (20 hours per week)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tensordyne&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Artificial intelligence (AI) is transforming our world. It can perform cognitive functions that previously only humans could do, such as perceiving interactions across different modalities and environments - with the ability to quickly learn and then solve complex problems. Tensordyne is an AI system solution company that builds very high-performance, low-power generative AI inference systems. Our mission, through the creation of custom silicon, hardware and software, is to enable multimodal Generative AI inference acceleration at scale, with safe, sustainable, high-performance systems for our hyperscaler and neocloud data center customers. We are at the leading edge of advancing the latest research and product improvements for generative Al inference solutions that will make Al even more advantageous for compelling new generative AI applications.Tensordyne is a well funded, fast-paced startup company with headquarters in both Sunnyvale, CA, and Munich, Germany. We also have many talented team members working remotely across North America and Europe. We take care of our people and their families with comprehensive benefits, competitive compensation, flexible spending options, and recognition programs, because building category-defining technology starts with a healthy, supported team. Come join us as we shape the future of multimodal generative artificial intelligence!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tensordyne, we are at the forefront of cutting-edge AI hardware and software solutions. To keep pace in this dynamic, interdisciplinary field, we are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Working Student in ML Compiler Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; to contribute to the development of compilers for our custom ASICs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers an exciting opportunity to gain hands-on experience in full-stack compiler engineering while working alongside a team of experts in a fast-paced, innovative environment. If you are passionate about machine learning compilers, numerical programming, and performance optimization, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a working student, you’ll gain valuable experience in a dynamic and innovative environment that thrives on curiosity and collaboration. This part-time role (20 hours per week) is based on-site at our Munich office..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The specific duties of this role will be shaped by both our business priorities and your individual interests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement ML compiler passes and optimizations tailored for our custom ASIC architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop intuitive tooling to elevate the developer experience of our production ML compiler.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with multi-disciplinary teams, ranging from ML to embedded system engineers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A highly motivated, curious, and detail-oriented mindset with a strong desire to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for compilers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of graph theory and graph algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in at least one systems programming language (e.g., C++, Rust).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Python and its ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a Master&#39;s program in &lt;strong&gt;Electrical Engineering, Robotics, Computer Science, or a related AI field&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with parallel programming frameworks such as &lt;strong&gt;CUDA or OpenMP&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in programming language design and compiler theory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with performance optimization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tensordyne&#39;s culture was built on the following values:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put people first. We only succeed when our people succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ethics and integrity always; Being open, honest, and respectful of everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think Big. Be ambitious and have audacious goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aim for excellence. Quality and excellence count in everything we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own it and get it done. Results matter!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make each person better together, than they would be as an individual.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace each others’ differences, and embrace that there will be differences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tensordyne is an equal opportunity employer. We believe that a diverse team is better at tackling complex problems and coming up with innovative solutions. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to age, color, gender identity or expression, marital status, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, race, religion, pregnancy, sexual orientation, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note to Recruitment Agencies: Please don’t reach out to Tensordyne employees or leaders about our roles -- we’ve got it covered. We don’t accept unsolicited agency resumes and we are not responsible for any fees related to unsolicited resumes. Thank you for your understanding.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Software / Embedded Engineer (Munich)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tensordyne&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is transforming our world. It can perform cognitive functions that previously only humans could do, such as perceiving interactions across different modalities and environments - with the ability to quickly learn and then solve complex problems. Tensordyne is an AI system solution company that builds very high-performance, low-power generative AI inference systems. Our mission, through the creation of custom silicon, hardware and software, is to enable multimodal Generative AI inference acceleration at scale, with safe, sustainable, high-performance systems for our hyperscaler and neocloud data center customers. We are at the leading edge of advancing the latest research and product improvements for generative Al inference solutions that will make Al even more advantageous for compelling new generative AI applications.Tensordyne is a well funded, fast-paced startup company with headquarters in both Sunnyvale, CA, and Munich, Germany. While we have many talented team members working remotely across North America and Europe, this particular role is based on-site in Sunnyvale. We take care of our people and their families with comprehensive benefits, competitive compensation, flexible spending options, and recognition programs, because building category-defining technology starts with a healthy, supported team. Come join us as we shape the future of multimodal generative artificial intelligence! Location: This is an on-site role based in Sunnyvale, CA (required), with flexible office hours.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role will require you to join Tensordyne&#39;s Platform Software team to lead requirements gathering, design, and development of system-level services, tools, and supporting tests for Tensordyne&#39;s AI inference platform software, including debugging, profiling, and analysis capabilities. The successful candidate will support cross-functional engineering teams in the bring-up and validation of platform software on AI inference systems, and partner closely with the hardware, silicon, and validation teams to deliver robust, production-quality platform software. You will work close to the hardware on firmware and board bring-up, bootloaders and BSP development, device drivers, and Linux kernel modules, collaborating directly with the silicon and hardware teams on hardware/software co-design. The role also involves system-level performance and power optimization across the AI inference platform, working with low-level interfaces such as PCIe, I2C, SPI, and JTAG. Occasional travel (e.g., to partner, customer, or contract manufacturer sites) may be required but is not mandatory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience developing low-level systems and embedded software, firmware, and tooling for high-performance computing systems deployed to data center customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience bringing up and debugging complex Linux-based systems at the kernel and driver level, including embedded Linux, device drivers, and/or RTOS environments; experience with SoC/silicon bring-up is highly desirable. Familiarity with AI inference frameworks and data center deployment/management environments is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert programming experience in C and C++, with proficiency in Python, Bash/Shell, and/or related programming languages. Rust experience is a plus. Comfortable interfacing directly with hardware, reading schematics and datasheets, and debugging with tools such as JTAG, logic analyzers, and oscilloscopes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, adaptable, and comfortable working across hardware, silicon, and software teams in a fast-paced startup environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent technical communication skills, with the ability to clearly explain complex technical concepts and practical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS or MS degree in Electrical Engineering, Computer Science, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tensordyne&#39;s culture was built on the following values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put people first. We only succeed when our people succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ethics and integrity always; Being open, honest, and respectful of everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think Big. Be ambitious and have audacious goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aim for excellence. Quality and excellence count in everything we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own it and get it done. Results matter!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make each person better together, than they would be as an individual.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace each others’ differences, and embrace that there will be differences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tensordyne is an equal opportunity employer. We believe that a diverse team is better at tackling complex problems and coming up with innovative solutions. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to age, color, gender identity or expression, marital status, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, race, religion, pregnancy, sexual orientation, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations and ordinances.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;Your Role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you enjoy taking ownership of an IT environment and finding better ways to make it secure, reliable, and easy to use?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our Senior IT Administrator, you will help ensure a secure, reliable, and scalable IT environment across emnify. You will manage core infrastructure, support colleagues across the organization, improve IT operations, and help shape how we use automation and AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your Impact&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Administer and continuously improve our Microsoft 365 environment and core collaboration and productivity tooling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Manage user identities, devices, access rights, security policies, and endpoint compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Provide senior-level support and troubleshoot hardware, software, network, and SaaS issues.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maintain IT documentation, processes, monitoring, and security best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lead AI orchestration initiatives by connecting AI tools, workflows, data sources, and automation platforms to improve productivity and operational efficiency, while collaborating with internal teams and external vendors on IT projects and service improvements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What We Expect&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deep, hands-on knowledge of Microsoft 365, particularly Entra ID, Intune, Exchange Online, Teams, SharePoint, and Microsoft security capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong understanding of identity and access management, endpoint management, networking, and IT security.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Practical experience with scripting and automation, such as PowerShell.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A structured, service-oriented approach with excellent problem-solving and communication skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Interest in emerging AI technologies and the ability to translate them into reliable, secure business solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:280}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;is a global product design and technology company, with a diversified portfolio of 5-star rated lifestyle solutions that positively&amp;nbsp;impact&amp;nbsp;people’s lives in homes around the world. &lt;strong&gt;Powered by two trusted, global brands, Shark and Ninja&lt;/strong&gt;, the company has a proven&amp;nbsp;track record&amp;nbsp;of bringing disruptive innovation to market and developing one consumer product after another has allowed&amp;nbsp;SharkNinja&amp;nbsp;to enter multiple product categories, driving significant growth and market share gains. Headquartered in Needham, Massachusetts with more than&amp;nbsp;4,100&amp;nbsp;associates, the company’s products are sold at key retailers, online and offline, and through distributors around the world.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI at SharkNinja &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SharkNinja, we’re building an AI-native culture. We’re not waiting for the future; we’re creating it. Our people are expected to experiment boldly, adopt new tools, and continuously raise what’s possible to create meaningful impact for our consumers. If you believe the best way to do your job hasn’t been invented yet, you’ll fit right in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot; data-ccp-parastyle-defn=&quot;{&amp;quot;ObjectId&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;679f3b2c-153b-5071-bf1d-4b0991a9f682|1&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;ClassId&amp;quot;:1073872969,&amp;quot;Properties&amp;quot;:[201342446,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342447,&amp;quot;5&amp;quot;,201342448,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,201342449,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469777841,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777842,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777843,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,469777844,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,201341986,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,469769226,&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,268442635,&amp;quot;24&amp;quot;,469775450,&amp;quot;font-claude-response-body&amp;quot;,201340122,&amp;quot;2&amp;quot;,134233614,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778129,&amp;quot;font-claude-response-body&amp;quot;,335572020,&amp;quot;1&amp;quot;,335559740,&amp;quot;240&amp;quot;,201341983,&amp;quot;0&amp;quot;,134233118,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,134233117,&amp;quot;true&amp;quot;,469778324,&amp;quot;Normal&amp;quot;]}&quot;&gt;Our purpose is to positively &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;impact&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; people&#39;s lives every day in every home around the world! We work &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;very hard&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; to provide our consumers with high-quality, exciting 5-star products that make life easier. We thrive on passion and innovation and are looking for great people, with great ideas, who want to build the next &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;big thing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; and develop while they do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;The Brand Marketing Manager will play a key role in the regional &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;Ninja &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;marketing team, driving the development and execution of marketing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;commercialization&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; plans across Central European markets that drive profitable and sustainable growth for the business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt; This role will be a Maternity Cover.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;This role will &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;own&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;product &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; marketing plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; and assortment execution plans (incl. go-to-market plans), drive marketing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;plans&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; closely with in-country &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;cross functional &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;teams to help ensure excellence of execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; help build and execute integrated marketing plans that resonate with Central European consumers, support commercial goals, and strengthen our presence in the region. Working cross-functionally with local sales teams, the social marketing team, trade marketing, PR, and the wider global marketing team, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;you&#39;ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; bring insight, creativity, and precision to the day-to-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;day of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; driving performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate works well independently, brings &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt;a strong sense&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;font-claude-response-body&quot;&gt; of ownership and personal responsibility, and is collaborative by nature — with the drive to help create the impossible!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
