&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;22&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;15&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;Previous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; experience utilising AI to deliver data solutions to customers, or delivering AI solutions to customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;eop&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;Location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;This is a hybrid role and can be based either from our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;London&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;Glasgow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; or Manchester offices, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;a&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;s well as &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;from&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; home. &lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;There will be r&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;egular, planned travel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;involv&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;ing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; overnight stays near our offices and other UK locations for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;customer / internal &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;meetings, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;events&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; and training. Occasional planned international travel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; is expected&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Total Reward&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;We offer competitive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; and equal pay which &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;reflects the skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;experience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;and performance &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;the individual. Any reward &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;package will be discussed &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;honestly &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;during the interview process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;Our people&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;have the opportunity to earn performance-based bonuses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;commission&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; and everyone can benefit from paid holiday, private healthcare, private dental care, life assurance, pension, retail discounts and monthly w&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt;ellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;paragraph&quot;&gt; activities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We set the bar high and won&#39;t extend an offer until we&#39;re convinced we&#39;ve found the right candidate. This is why a job may stay open for months or be reposted several times. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Studies suggest that women tend not to apply for a job if their CV isn’t a perfect fit. Here, talent takes precedence over experience. So if you like the role and think you could be awesome at it in time, go ahead and apply. HSO is an equal opportunity employer. We will consider for employment any applicant and provide reasonable accommodations for an individual with disabilities - just let us know how we can support you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Cloud Solution Architect - Data &amp;amp; AI&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; UK (Hybrid)&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice:&lt;/strong&gt; Data &amp;amp; AI&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About HSO&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HSO is a Business Transformation Partner with deep industry expertise and global reach. As one of Microsoft&#39;s leading partners, we help organisations unlock the full potential of Microsoft Dynamics 365, Azure, Data and AI technologies to deliver meaningful business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With operations across Europe, North America and Asia, HSO combines industry knowledge, technical excellence and a people-first culture to help customers modernise their businesses, transform operations and embrace innovation with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As demand for Data &amp;amp; AI solutions continues to accelerate, we&#39;re expanding our Data &amp;amp; AI practice and looking for experienced Cloud Solution Architects to help shape the next generation of customer transformation programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The Role&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Cloud Solution Architect - Data &amp;amp; AI&lt;/strong&gt;, you&#39;ll play a pivotal role in shaping and qualifying customer opportunities across the Microsoft cloud ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a highly visible role that sits at the intersection of &lt;strong&gt;sales, enterprise architecture and delivery&lt;/strong&gt;, combining technical leadership with commercial thinking. You&#39;ll work closely with customers, Microsoft and internal stakeholders to understand business challenges, identify opportunities, design compelling solutions and create clear pathways from initial discovery through to successful delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll help organisations transform the way they use data, analytics and artificial intelligence, translating business ambition into practical, costed and deliverable solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role requires more than technical expertise. You&#39;ll need strong consulting and stakeholder management skills, the confidence to challenge assumptions, and the commercial awareness to ensure opportunities are both valuable for clients and aligned with HSO&#39;s delivery capability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Opportunity Qualification &amp;amp; Solution Shaping&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Data &amp;amp; AI opportunity qualification alongside Account Managers, Business Development teams and Enterprise Architects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate customer discovery workshops, architecture assessments and strategic discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand customer business drivers, challenges and desired outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers define realistic transformation roadmaps aligned to business priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualify opportunities using structured sales and consulting methodologies, including MEDDIC/MEDDICC approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Solution Architecture &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end Data &amp;amp; AI solutions using Microsoft technologies and best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape modern analytics, AI and data platform architectures that are commercially viable and technically deliverable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide architectural leadership across data platform modernisation, analytics, AI and automation initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure alignment with Microsoft Cloud Adoption Framework and Azure Well-Architected principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate architectural trade-offs and recommendations to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Commercial Leadership&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer requirements into proposals, statements of work, delivery plans and business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce solution estimates, cost models and phased implementation approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support customers in understanding ROI, value realisation and investment considerations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge unclear scope and identify delivery, cost and commercial risks early in the sales cycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with delivery teams to validate assumptions before commitments are made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Growth &amp;amp; Go-to-Market&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the evolution of HSO&#39;s Data &amp;amp; AI propositions and repeatable offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop demonstrations, accelerators, sales collateral and industry-specific solution narratives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support RFPs, bid responses, executive presentations and proof-of-concept engagements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Microsoft stakeholders to drive pipeline growth and co-sell opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep up to date with emerging Microsoft technologies and industry trends across Data &amp;amp; AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate combines strong technical capability with exceptional commercial awareness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be equally comfortable discussing board-level business outcomes with executive stakeholders as you are diving into architecture decisions with technical teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; Consulting Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a Solution Architecture, Pre-Sales, Consulting or Technical Advisory role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a Microsoft partner, consultancy or enterprise technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen and experience creating proposals, business cases and Statements of Work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to qualify opportunities and challenge assumptions constructively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent workshop facilitation, discovery and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience presenting to senior business and technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to translate complex technical concepts into clear business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of opportunity qualification methodologies such as MEDDIC or MEDDICC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience across industries such as manufacturing, retail, financial services, healthcare, public sector, not-for-profit, utilities or professional services would be advantageous.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Technical Experience&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognise that few candidates will have expertise across every area listed below. We&#39;re primarily looking for strong Data &amp;amp; AI architecture experience across the Microsoft ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Essential&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Data &amp;amp; Analytics&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Microsoft Fabric&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lakehouse architecture patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Power BI and self-service analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Semantic modelling and reporting solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data platform modernisation and analytics strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Azure Data Platform&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Data Lake Storage (ADLS)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Synapse Analytics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Databricks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure SQL Database&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Cosmos DB&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure Data Factory&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;AI &amp;amp; Automation&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure AI Services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure OpenAI Service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Azure AI Foundry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Copilot Studio&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agentic AI patterns and intelligent automation solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document intelligence and AI-driven business use cases&lt;/li&gt;
