&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Nebius:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nebius is leading a new era in cloud infrastructure for the global AI economy. We are building a full-stack AI cloud platform that supports developers and enterprises from data and model training through to production deployment, without the cost and complexity of building large in-house AI/ML infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Built by engineers, for engineers. From large-scale GPU orchestration to inference optimization, we own the hard problems across compute, storage, networking and applied AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Listed on Nasdaq (NBIS) and headquartered in Amsterdam, we have a global footprint with R&amp;amp;D hubs across Europe, the UK, North America and Israel. Our team of 1,500+ includes hundreds of engineers with deep expertise across hardware, software and AI R&amp;amp;D.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Tavily&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tavily provides the search and retrieval infrastructure powering AI applications and agents. Backed by Nebius, we&#39;re helping enterprises and developers connect AI systems to trusted, real-time information.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re hiring our first Enterprise Account Executive in the UK to build and scale the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;The role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Tavily&#39;s founding &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise Account Executive&lt;/strong&gt; in the UK, you&#39;ll own the full sales cycle across strategic enterprise accounts, from pipeline creation through close. You&#39;ll help define our go-to-market motion, establish our presence in the region, and work closely with leadership to shape the future of the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun MacChromeBold SCXW95146830 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW95146830 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Why join:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW95146830 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Founding sales hire for the UK and Nordics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Massive market opportunity at the center of the AI ecosystem&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct access to founders and leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation and RSUs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to build and lead as the region scales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;You’re welcome to work remotely from the &lt;strong&gt;United Kingdom.&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your responsibilities will include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own enterprise sales across the UK and Nordics from prospecting to close&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build pipeline through outbound, partnerships, events, and your network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex, multi-stakeholder sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply MEDDPICC qualification and Command of the Message methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage technical, business, and executive buyers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product and engineering teams to drive customer success and product feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently exceed revenue targets and deliver accurate forecasts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;We expect you to have:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of enterprise SaaS, AI, infrastructure, cloud, or developer-tool sales experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success closing complex six- and seven-figure deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong MEDDPICC discipline and value-based selling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling to technical and executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset with a track record of building from zero to one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives in fast-moving, high-growth environments&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;#LI-VC1&lt;/li&gt;
