&lt;li&gt;Candidates may not reapply to the same role while an application is active or within 90 days of receiving a rejection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Once the applicable days has passed, candidates are welcome to apply again.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;job-details__description-header text-color-secondary font-family-secondary&quot; data-bind=&quot;i18n: &#39;job-details.employer-description-title&#39;&quot;&gt;About Us&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;job-details__description-content basic-formatter&quot; data-bind=&quot;html: pageData().job.corporateDescription&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Fanatics is building a leading global digital sports platform. We ignite the passions of global sports fans and maximize the presence and reach for our hundreds of sports partners globally by offering products and services across Fanatics Commerce, Fanatics Collectibles, and Fanatics Betting &amp;amp; Gaming, allowing sports fans to Buy, Collect, and Bet. Through the Fanatics platform, sports fans can buy licensed fan gear, jerseys, lifestyle and streetwear products, headwear, and hardgoods; collect physical and digital trading cards, sports memorabilia, and other digital assets; and bet as the company builds its Sportsbook and iGaming platform. Fanatics has an established database of over 100 million global sports fans; a global partner network with approximately 900 sports properties, including major national and international professional sports leagues, players associations, teams, colleges, college conferences and retail partners, 2,500 athletes and celebrities, and 200 exclusive athletes; and over 2,000 retail locations, including its Lids retail stores. Our more than 22,000 employees are committed to relentlessly enhancing the fan experience and delighting sports fans globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is a new company operating at the intersection of collectibles, culture, and technology. Backed by world-class investors, operators, and sports &amp;amp; entertainment partners, we are building the global leader in next-generation collectibles. As part of the broader Fanatics ecosystem, we leverage a digital sports platform that spans over 900 sports properties and engages more than 81 million fans. Together, we are reimagining every part of the collectibles experience for fans, partners, and creators.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fanatics Collectibles is seeking an&amp;nbsp;Art Directors at The Topps Company/Fanatics Collectibles are the captains of our graphic design&amp;nbsp;team, steering products and leading team members in the creation of all visual elements for our trading card and collectibles business. As veteran graphic designers and accomplished leaders, our art directors manage all aspects of the creative process and steward each product subset through design and preproduction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate directly with brand managers on product ideation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Determine the print technology of each release, balancing aesthetic requirements with cost budgeting and technical efficiencies on press.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure print specs are captured accurately and with clarity on the bill of materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish a brand identity and coherent visual style for each project.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute a host of design and layout concepts, and direct a team of designers to generate trading card and packaging design templates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement stakeholder feedback and secure internal approvals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the creation of design masters and engage in the comprehensive review of card proof sets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with prepress and manufacturing vendors on all matters relating to card visuals final press files, and complexities during print and finishing stages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and Experience Required&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10+ years of relevant experience; at least 2 years or more managing a team of designers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative, innovative, professional and organised.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Adobe Creative Cloud apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a natural eye for design and a passion for delivering dynamic concepts that connect with our consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Elevate the design work of our group while guiding team members to take their creative efforts to the next level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excel at time management and the ability to manage multiple simultaneous deadlines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess excellent written and verbal communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain extensive knowledge of the trading card and collectibles industry, consumer trends, and competitor products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of football, F1 and other sports are an advantage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The above list of job duties is not exclusive or exhaustive and the post holder will be required to undertake such tasks as may reasonably be expected within the scope and grading of the post.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Subject to applicable laws, Fanatics Collectibles may choose to run a background check.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ensure your Fanatics job offer is legitimate and don’t fall victim to fraud.&amp;nbsp; Fanatics never seeks payment from job applicants.&amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask your recruiter for a phone call or other type of communication for interview, and ensure your communication is coming from a Fanatics email address (including ----- For added security, where possible, apply through our company website at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&quot;&gt;www.fanaticsinc.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting your application, you agree to our terms of service and acknowledge you have read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://static1.squarespace.com/static/5ff494b9931735466ce28d5b/t/69de53bde2c02c25e9c38758/1776178110037/Candidate+Privacy+Policy+April+2026.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Fanatics will never ask candidates for money, banking information, or other sensitive personal information as part of the interview process. If you receive a suspicious message claiming to be from Fanatics recruiting, please do not respond and report it&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a -----
&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Distributed Systems engineers at Datadog design, implement and run in production the foundational platforms powering our applications. Your data pipelines will ingest, store, analyze and query in real-time billions of events per second from companies all over the globe. The platforms are optimized for durability, high availability, low latency, internet-scale footprint and operability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;At Datadog, we place value in our office culture - the relationships that it builds, the creativity it brings to the table, and the collaboration of being together. We operate as a hybrid workplace to ensure our employees can create a work-life harmony that best fits them.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Build fault-tolerant, horizontally scalable solutions running in multi-tenant environments&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Write in Go, Java, Rust or C++, amongst other languages&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Use Kafka, Redis, Cassandra, Elasticsearch and other open-source components&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Own meaningful parts of our service, have an impact, grow with the company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have a BS/MS/PhD in a scientific field or equivalent experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have significant backend programming experience in one or more languages (Go, Java, Rust, C++)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You have been exposed to working on problems (high durability / low latency /…)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You can get down to the low-level when needed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You care about simple designs and performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;You want to work in a fast, high-growth startup environment that respects its engineers and customers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You’re excited about leveraging AI tools to enhance how you code, solve problems, and build – or eager to learn how&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;You have demonstrated ability to use AI coding tools in day-to-day workflows and validate, critique, and refine AI-generated output&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Bonus: You’re motivated to push the boundaries of how AI can improve software engineering best practices and contribute to building AI-enabled products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Datadog values people from all walks of life. We understand not everyone will meet all the above qualifications on day one. That&#39;s okay. If you’re passionate about technology and want to grow your skills, we encourage you to apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Growth:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;New hire stock equity (RSUs) and employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Continuous professional development, product training, and career pathing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Intradepartmental mentor and buddy program for in-house networking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;An inclusive company culture, ability to join our Community Guilds (Datadog employee resource groups)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Access to Inclusion Talks, our Internal panel discussions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Free, global mental health benefits for employees and dependents age 6+&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Competitive global benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits and Growth listed above may vary based on the country of your employment and the nature of your employment with Datadog.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: white;&quot;&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Datadog:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is the leading observability and security platform for the AI era, providing businesses with unified visibility across the technology stack to manage complexity at scale. It brings applications, infrastructure, data, models, and security into one place, using AI to detect and resolve issues before they impact customers. Trusted globally by Fortune 500 companies and high-growth AI leaders, Datadog enables businesses to move faster with clarity and confidence. Learn more about #DatadogLife on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/datadoghq/?hl=en&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/datadog&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;LinkedIn,&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://learn.datadoghq.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Datadog Learning Center. &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;215&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Equal Opportunity at Datadog:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog is proud to offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2023-06/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights6.12ScreenRdr.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;equal employment opportunity&lt;/a&gt; to everyone regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity, veteran status, and other characteristics protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements. Here are our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/candidate-legal-notices/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Legal Notices&lt;/a&gt; for your reference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Datadog endeavors to make our Careers Page accessible to all users. If you would like to contact us regarding the accessibility of our website or need assistance completing the application process, please complete &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeoJeduEZ2NdZF_65uZmWUrCM-zee7yADXX1s6Xr9zAGq8iKA/viewform&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;this form&lt;/a&gt;. This form is for accommodation requests only and cannot be used to inquire about the status of applications.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Privacy and AI Guidelines:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;662&quot;&gt;Any information you submit to Datadog as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Datadog’s&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/applicant-candidate-privacy/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Applicant and Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. For information on our AI policy, please visit &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.datadoghq.com/legal/interviewing-at-datadog-ai-guidelines/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Interviewing at Datadog AI Guidelines&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Black Duck Software, Inc. helps organizations build secure, high-quality software, minimizing risks while maximizing speed and productivity. Black Duck, a recognized pioneer in application security, provides SAST, SCA, and DAST solutions that enable teams to quickly find and fix vulnerabilities and defects in proprietary code, open source components, and application behavior. With a combination of industry-leading tools, services, and expertise, only Black Duck helps organizations maximize security and quality in DevSecOps and throughout the software development life cycle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Manager, Sales Engineering - FAME region&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: France - Remote&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Manager, Sales Engineering&lt;/strong&gt; to lead our Sales Engineering team supporting the &lt;strong&gt;FAME region&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior technical leadership role for someone who combines &lt;strong&gt;people leadership, Application Security expertise and strong commercial acumen&lt;/strong&gt;. You’ll partner closely with Sales, Product Management, Engineering and R&amp;amp;D to support strategic customer engagements, accelerate new and expansion business, and ensure our customers understand the value of Black Duck’s AppSec portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, coach and develop a high-performing team of Sales Engineers across the FAME region&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Sales leadership on regional strategy, complex opportunities and customer growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic technical engagements, demos and PoCs with enterprise customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage confidently with audiences from developers and security practitioners through to C-level executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring strong knowledge of Application Security, SDLC and DevSecOps, including technologies such as SAST, DAST, IAST and SCA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Product and R&amp;amp;D, bringing customer and market feedback into product discussions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help customers navigate emerging areas including AI-assisted software development and AI-driven code analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support partner and MSP-led AppSec opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years&#39; experience leading Sales Engineering or technical pre-sales teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years within enterprise software, ideally Sales Engineering or Technical Sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Application Security and modern software development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SDLC, CI/CD and modern development technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable leading complex enterprise sales cycles and technical evaluations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation and communication skills with both technical and executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in France, with the ability to support customers and teams across FAME&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fluent English is essential, with French and Arabic fluency highly desirable given the regional customer coverage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Black Duck is an equal opportunity employer. We consider all applicants for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, religion, sex, gender identity or expression, age, disability, sexual orientation, veteran or military service status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. Black Duck complies with all applicable laws prohibiting employment discrimination in every jurisdiction where it operates and provides reasonable accommodations to individuals with disabilities in accordance with applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Black Duck Software, Inc. helps organizations build secure, high-quality software, minimizing risks while maximizing speed and productivity. Black Duck, a recognized pioneer in application security, provides SAST, SCA, and DAST solutions that enable teams to quickly find and fix vulnerabilities and defects in proprietary code, open source components, and application behavior. With a combination of industry-leading tools, services, and expertise, only Black Duck helps organizations maximize security and quality in DevSecOps and throughout the software development life cycle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lead Partner Sales Engineer – FAME region&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: France (Remote)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Black Duck is looking for an experienced &lt;strong&gt;Lead Partner Sales Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to support our growing partner ecosystem across the &lt;strong&gt;FAME region&lt;/strong&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior, partner-focused technical role where you’ll work closely with Black Duck’s strategic partners, enabling their technical teams to confidently position, demonstrate and deliver our application security solutions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll provide technical leadership across partner-led opportunities, deliver enablement and training, support demonstrations and Proofs of Value, and act as a trusted advisor to both partners and customers. The role combines deep technical expertise with the ability to build relationships, influence and scale technical capability through our partner network.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable and develop partner Sales Engineers and Solution Architects across the FAME region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver technical training, workshops, product demonstrations and Proofs of Value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic partner-led customer opportunities and complex technical sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise partners and customers on Application Security, DevSecOps and software security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with technical and commercial stakeholders across our partner ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Black Duck alongside partners at customer meetings and industry events.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What We’re Looking For&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in &lt;strong&gt;Sales Engineering, Solutions Engineering, Partner/Channel Engineering or technical consulting&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of &lt;strong&gt;Application Security, SCA, SAST, DevSecOps and modern software development practices&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with technology partners, resellers, integrators or other channel organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation, demonstration and technical enablement skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable engaging everyone from hands-on technical teams to senior customer stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fluent English and French, with Arabic highly desirable.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in &lt;strong&gt;France&lt;/strong&gt;, with flexibility to travel across the region.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Black Duck?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to take a senior technical role within Black Duck’s partner organisation, helping our partners develop the knowledge and capabilities they need to successfully take our solutions to customers across the FAME region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Black Duck is an equal opportunity employer. We consider all applicants for employment without regard to race, color, national origin, religion, sex, gender identity or expression, age, disability, sexual orientation, veteran or military service status, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law. Black Duck complies with all applicable laws prohibiting employment discrimination in every jurisdiction where it operates and provides reasonable accommodations to individuals with disabilities in accordance with applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in France on Arbeitnow

&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Designer (FDE)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Paris, France (hybrid, three days a week in the office)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team: UX Team (FDE)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salary: €63,000 - €75,000&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contract: Permanent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reporting To: Head of User Experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note: This role requires an existing right to work in France. We can’t offer visa sponsorship, but we review sponsorship role by role, so keep an eye on our careers site for future opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;About Kaluza&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Kaluza is the Energy Intelligence Platform, turning energy complexity into seamless coordination. We help energy companies overcome today’s challenges while accelerating the shift to a clean, electrified future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our platform orchestrates millions of real-time decisions across homes, devices, markets and grids. By combining predictive algorithms with human-centred design, Kaluza makes clean energy dependable, affordable and adaptive to everyday life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With teams across Europe, Asia and Australia, and a joint venture with Mitsubishi Corporation in Japan, we power leading companies including OVO, AGL and ENGIE, as well as innovators like Volvo and Volkswagen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;br&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own UX strategy for our EU programme end to end, with real judgement over what to prioritise and how, as the market and the team&#39;s shape itself still takes form&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner directly with Product, Engineering, and Data on the ground locally, including wider teams and client-side engineers,bringing user needs into decisions from the start, not added on afterward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use our established research methods to bring real insight into your own design work, and feed what you learn locally back into the wider team&#39;s shared understanding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and grow two designers based in London, building one genuinely connected team across EU and the UK from early on&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape how local work becomes part of our shared platform and design system, so what you build here compounds for every client after, not just this one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build directly in code where useful, using AI-assisted tools to prototype or ship small front-end changes yourself, closing the gap between design and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Go beyond representing UX, be an active voice in the trade-offs between PMs and Design, holding the right balance between client-specific needs and our global approach, including directly with clients and stakeholders in workshops, showcases, and pre-sales conversations across the EU market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help define what design leadership looks like across a genuinely distributed function, UK, EU, and Australia, while it&#39;s still being built&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring &lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ideally you’ll have/be&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record owning UX strategy and delivery end to end for a complex, multi-stakeholder product, ideally in a regulated or operationally complex industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing in B2B or B2B2C environments, for professional, repeat users rather than casual consumers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct experience managing or mentoring other designers, comfortable leading a small team while still doing hands-on design work yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working from, and contributing back to, a shared platform or design system, not just consuming one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working close to code, confident using AI-assisted development tools (such as Claude Code) to go from design to a working interface yourself&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A genuine appetite for building something from an early stage, comfortable with ambiguity that comes with shaping a team and a market presence, not just operating inside one already settled&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you&#39;ll work&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We offer flexible working, with an expectation of 3 days a week in the office. This gives us the best of both: real time together to collaborate and build relationships, with the flexibility to work in the way that suits you best the rest of the week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Play to win:&lt;/strong&gt; Collective pride in decarbonising energy at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve the real problem:&lt;/strong&gt; Cutting through complexity to focus on real-world outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build trust every day:&lt;/strong&gt; Consistency, transparency and doing what we say.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the outcome:&lt;/strong&gt; Full accountability, wins and setbacks, without ego.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Go further together: &lt;/strong&gt;Collaboration, respect and different perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Insurance: &lt;/strong&gt;Discretionary bonus, Alan Mutuelle Health Insurance, x3 Life &amp;amp; Death insurance (Prévoyance) via Alan, and standard Sécurité Sociale contributions (pension, family allowance, unemployment insurance)&lt;/li&gt;
