&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the &lt;strong&gt;Director, Paid Search (maternity leave cover)&lt;/strong&gt;, you will be responsible for moving HelloFresh Group&#39;s paid search stack into the next autonomous era. You will lead our largest multi-MM$ performance digital channel across our global portfolio, with strategic focus on three platforms: &lt;strong&gt;Google, Bing, and OpenAI&lt;/strong&gt;. You will lead a team of Search experts and architect a future-proof search infrastructure whilst scaling cost-effective customer acquisition campaigns across these channels. Reporting to the Senior Director, Performance Marketing, you will develop and execute strategic plans, use analytics to inform decisions, and drive execution to optimize marketing budgets against company profitability goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a high-impact role with the opportunity to work with teams across the organisation, from Pricing &amp;amp; Discounts, MarTech and Analytics. From the start, we would like you to focus on transforming our search stack to be competitive for years to come, identifying and driving strategic investments across Google, Bing, and OpenAI, working with our in-house experts and dedicated technical/account management teams to formulate Joint Business/technical Plans and build the infrastructure that will drive HelloFresh&#39;s paid search future.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the global paid search team and develop them into a true &#39;centre of excellence&#39; for Search internationally, including expertise in next-generation platform capabilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transform and architect the search stack: Design and build a modern, scalable, future-proof paid search infrastructure across Google, Bing, and OpenAI that positions HelloFresh for sustained competitive advantage&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct comprehensive audits to bring our Search account setup to industry &#39;best in class&#39; standards across all three platforms, identifying gaps and modernisation opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the paid search strategy strategy, set and drive the strategic direction across search channels, supporting the move into the next autonomous era&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage global budget allocation: Set and dynamically reallocate budget across markets, brands, and channels to hit volume growth and CPA/CAC targets, forecasting and reporting with rigour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead senior agency and platform relationships: Act as the strategic lead and escalation point for external agencies and platform partners (including Google, DSPs, and mobile platforms), setting the agenda on plans, investment, and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Marketing Analytics to execute tests across search portfolios to measure incrementality and marginal efficiency and consequently optimise in-house systems and algorithms to profitably scale our Search marketing programmes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a close partner to MarTech teams to bring the search staack into the next stage of automation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring: The Ingredients&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor&#39;s degree with a strong academic record and/or proven relevant experience in a performance marketing or highly commercial role within D2C or subscription-based businesses&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years experience in Google Advertising ecosystem, either from an agency or client-side role&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Forward-thinking about how platform evolution and automation are reshaping paid search strategy, you understand both traditional optimisation and next-gen platform capabilities, and you see transformation as both challenge and opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Early experience or exposure to OpenAI&#39;s Search offering or emerging AI-driven search platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years experience in team management and leadership roles&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building and embedding incrementality-based measurement frameworks (e.g. geo-testing, regression, multi-touch attribution) and partnering with Analytics on marketing mix modelling (MMM) and advanced measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert knowledge of Google bidding, targeting, and optimisation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing campaigns in all Google campaign types: Keyword Search, PMAX, Shopping, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with performance marketing metrics and platform reporting&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Media-Mix-Models, Multi-Touch/Data-Driven Attributions, or other advanced marketing measurement methodologies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational skills and project management ability&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Industry certifications on Google and Bing Ads&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An entrepreneurial mindset: you embrace ownership, make bold, data-driven decisions, and relentlessly pursue innovative solutions to drive sustainable growth. Comfortable navigating ambiguity, testing new approaches, and learning from both successes and failures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape the future of food:&lt;/strong&gt; Play a key role in transforming how millions of people eat as we grow into a global food solutions company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive transformational change:&lt;/strong&gt; Your decisions will have a direct and immediate impact, helping to shape strategy, scale teams, and redefine leadership in a rapidly evolving business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build a global brand:&lt;/strong&gt; Create deeper, more sustainable connections with our customers, putting them at the heart of every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrive in a high-performance environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Work with ambitious, intellectually curious peers on a global scale, enjoying an environment built for empowerment and speed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enjoy &lt;/strong&gt;savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Save &lt;/strong&gt;with discount schemes and corporate benefits via Vorteile.net&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support &lt;/strong&gt;your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay &lt;/strong&gt;active with 24/7 office gym access, a discounted Urban Sports Club membership, and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embrace &lt;/strong&gt;&quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with internal training, the HelloFresh Academy, and a dedicated budget for German language courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will join our Finance &amp;amp; Accounting team based in Berlin, playing a pivotal role in ensuring financial integrity, compliance, and strategic financial operations. Working closely with cross-functional teams and senior leadership, you will contribute directly to supporting Stark&#39;s hyper-growth and mission-critical defense technology initiatives.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a Senior Accountant, you will oversee end-to-end accounting operations, statutory reporting, and financial compliance across our operations. You will drive process improvements, maintain precise financial records, and provide key financial insights to empower data-driven strategic decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Manage and execute month-end, quarter-end, and year-end closing activities in accordance with HGB and IFRS standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prepare financial statements, tax filings, and regulatory compliance reports accurately and on schedule.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Oversee general ledger accounting, accounts payable/receivable, and bank reconciliations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead internal and external audit coordination, acting as the primary point of contact for auditors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Optimize internal controls, accounting workflows, and financial systems to support scalable company growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis (FP&amp;amp;A) to align accounting outputs with budgeting and forecasting models.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;5+ years of relevant experience in accounting or auditing, preferably within a fast-growing tech or manufacturing environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong expertise in HGB accounting principles; thorough familiarity with IFRS is highly desirable.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, Business Administration, or a related field (CPA/Steuerberater qualification is a plus).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Proficiency with modern ERP systems (e.g., DATEV, SAP, NetSuite) and advanced Excel financial modeling skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Fluent professional proficiency in both English and German.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prior exposure to defense, aerospace, or industrial technology sectors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience handling government grants, public funding, or defense procurement regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Familiarity with automated accounting workflows and digitized invoice processing tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DATA PRIVACY STATEMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This data privacy statement, which refers exclusively to data collected as part of the online application process, is to inform you about how your personal data that is collected as part of the online application process is handled at our end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The controller&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The controller under data protection law is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SKD SE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Französische Strasse 12, 10117 Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial register entry number: &lt;strong&gt;HRB 260878&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Registration Court: Amtsgericht Charlottenburg&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection officer:&lt;/strong&gt; heyData GmbH, Schützenstraße 5, 10117 Berlin,&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.heydata.eu&quot;&gt; www.heydata.eu&lt;/a&gt;, -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal data collected as part of the application process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data means any information concerning the personal or material circumstances of an identified or identifiable individual. This includes information such as, for example, your name, address, telephone number and date of birth, but also data relating to your specific career etc. by reference to which a specific individual can be identified with reasonable effort. However, information which cannot be (in)directly associated with your real-life identity is not personal data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fundamentals and purposes of processing personal data collected from application documents and during the application process&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you apply to us electronically, i.e. via e-mail or using our online form, we will collect and process your personal data for the purpose of executing the application process and preparing contracts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting an application via our recruitment website, you express your interest in taking up work with us. In this context, you transmit personal data, which we will use and store exclusively for the purpose of your job search / application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particular, the following data is collected during this process:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;name (first and last names)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;e-mail address&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;phone number&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn profile (optional)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;channel through which you found us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore, you can choose to upload expressive documents such as a cover letter, your CV and reference letters. These may contain additional personal data such as date of birth, address etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only authorized HR staff and/or staff involved in the application process have access to your data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The personal data is stored, as a rule, exclusively for the purpose of filling the vacancy for which you have applied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your data will be stored for a period of 180 days after the application process has been concluded. This is usually done to fulfill legal requirements and/or defending ourselves against any claims arising from legal provisions. After this period, we are obligated to delete or anonymize your data. In case of anonymization, the data will only be available to us in the form of so-called metadata, without any direct personal reference, for statistical analysis (for example, share of male and/or female applicants, number of applications per specified period of time etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore, we reserve the right to store your data for 180 days after the application process has been concluded for the purpose of adding it to our Talent Pool in order to identify any other vacancies that may be of interest to you. This includes, for example, applications for apprenticeships or internships. By accepting the data privacy statement, you consent to any further storage of your data as well as its inclusion in our Talent Pool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you be offered and accept a position with us during the application process, we will store the personal data collected as part of the application process for at least the duration of your employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclosure of data to third parties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data transmitted as part of your application will be transferred using TLS encryption and stored in a database. This database is operated by Greenhouse, which offers a human resource and applicant management software solution (https://www.greenhouse.com/data-processing-addendum). In this context, Greenhouse is our processor under article 28 of the GDPR. In this case, the processing is based on an agreement for the processing of orders between us as the controller and Greenhouse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rights of data subjects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we as the controller process personal data, you as the data subject have certain rights under Chapter III of the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), depending on the legal basis and the purpose of the processing, in particular the right of access (article 15 of the GDPR) and the rights to rectification (article 16 of the GDPR), erasure (article 17 of the GDPR), restriction of processing (article 18 of the GDPR), and data portability (article 20 of the GDPR), as well as the right to object (article 21 of the GDPR). If the personal data is processed with your consent, you have the right to withdraw this consent under article 7 III of the GDPR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To assert your rights as a data subject in relation to the data processed during this online application process, please refer to our Data Protection Officer (see item 2).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concluding provisions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We reserve the right to adjust this data privacy statement at any point in time to ensure that it is in line with the current legal requirements at all times, or in order to accommodate changes in the application process or other processes. In this case, the new data privacy statement applies to any later visit of this recruitment website or any later job application.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LEGAL NOTICE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;1. Information according to § 5 DDG&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SKD SE&lt;br&gt;Französische Str. 12&lt;br&gt;10117 Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Internet: &lt;a href=&quot;https://stark-defence.com/en/&quot;&gt;www.stark-defence.com&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;E-Mail: -----
&lt;p&gt;SKD SE, Berlin (registered office of the company), is a Societas Europaea (legal form for joint stock companies), registered at the district court of Berlin (Charlottenburg) under the register number: HRB 260878 B, represented by the Executive Board: Uwe Horstmann, Dr. André Schneider, Johannes Schaback, Jan-Patrick Helmsen, Martin Rost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chairman of the Supervisory Board is Mr. Robert Maier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VAT ID No.: DE369778559&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;2. Liability&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are responsible for the content of our website in accordance with the provisions of general law. All content is created with the necessary care and to the best of our knowledge and is for information purposes only. Insofar as we refer on our Internet pages to the Internet pages of third parties by means of hyperlinks, we cannot accept any liability for guarantee that the linked content is always up to date, correct and complete, as this content is outside our responsibility and we have no influence on its future design. If, in your opinion, content violates applicable law or is inappropriate, please let us know. The legal information on this page as well as all questions and disputes in connection with the design of this website are subject to the law of the Federal Republic of Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;3. Data Protection&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can find our data protection information here. There you will also find the contact details of our data protection officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;4. Copyright Information&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The texts, images, photos, videos and graphics on our website are generally protected by copyright. Any unauthorized use (in particular the reproduction, editing or distribution) of this copyright-protected content is therefore prohibited. If you intend to use this content or parts thereof, please contact us in advance using the details above. If we are not ourselves the owner of the required copyright usage rights, we will endeavor to arrange contact with the entitled party.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Minerva software team develops our overarching command, control, and edge autonomy software across multiple domain platforms and handheld ground stations. We are a geographically distributed, multi-disciplinary engineering group bridging high-level decision-making software with physical vehicle control and sensor payloads. In this role, you will work within the Minerva product organisation and report directly to the Lead Product Manager to ensure seamless cross-platform functionality and multi-sensor integration across all operational deployments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will support the product strategy for integrating our core Minerva software architecture—spanning C2 systems to Edge stacks—across diverse uncrewed platforms and sensor payloads. Reporting directly to the Lead Product Manager, you will translate complex multi-domain operational requirements and hardware constraints into structured, actionable engineering roadmaps. Success looks like unified cross-platform releases, advanced AI capabilities delivered on edge assets, robust sensor integration cycles, and reliable platform software performance across all deployment domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Specify Concepts of Operation, system and subsystem product requirements, and acceptance criteria&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Incorporate customer requirements, operator and customer feedback, and the wider STARK product vision into scalable Minerva versions across different uncrewed platforms and handheld control systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish metrics and acceptance criteria for cross-platform software stability, data latency, and sensor fusion reliability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define expectations and priorities for AI systems running within edge constraints&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with Lead Product Manager, Product Owners and Technical Product Managers, and Engineering Leads to evaluate technical trade-offs across edge computing and C2 capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with system engineers and hardware teams across different hardware platforms to ensure Minerva edge software delivers maximum performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with engineering leads and product colleagues to track sprint progress and remove blockers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support integration compliance with military communication standards and protocols (e.g., SAPIENT, TAK, SitaWare)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Minerva stack and development processes respect industry audit requirements (e.g. AQAP)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate tests and validations and collaborate with IV&amp;amp;V, Product Safety, InfoSec, Configuration Management colleagues to ensure fast release turnarounds without compromising on safety and security&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of technical product management or product ownership experience software-heavy or complex systems environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience supporting complex software integration projects across hardware devices, sensors, or edge computing stacks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical literacy in software architecture, APIs, and data integration patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with foundational AI systems (e.g. in computer vision, localisation)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of defining product specifications, backlog grooming, and user stories for agile engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent cross-functional collaboration skills, with the ability to bridge hardware, software, and operational perspectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent English verbal and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with defence tech, C2 systems, robotics, or autonomous unmanned vehicles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with sensor integration (Radar, EO/IR, LiDAR) and defence protocols (TAK, SAPIENT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with software products designed for degraded or offline tactical network conditions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with hardware/software integrations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
