&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Upsun, remote work isn&#39;t just a trend - it&#39;s our foundation. The freedom of remote work with the support of a diverse, global team has been our successful model for over a decade. Our culture celebrates flexibility and collaboration, and while we have team members in over 30 countries around the globe, we are currently focused on hiring for this role in &lt;strong&gt;Canada, France, Germany, Spain, the United Kingdom, and the United States&lt;/strong&gt;. Although we’re unable to provide visa sponsorship at this time, we welcome applications from all qualified candidates who are legally authorized to work in these countries.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How we hire&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We know that a great hire won’t meet every requirement that we’ve outlined. If you can see yourself elevating the team, we want to hear your story. Few of us would be here had we not taken a chance.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;You can expect &lt;strong&gt;5 interviews on Google Meet&lt;/strong&gt; to follow the order below. Should you successfully move through the entire process you will have the opportunity to meet with a variety of Upsunners. Our goal is to ensure you can make the most informed decision on whether this role, and our culture aligns with what you’re looking for in your future working environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;45 Minutes with Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Hiring Manager (Chief Marketing Officer)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Team (IC)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;60 Minutes with Team (Head of Growth)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;45 Minutes with Executive (CFO)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;All roles require background checks.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;💡 &lt;strong&gt;A product you can believe in&lt;/strong&gt; - Join us in transforming how businesses build and manage web applications, driven making a positive impact as a proud &lt;strong&gt;B Corp&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🏆 An Award-Winning Workplace&lt;/strong&gt; - We’ve been recognized by Forbes’ Top 30 Companies for Remote Jobs and France’s Best Workplaces for Women.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🗣️ &lt;strong&gt;A culture that values your voice &lt;/strong&gt;- Join a flexible, open, and inclusive work environment where your voice is encouraged, and your ideas shape our growth and evolution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;🌎 &lt;strong&gt;A global team &lt;/strong&gt;- Collaborate with colleagues from diverse backgrounds across the world, embracing different perspectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;padding-left: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎉 &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and perks&lt;/strong&gt; - Make the most of what matters to you&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🏝 Flexible PTO&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🩺 Comprehensive healthcare coverage (UK, Canada, France, Spain, USA)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📈 Company stock options&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Professional development budget&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💻 Office equipment budget&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💆‍♀️ Wellness budget&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧳 Annual team gatherings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;👶 Inclusive parental leave&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✈️ Remote work travel program&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h1 style=&quot;text-align: justify; line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You belong here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Upsun, we celebrate diversity in all its forms and are committed to fostering an inclusive, equitable, and supportive workplace where everyone can thrive. We embrace and value different perspectives, backgrounds, and experiences, because they make us stronger as a team. Whoever you are, wherever you&#39;re from, and whatever path you&#39;ve taken, you are welcome here. We encourage you to bring your whole self to work, connect with others, and share your passion. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;If you need accommodations at any stage of our hiring process, please let us know. We&#39;re here to ensure an accessible and comfortable experience for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every Celonis outcome starts with data. As a Solutions Architect, you make sure our customers’ data gets into the Celonis Platform reliably, securely, and at scale, and that insights and actions flow back out into the systems and AI tools where work actually happens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll join our customer project teams as one of the first technical faces of Celonis. You’ll work hands-on across the full integration toolkit: deploying our out-of-the-box extractors, building custom API connectors in a low-code environment, writing code for push-based ingestion, connecting Celonis to customer lakehouses and LLMs, and configuring writebacks, SSO, and user provisioning. Part implementation consultant, part integration engineer, part trusted technical advisor, this role is ideal for someone early in their career who wants broad exposure to enterprise architecture and modern data and AI integration patterns.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The work you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data integration and ingestion:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Implement standard extractors. &lt;/strong&gt;Install, configure, and troubleshoot Celonis out-of-the-box extractors in customer landscapes, including SAP (ECC and S/4HANA), JDBC-based databases, and cloud applications such as Salesforce, ServiceNow, and others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build custom API connectors. &lt;/strong&gt;Design and build custom connectors with Celonis Extractor Builder for source systems that expose data through REST or SOAP APIs, handling authentication (OAuth 2.0, API keys, certificates), pagination, rate limits, and incremental (delta) loads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enable push-based ingestion. &lt;/strong&gt;Help customers design and develop scripts and pipelines (typically in Python) that push data to Celonis via the Data Ingestion API, and advise on file formats, scheduling, and error handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect to the lakehouse. &lt;/strong&gt;Set up zero-copy data sharing between Celonis and customer lakehouses such as Databricks and Microsoft Fabric, including Delta Sharing configuration, access controls, and data freshness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unblock infrastructure. &lt;/strong&gt;Work through on-premise agent deployments, networking, proxies, firewall and IP allowlisting, certificates, and service-account permissions with customer IT and infrastructure teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep pipelines healthy. &lt;/strong&gt;Tune extraction schedules and delta strategies, monitor pipeline health, and resolve data load failures so customers get timely, trustworthy data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Actions, AI, and platform connectivity:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Close the loop with writebacks. &lt;/strong&gt;Configure Action Flows and other integration patterns that write back to customer systems (for example, updating records in SAP, Salesforce, or ticketing tools) so Celonis insights turn into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Connect Celonis to AI. &lt;/strong&gt;Help customers connect Celonis to their LLMs and AI agents through MCP (Model Context Protocol), covering authentication, permissions, and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identity, security, and governance:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own authentication and provisioning. &lt;/strong&gt;Configure SSO (SAML, OIDC) with identity providers such as Microsoft Entra ID, Okta, and Ping, and set up SCIM-based user and group provisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the security translator. &lt;/strong&gt;Support customer security, privacy, and compliance reviews, explain the Celonis architecture and data flows, and advise on topics like data minimization, pseudonymization, and least-privilege access.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer and team impact:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope with confidence. &lt;/strong&gt;Run technical discovery, document integration architectures and requirements, and estimate effort so projects start on solid footing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner across teams. &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as a technical point of contact for customer IT, data, and security stakeholders, and work closely with Value Engineers, Data Engineers, Project Managers, Partners, Support, and Product &amp;amp; Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be the voice of the field. &lt;/strong&gt;Escalate product gaps and bugs with clear, reproducible detail, and share field feedback that shapes our integration roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build reusable assets. &lt;/strong&gt;Contribute reusable connector templates, scripts, runbooks, and best-practice documentation that scale across customers and partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The qualifications you need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a technical, customer-facing role such as solutions engineering, integration or implementation consulting, data engineering, or technical consulting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with REST APIs and common authentication patterns (OAuth 2.0, API keys, tokens); comfort using tools like Postman to explore and test APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid programming skills in Python (or a similar language) and strong SQL skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of data pipelines and ETL/ELT concepts, including incremental loads, scheduling, and handling large data volumes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with identity and access management concepts such as SSO (SAML/OIDC) and SCIM provisioning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A basic understanding of networking and security fundamentals (TLS and certificates, proxies, firewalls, VPNs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to explain technical topics clearly to both engineers and business stakeholders, and to manage your own workstreams across multiple customer projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity, ownership, and a bias toward solving problems hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Information Systems, Engineering, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with SAP data structures, tables, or extraction (for example, RFC, ODP, or S/4HANA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with at least one major cloud platform (AWS, Azure, GCP) and/or lakehouse platforms such as Databricks, Microsoft Fabric, or Snowflake.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to iPaaS or low-code integration tools (for example, MuleSoft, Boomi, Workato, or Power Automate).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with LLMs, AI agents, or MCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker or Linux server administration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant certifications (for example, Celonis, cloud, or SAP certifications).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact—understanding our customers&#39; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our Deployment Engineers and Deployment Architects pair deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: solution go-live, solution adoption, initial value realization support and the long-term success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead / Principal Deployment Engineer, you are the backbone of Celonis delivery. You lead the hands-on implementation of Celonis solutions for enterprise customers, combining platform expertise with AI-augmented workflows to deliver high-quality outcomes, fast. You use Celonis’s AI deployment tools as your primary instruments - directing agents to build data models, generate analyses, and configure operational solutions, while applying your own judgment to validate outputs, adapt to customer context, and ensure business relevance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a traditional consulting role where you build everything manually. You are an AI-augmented delivery professional: you specify what needs to be built, direct AI agents to execute wherever possible, validate the results, and iterate with the customer. &lt;strong&gt;You generate value by understanding the customer’s business, translating their needs into technical specifications and solutions, and ensuring the platform delivers measurable impact.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Initiate and Connect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct business discovery workshops to translate customers’ strategic objectives into high-impact Celonis use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the customer’s IT and business stakeholders to define project scope, data requirements, and success criteria&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure data connectivity and extraction pipelines are properly configured, working with specialist resources if required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build &amp;amp; Value&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct AI deployment agents (Apollo) to build data models, process analyses, KPIs, and dashboards - writing clear specifications and validating agent outputs against business requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and configure Celonis solutions across the platform: Process Intelligence Graph, data transformations, process analysis, operational solutions, and AI-powered insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify process inefficiencies and root causes using Celonis technology, always in close collaboration with the customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Validate AI-generated outputs for accuracy, business relevance, and alignment with customer context - applying domain knowledge where the AI cannot&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead value creation workshops and define measures to improve process inefficiencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and build KPIs measuring the customer’s success and quantify business impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build operational solutions to drive value, adoption and improve process conformance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Rollout, Adoption, and Handover&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable key customer users to use and extend the solution independently, setting the foundation for long-term adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage project outcomes against timelines, scope, and customer expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and demonstrate to customer users, guiding them on the path to sustained value&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document solution design decisions and configurations for future reference and handoff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Depth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain deep expertise in one or more process domains (e.g., Supply Chain, Order to Cash, Procure to Pay, IT Service Management) or industry verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate domain knowledge into scalable solution patterns, reference architectures, and best practices that the broader team can leverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and standardize high-value use cases within your domain, collaborating with Product and Business Apps teams to shape the platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Makes This Role Different in the AI Era&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work with AI agents as your primary tools - your job is to direct, validate, and refine their output, not to write every line of code or build every analysis manually&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You need strong specification and context engineering skills - the ability to translate a customer’s ambiguous business need into a precise instruction that an AI agent can execute correctly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are expected to continuously learn and adapt as AI capabilities evolve, experimenting with new approaches and sharing what works with your peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You balance speed with quality - AI accelerates execution, but you own the judgment calls on whether the output is right for this customer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You think in sustainable software solutions. While AI agents will generate first results quickly, you need to ensure that the operational solutions you build in Celonis are robust, user friendly, maintainable, and scalable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualifications You Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 7+ years minimum in Management or IT consulting, data/solution consulting, or process improvement consulting within software vendors, consulting firms, or system integrators.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform skills:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Ability to build and configure solutions on the Celonis platform, including data modeling, process analysis, KPI definition, and automation. Proficiency in PQL, SQL, and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI fluency: &lt;/strong&gt;Comfort working with AI-assisted development tools (e.g., Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, etc.). Ability to write clear specifications, evaluate AI-generated outputs, and iterate effectively. Experience with prompt engineering or context engineering is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business and process domain expertise : &lt;/strong&gt;Strong understanding /deep expertise (based on seniority level) of enterprise business processes and financial metrics. Knowledge of standard ERPs (SAP, Oracle) and process areas (Inventory Management, Order to Cash, Procure to Pay, Accounts Payable) is a strong plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Ability to steer customer workshops, present findings to management, manage stakeholder expectations, and deliver outcomes in the face of adversity and ambiguity. Comfortable working with both technical and business audiences.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills with a value-driven orientation. Ability to translate business requirements into technical solutions and quantify business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learning agility: &lt;/strong&gt;Willingness to continuously develop expertise through experimentation. Comfort with ambiguity and evolving tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s in Technology Management, Business Informatics, Computer Science, Engineering, Business Administration, or a comparable field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;Fluency in English and German required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel&lt;/strong&gt;: Willingness to travel to customer location up to 50%, according to customer requirement and project delivery phases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact—understanding our customers&#39; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our Deployment Engineers and Deployment Architects pair deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: initial value realization, adoption, and the long-term success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Deployment Architect, you are the technical authority for our strategic accounts within Celonis delivery. You shape how Celonis solutions are designed, architected, and delivered across your portfolio of strategic customer engagements. You define what good delivery looks like - setting architectural standards, designing end-to-end solution strategies, and ensuring that AI-augmented and agentic workflows are deployed effectively at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You operate at the intersection of deep platform expertise, domain knowledge, and customer strategy. You are equally comfortable leading a technical design review with Celonis engineers and presenting a transformation roadmap to a customer’s C-suite. You bridge the gap between pre-sales and post-sales, ensuring that what was promised can be delivered - and often shaping the promise itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries significant organizational leverage. You set delivery patterns that other teams follow. You define how AI agents should be orchestrated for complex, multi-workstream engagements. You work in close collaboration with Deployment Engineers and raise the bar for the entire practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Architecture &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Services scoping in pre-sales, ensuring the right Services are positioned in line with the Celonis solution architecture proposed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end Celonis solution architectures for complex enterprise deployments, spanning multiple process areas, business units, and geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technical blueprint for how the Celonis platform integrates with customer systems, data strategies, and transformation goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing secure, scalable architectures tailored to complex enterprise requirements, optimizing for long-term usage growth and high concurrency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make architectural trade-off decisions: build vs. configure, custom vs. standard, phased vs. big-bang - with clear rationale tied to customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own solution quality &amp;amp; outcome delivery across engagements, conducting design reviews, and ensuring delivery teams follow architectural standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Orchestration &amp;amp; Delivery Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design how AI deployment agents (Apollo) should be used across complex, multi-workstream engagements, defining agent workflows, validation checkpoints, and quality gates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable specifications, templates, and patterns that enable Deployment Engineers to direct AI agents more effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneer new delivery approaches that leverage AI to compress timelines, improve quality, or unlock use cases that were previously impractical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set standards for AI output validation, ensuring the organization maintains quality as delivery accelerates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior technical advisor to strategic customers, building trusted relationships with VP and C-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer business challenges into Celonis platform strategies, identifying high-impact use cases and defining success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pre-sales by providing technical credibility in complex deals, validating solution feasibility, and shaping project scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers through their Process Intelligence maturity journey, advising on platform expansion, AI readiness, and organizational change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage the broader ecosystem of Celonis experts to remove potential blockers in customer engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish deep, technical advisor relationships with customer stakeholders (Lead Data Engineers and Architects, Head of Data Intelligence, Head of Business Transformation) to provide technical reassurance and maintain &quot;Expert-to-Expert&quot; alignment during the course of the deployment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Successful Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work together with Deployment Engineers on delivery projects to implement the most complex and cutting edge use cases for our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of the newest technologies Celonis has to offer and own the implementation of early stage products for our customers, ensuring close feedback cycles with Product &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review Solution(s) Blueprint to ensure quality, scalability and production readiness of business critical and operational use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Depth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain deep expertise in one or more process domains (e.g., Supply Chain, Order to Cash, Procure to Pay, IT Service Management) or industry verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate domain knowledge into scalable solution patterns, reference architectures, and best practices that the broader team can leverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and standardize high-value use cases within your domain in collaboration with the Deployment Engineer, collaborating with Product and Business Apps teams to shape the platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring: define what great looks like for the Deployment job family, conduct interviews, and calibrate candidate assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge across the organization through internal enablement sessions, documentation, and community of practice leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the link with Product &amp;amp; Engineering to feed customer insights and field experience back into platform development, and to influence the platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Distinguishes This Role from Deployment Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope: You work across multiple engagements and shape solutions across a portfolio/cluster/industry vertical (4+ concurrent clients)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Practice Development: your Scope allows you to identify and set standards that other teams follow - for solution architecture, AI orchestration patterns, and delivery quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge: You span pre-sales and post-sales, ensuring continuity between what’s sold and what’s delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Force multiplier: Your work multiplies the effectiveness of Deployment Engineers rather than substituting for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualifications You Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;8+ years in technical consulting, solution architecture, or delivery leadership within enterprise software, consulting firms, or system integrators. At least 3 years in a senior or lead technical role with multi-stakeholder responsibility in large-scale projects at tier-1 organizations (e.g. digital twin implementations, global AI transformations, near-real-time data pipelines, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven ability to design complex, multi-component solutions that span data integration, process intelligence, automation, and AI, while remaining grounded in the “so-what” of a customer’s process. Deep understanding of enterprise architecture patterns and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform mastery: &lt;/strong&gt;Expert-level knowledge of the Celonis platform, including the Process Intelligence Graph, data modeling, advanced PQL, automation and orchestration engine, and AI modules. Ability to push the platform’s boundaries via a working knowledge of Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; agent orchestration: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to design AI-augmented delivery workflows leveraging frontier tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, etc.). Experience with context engineering, multi-agent system design, or AI validation at scale. Ability to define how AI should be used, not just use it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Deep knowledge in at least one major process domain or industry vertical. Ability to translate domain expertise into scalable solution patterns and credible customer advisory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer executive presence: &lt;/strong&gt;Track record of building trusted advisor relationships with VP and C-level stakeholders. Ability to present transformation strategies, defend architectural decisions, and navigate complex organizational dynamics. Demonstrated experience navigating complex IT landscapes and communicating technical trade-offs to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting &amp;amp; communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Exceptional ability to translate between technical and business audiences. Experience leading workshops, design sessions, and strategic reviews with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; mentoring: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to raise the performance of teams around you. Experience mentoring technical staff, setting quality standards, and contributing to organizational capability development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s in Computer Science, Engineering, Technology Management, Business Informatics, or a comparable field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;Fluency in English and German required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Infrastructure teams build the foundation that engineers at Wolt, Deliveroo, and DoorDash build on: the compute, cloud, and networking capabilities that enable Engineering teams to develop, deploy, and run services at global scale. The EU Compute team has a specific focus on provisioning, scaling, and the efficient operation of GPU infrastructure for AI and ML workloads. This is an emerging space with plenty of greenfield opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Staff Engineer to be a hands-on technical leader for this infrastructure work that crosses team and brand boundaries. You&#39;ll set direction for the platform, turn complex problems into deliverable plans, write and review production code, and help other engineers make sound decisions. It&#39;s an exciting time to join: we&#39;re building a global platform and the choices made now will shape how engineers across the company ship for years.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What you’ll be doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own some of the hardest infrastructure problems in the company and make the platform easier to operate and safer to build on. We’re determined to build great platform products and user experiences, and you’ll be pivotal in making this reality.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Day-to-day in this role you’ll:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction for shared AWS and Kubernetes infrastructure, balancing reliability, security, developer experience, and cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead substantial initiatives from design through rollout and operation, coordinating dependencies and decisions across Wolt, Deliveroo and DoorDash, focusing on workloads targeting GPUs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evolve Kubernetes clusters, cloud networking, identity, and infrastructure provisioning to support growing and varied workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build reusable Terraform patterns and self-service tooling that help teams provision infrastructure safely and consistently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve deployment and operational practices, including GitOps, observability, capacity planning, incident response and recovery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use production signals and developer feedback to find platform friction, choose where to invest and measure whether changes actually help.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with supporting the platform, with deep focus on GPU infrastructure, as well as broad focus on compute in general.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gracefully sunset legacy infrastructure and tooling, and create strategies to reduce toil.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers through design reviews, implementation and incidents, raising the quality of infrastructure work across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our humble expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience building and operating Kubernetes and AWS infrastructure in production. Familiarity with GPU workloads and orchestration is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering skills: you use Go, Python or a similar language to build maintainable tools and automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with infrastructure as code (we use Terraform) and with designing systems that other engineering teams depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading complex technical work across teams, including architectural decisions, delivery, and operational follow-through. You have the breadth to collaborate and design across team and domain boundaries, and the depth to have hands-on impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong judgment on trade-offs in distributed systems, networking, security, reliability, and cloud cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication, and the ability to bring people together around a practical technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scope and influence.&lt;/strong&gt; Shape infrastructure used globally, while staying close to the engineering. Your work will help product teams ship services with greater ease and confidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real problems at global scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Multi-cluster Kubernetes, AI / ML workloads, cloud networking, GitOps, and progressive delivery across a global company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomy and ownership.&lt;/strong&gt; Set direction and see it through from design to operation, with the backing of a global engineering organisation spanning Europe and the US.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth.&lt;/strong&gt; Room to expand your scope, whether through deeper technical leadership or broader cross-domain influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great people.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with talented engineers and leaders in a diverse, international environment, mentoring and learning from others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Onboarding Operations team (Restaurant/Retail Onboarding) is the heart and soul of Wolt. We ensure that we set all our (restaurant and retail) partners up for success through a seamless onboarding, menu and photo experience. As Wolt grows in both size and scope of our offering, the strength of our engine must grow with it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the Team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a member of our team, you will master the core functions, including onboarding partners and managing cross-functional partners both internally and externally for the German market. You will interact with partners, welcome them to Wolt and ensure their experience is seamless and they are set up for success!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to help shape something extraordinary in an international environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high learning and growth curve in a global technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An attractive salary and flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent work in a dynamic team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A flat hierarchy in a start-up atmosphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discount on Wolt orders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Public transport allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness allowance (Urban Sports Club)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly (virtual) all-hands meetings and regular team events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours + 30 days paid holiday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Are you excited about this opportunity because you will...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate with various teams within the organisation to coordinate a seamless merchant onboarding and service experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Inform partners about processes and procedures via form, email and phone, mostly in German language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor processes and track progress through Monday.com and other Wolt software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn, master and improve our systems, tools and processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our modest expectations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a positive attitude and an entrepreneurial spirit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a problem solver - you enjoy identifying problems and developing creative approaches to solving challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are customer-centric - you have a customer-centric mentality and are able to work with people of different technical levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have multiple years of experience in sales, support, operations or account management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are able to set goals and achieve them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are organised, meticulous and have impeccable communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You work well in independent and diverse team environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are ready for a challenge and feel comfortable as a team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have analytical as well as critical thinking skills&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are fluent in German and English (at least C1) - any other language is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hintergrund der Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Unser Onboarding Operations Team (Restaurant/Retail Onboarding) ist das Herz und die Seele von Wolt. Wir stellen sicher, dass &lt;strong&gt;wir alle unsere&lt;/strong&gt; (Restaurant und Retail-)&lt;strong&gt;Partner*innen durch ein nahtloses Onboarding-, Menü- und Fotoerlebnis auf Erfolgskurs bringen&lt;/strong&gt;. Da Wolt sowohl in der Größe als auch im Umfang unseres Angebots wächst, muss auch die Stärke unserer Onboarding Engine mitwachsen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Mitglied unseres Teams beherrschst Du die Kernfunktionen, einschließlich des Onboardings von Partner*innen und des Managements funktionsübergreifender Partner*innen sowohl intern als auch extern auf dem deutschen Markt. &lt;strong&gt;Du wirst mit den Partner*innen interagieren, sie bei Wolt willkommen heißen und sicherstellen, dass ihre Erfahrung nahtlos ist und sie für den Erfolg gerüstet sind!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir bieten:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Möglichkeit, in einem &lt;strong&gt;internationalen Umfeld&lt;/strong&gt; etwas Außergewöhnliches mitzugestalten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine hohe &lt;strong&gt;Lern- und Wachstumskurve&lt;/strong&gt; in einem global agierenden Technologieunternehmen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ein &lt;strong&gt;attraktives Gehalt&lt;/strong&gt; und &lt;strong&gt;flexible Arbeitszeiten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Eigenständiges Arbeiten&lt;/strong&gt; in einem dynamischen Team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eine &lt;strong&gt;flache Hierarchie&lt;/strong&gt; in einer Start-up-Atmosphäre&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rabatt&lt;/strong&gt; auf Wolt-Bestellungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ÖPNV-Zuschuss&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness-Zuschuss (Urban Sports Club)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wöchentliche (virtuelle) All-Hands-Meetings und regelmäßige &lt;strong&gt;Teamevents&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Arbeitszeiten &lt;strong&gt;+ 30 Tage bezahlter Urlaub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bist du begeistert von dieser Gelegenheit, denn Du wirst...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mit verschiedenen Teams innerhalb der Organisation kommunizieren, um ein nahtloses Händler-Onboarding und Service-Erlebnis zu koordinieren&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Partner*innen über Prozesse und Abläufe per Formular, E-Mail und Telefon informieren, meisten in deutscher Sprache&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prozesse überwachen und den Fortschritt durch Monday.com und anderer Wolt-Software verfolgen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unserer Systeme, Tools und Prozesse erlernen, beherrschen und verbessern&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unsere bescheidenen Erwartungen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast eine positive Einstellung und einen unternehmerischen Geist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist ein*e Problemlöser*in - Du hast Spaß daran, Probleme zu erkennen und kreative Ansätze zur Lösung von Herausforderungen zu entwickeln&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist kundenorientiert – du hast eine kundenorientierte Mentalität und bist in der Lage, mit Menschen unterschiedlichen technischen Niveaus zusammenzuarbeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast mehrere Jahre Erfahrung im Vertrieb, Support, Operations oder Account Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist in der Lage, dir Ziele zu setzen und diese auch zu erreichen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist organisiert, sorgfältig und verfügst über tadellose Kommunikationsfähigkeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest gut in unabhängigen und vielfältigen Teamumgebungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist bereit für eine Herausforderung und fühlst dich als Teamplayer wohl&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du verfügst über analytische Fähigkeiten und kritisches Denken&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du sprichst fließend Deutsch und Englisch (mindestens C1) – jede weitere Sprache ist ein Plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/GoL541_xj9w&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;(Senior) Product Marketing Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Berlin, Germany&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contract:&lt;/strong&gt; 12 month, fixed term, full time, on-site&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Product Growth team within Run My Business turns new product launches into measurable merchant growth by connecting product strategy with go to market execution across SumUp&#39;s portfolio. Booking has just launched as a premium offering and the beauty industry has become a top priority category. &lt;br&gt;With both merchant and end-consumer facing interaction points, this role will help lead the charge by building and executing on a go to market playbook. It&#39;s a chance to shape positioning, launch readiness and merchant adoption for a product area SumUp is investing in heavily, working closely with Product, Go-to-market and Growth teams to accelerate SumUp&#39;s hold into the appointment management industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own positioning, narrative and messaging for Booking with a focus on the beauty industry, including the Local marketplace, across marketing and in product touchpoints&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead go to market readiness for every Booking and Local release, including sales and support material, web updates, frequently asked questions, pricing and messaging ahead of launch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and support frontline sales and operations teams so they can confidently sell and support new features from day one&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed merchant, sales and support feedback into product roadmap discussions and help the team prioritise what to build next&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track feature adoption and activation after launch and use the data to refine go to market and channel strategy by market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English, written and spoken, with the confidence to work across global and local teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of defining positioning, messaging frameworks and go to market plans in a product marketing or GTM role, ideally in SaaS, payments or marketplace businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience feeding merchant, sales or support insight into product roadmap decisions, not only executing go to market plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to coordinate launches across Product, Sales, Growth and Operations without a formal reporting line into those teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort building a competitive view of positioning, pricing and segmentation across multiple markets, and using adoption and conversion data to prioritise effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why you should join SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌎 Opportunity to work with SumUppers globally on large-scale fintech products used by millions of businesses worldwide, from our Berlin office. This involves an office-first setup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌈 Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion: be part of a workplace that values and promotes diversity, fostering an inclusive environment where everyone&#39;s perspectives are respected and embraced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;📚 A dedicated annual L&amp;amp;D budget of €2000 for your individual development, which can be used to attend conferences and/or advance your career through further education&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;💶 A corporate pension scheme where we match up to 20% of your contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🏖 Generous time off: enjoy 28 days of paid leave plus public holidays and special leave days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🎁 Numerous other benefits such as Urban Sports Club subsidy, Kita placement assistance, subsidised office lunches&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🌴 Break4me: 1-month sabbatical after 3 years of service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;🔗 Referral Bonus: earn additional rewards by referring talented individuals to join the SumUp team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About SumUp&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Be empowered to do more that matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SumUp, we&#39;re on a mission to empower small businesses across the globe by providing simple and affordable tools that allow them to thrive. Today, over 4 million businesses in 39 markets rely on SumUp as their financial partner to manage payments, finance and customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to small businesses is reflected in&lt;a href=&quot;https://youtu.be/9DG64C3moeQ?si=YpcWuBNBTOQPzeLI&quot;&gt; our diverse team&lt;/a&gt; of over 4,000 SumUppers from over 90 nationalities, united by global collaboration and an innovative mindset.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/culture/&quot;&gt; Our core values&lt;/a&gt; lay the foundation for who we are and what we stand for, shaping our work culture and driving our success. We foster inclusivity and a continuous learning culture, providing a safe space for personal and professional growth. Our differences make us unique and strong as we strive to create an environment where everyone belongs and feels supported, no matter how they identify.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SumUp is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity employer, actively seeking and embracing diversity in our workforce. We don&#39;t make hiring or employment decisions based on race, colour, religion or religious belief, ethnic or national origin, nationality, sex, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability, age or any other basis protected by applicable laws or prohibited by company policy. Our commitment extends beyond recruitment to creating a safe and respectful workplace where harassment of any form is strictly prohibited. Discover more about our culture and opportunities on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.sumup.com/careers/&quot;&gt; careers website&lt;/a&gt;, and follow our journey on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/sumup/&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/insidesumup/&quot;&gt; Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tiktok.com/@insidesumup&quot;&gt; TikTok&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Application Tip&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We recognise that candidates feel they need to meet 100% of the job criteria in order to apply for a job. Please note that this is only a guide. If you don’t tick every box, it’s ok too because it means you have room to learn and develop your career at SumUp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;h2&gt;About The Opportunity&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Solution Engineers (f/m/d) are close partners of our sales team and own key components of the sales process, including infrastructural/architectural discovery, collaborative solution design, and technical validation. Solution Engineers may travel up to 50% of the time and will have the opportunity to work with teams worldwide, from visionary brands to innovative digital agencies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What To Expect?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work directly with our Account Executives to support DACH customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support our sales team in helping prospects understand what’s possible with Contentful and how it compares to older legacy technologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand prospects&#39; project requirements, help prospects validate these requirements against our platform, identify and mitigate technical and business risks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create product demonstrations and assist with technical evaluations to demonstrate how our platform solves identified business problems and integrates into a prospect’s technology stack&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate prospect and customer needs and product feedback to product management, marketing, and sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Solution Architects and Customer Success Managers to ensure that newly-signed customers successfully implement and launch their projects with Contentful&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You Need To Be Successful&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English and German are required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The desire to work in a fast-paced environment, across multiple opportunities and teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-5 years experience as a Sales/Solution Engineer/Architect or Solution Consultant for a cloud-based, growth-oriented PaaS or SaaS company; or 5-10 years experience as a developer working on digital experience delivery utilising marketing technology platforms focused on CMS, Commerce, Personalisation, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong presentation skills that demonstrate the ability to clearly and sympathetically convey business and technical knowledge to our varying personas that are both marketing-focused and technical-focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience with current web technologies (JavaScript frameworks, static site generators, REST APIs, CDNs, CI/CD, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high degree of emotional intelligence to help navigate meetings with multiple customer stakeholders with varying degrees of engagement and influence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural curiosity for how technology drives change and how that transfers into business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice To Have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with a Content Management Platform or similar technology (MarTech).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience with solution selling methodologies and/or value-based selling techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding the core concepts of MACH products and Composable architectures and how they relate to Contentful’s product and market position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More details about our company benefits can be found at the following link:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;link__new-tab&quot; href=&quot;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.salesforcebenefits.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contentful is now officially part of Salesforce.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Unleash Your Potential&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you join Salesforce, you’ll be limitless in all areas of your life. Our benefits and resources support you to find balance and be your best, and our AI agents accelerate your impact so you can do your best. Together, we’ll bring the power of Agentforce to organizations of all sizes and deliver amazing experiences that customers love. Apply today to not only shape the future — but to redefine what’s possible — for yourself, for AI, and the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need reasonable accommodations at any point during the application or interview process, please let your Recruiter know.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Salesforce is an equal opportunity employer and maintains a policy of non-discrimination with all employees and applicants for employment. What does that mean exactly? It means that at Salesforce, we believe in equality for all. And we believe we can lead the path to equality in part by creating a workplace that’s inclusive, and free from discrimination.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/know-your-rights-workplace-discrimination-illegal&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Know your rights: workplace discrimination is illegal.&lt;/a&gt; Any employee or potential employee will be assessed on the basis of merit, competence and qualifications – without regard to race, religion, color, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, transgender status, age, disability, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other classifications protected by law. This policy applies to current and prospective employees, no matter where they are in their Salesforce employment journey. It also applies to recruiting, hiring, job assignment, compensation, promotion, benefits, training, assessment of job performance, discipline, termination, and everything in between. Recruiting, hiring, and promotion decisions at Salesforce are fair and based on merit. The same goes for compensation, benefits, promotions, transfers, reduction in workforce, recall, training, and education.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #3e3e3e;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please be aware of scammers who may fraudulently claim to be from Contentful. These types of fraud can occur through copycat websites, fake email addresses claiming to be from our company, or social media. We do not ask for your personal information, such as bank account numbers, identification numbers, etc., through social media or chat-based apps, nor do we request or send money to purchase business equipment. If you suspect fraud, please report it to your local authorities and contact us at &lt;a ----- ----- &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #3e3e3e;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;with any information you may have.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;By clicking “Apply for this job,” I acknowledge that I have read the “&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.contentful.com/legal/us/privacy-notice-to-candidates/privacy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Contentful’s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;” and hereby consent to the collection, processing, use, and storage of my personal information as described therein.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

Werde Teil unseres Teams&nbsp;
Apaleo ist die offene Hospitality-Plattform, die Hotels die Freiheit gibt, ihre Technologie so zusammenzustellen, wie sie sie wirklich brauchen. Wir waren von Anfang an API-first, und jetzt denken wir unsere Plattform AI-first weiter: Mit Agent Hub, dem ersten KI-Agenten-Marktplatz der Hotellerie, geben wir Hotels die Freiheit, autonome Agenten für ihr Business einzusetzen. Denselben Anspruch haben wir an unser eigenes Finance: Wir bauen es konsequent AI-native auf.&nbsp;
Dafür suchen wir eine*n Senior Bilanzbuchhalter*in, die oder der fundiertes Buchhaltungs-Know-how mit echter Begeisterung für agentische Workflows verbindet und mit uns Strukturen, Prozesse und Kontrollen für ein skalierbares Finance aufbaut. Du übernimmst zunächst eigenverantwortlich das operative Tagesgeschäft in enger Zusammenarbeit mit unserem dreiköpfigen Finance-Team. Mittelfristig verschiebt sich dein Fokus vom Buchen zum Orchestrieren: KI-Agenten übernehmen Belegverarbeitung, Kontierung und Abstimmungen, du definierst die Regeln, überwachst die Ergebnisse und verantwortest Qualität und Compliance als Human in the Loop. Mittelfristig gestaltest du mit uns den Weg zu einem AI-native Accounting- und ERP-Setup und wirst zur zentralen Ansprechperson für alle buchhalterischen Fragen bei Apaleo.&nbsp;
So bringst du dich ein:

Du bearbeitest eigenverantwortlich sämtliche in der Finanzbuchhaltung anfallenden Geschäftsvorfälle (Rechnungskontrolle, Debitoren-, Kreditoren-, Anlagen-, Sachkonten- und Bankbuchhaltung) und stellst eine jederzeit prüfungssichere, GoBD-konforme Datenbasis für Reporting und Steuerung sicher. &nbsp;
Du übernimmst zusammen mit unserem Team die Erstellung von Monats-, Quartals- und Jahresabschlüssen nach HGB mit festen Deadlines und treibst einen schnelleren, zunehmend automatisierten Close (Fast Close) voran. &nbsp;
Du konzipierst und implementierst agentische Workflows für wiederkehrende Prozesse wie Belegerfassung, Kontierung, Bankabstimmung, Rückstellungen und Intercompany und gestaltest damit, wie sich deine eigene Rolle über die Zeit entwickelt: weg vom manuellen Buchen, hin zum Orchestrieren, Überwachen und Freigeben der Arbeit von KI-Agenten.&nbsp;
Du arbeitest eng mit externen Steuerberater*innen und Wirtschaftsprüfer*innen zusammen. &nbsp;
Du gestaltest mit, wie sich unser Finance-Tech-Stack mittelfristig zu einem AI-native Accounting- und ERP-Setup entwickelt: von Tool-Auswahl und Datenmodell über saubere Stammdaten und Schnittstellen bis zu skalierbaren End-to-End-Prozessen, die mit uns mitwachsen. &nbsp;
Du wirst über Zeit zur zentralen Ansprechperson für alle buchhalterischen Fragen bei Apaleo und bringst die Erfahrung und Übersicht mit, um Themen auch über dein eigenes Gebiet hinaus einzuordnen.&nbsp;

Das bringst du mit:
Must-haves&nbsp;

Abgeschlossene Aus-/Weiterbildung zum/zur Bilanzbuchhalter*in (IHK) oder eine vergleichbare Qualifikation, mit mehrjähriger praktischer Erfahrung in der Finanzbuchhaltung. &nbsp;
Sehr gute Kenntnisse im deutschen Handelsrecht (HGB); IFRS-Kenntnisse sind von Vorteil. &nbsp;
Sehr gute DATEV- und Excel-Kenntnisse sowie ein ausgeprägtes Prozess- und Systemverständnis: Du denkst in Datenflüssen, nicht in Einzelbuchungen. &nbsp;
Erfahrung mit Monats-, Quartals- und Jahresabschlüssen unter echtem Zeit- und Deadlinedruck im Unternehmen.&nbsp;
Nahezu muttersprachliches Deutsch (für die Kommunikation mit Steuerberater*innen, Wirtschaftsprüfer*innen und Behörden sowie für statutarische Meldungen) und gutes Arbeitsenglisch (für die Zusammenarbeit mit Legal und weiteren internationalen Stakeholdern). &nbsp;
Strukturierte, eigenständige und proaktive Arbeitsweise, du sprichst Unklarheiten direkt an, statt sie auflaufen zu lassen. &nbsp;
Du bist mindestens zweimal pro Woche in unserem Büro in München, idealerweise wohnst du bereits in München oder im Umkreis. &nbsp;
Du bist komfortabel mit Prozessambiguität und schnellem Wandel, triffst pragmatische 80/20-Entscheidungen und lieferst gleichzeitig hohe Qualität, wo es darauf ankommt.&nbsp;
Echte Neugier auf KI: Du nutzt Tools wie ChatGPT oder Claude bereits im Arbeitsalltag, prüfst ihre Ergebnisse kritisch und willst Prozesse grundlegend neu denken, statt sie nur zu digitalisieren.&nbsp;

Nice-to-haves&nbsp;

Du hast bereits agentische Workflows oder Automatisierungen im Finanzbereich aufgesetzt (z. B. mit LLMs, RPA oder Tools wie n8n oder Make) und kannst konkret zeigen, wie sich dadurch Qualität, Durchlaufzeit und Close verbessert haben. &nbsp;
Erfahrung in einem Software-/SaaS-Unternehmen oder einem wachstumsstarken Start-up/Scale-up; Vertrautheit mit SaaS-Kennzahlen. &nbsp;
Erfahrung in einem Private-Equity-Umfeld. &nbsp;
Berührungspunkte mit Verrechnungspreisthemen (Transfer Pricing). &nbsp;
Vertrautheit mit Employer-of-Record-Strukturen (EOR) und ihren

Das kannst du von uns erwarten:

Ein vielfältiges und internationales Team&nbsp;– Arbeite mit engagierten Experten aus verschiedenen Fachbereichen und mit unterschiedlichem Hintergrund zusammen und entwickele eine wirklich globale Lösung.
Flache Hierarchie und flexible Struktur&nbsp;– Genieße Autonomie und Eigenverantwortung in einem Umfeld, in dem Zusammenarbeit mehr geschätzt wird als starre Hierarchien.
Eine Schlüsselrolle in einem schnell wachsenden Unternehmen&nbsp;– Werde Teil eines der vielversprechendsten internationalen Software Unternehmens der Hotellerie im Herzen Münchens und gestalte den Finanzbereich aktiv mit.
Faire und transparente Vergütung&nbsp;– Profitiere von einem klaren Peer-Review-System und einem Career Progression Plänen, der Ihr Wachstum unterstützen.
Ein AI-native Arbeitsumfeld: Arbeite mit aktuellen KI-Tools und echtem Gestaltungsspielraum, um Finance von Grund auf neu zu denken. &nbsp;
Hybrides Arbeiten mit Teamtagen in München: Mindestens zweimal pro Woche arbeiten wir gemeinsam im Münchner Büro, den Rest der Woche gestaltest du flexibel. &nbsp;
Ansprechende Team-Events&nbsp;– Nimm an unseren Teamessen, Meet-ups und den legendären Partys teil.
30 Tage Urlaub&nbsp;– Tanke neue Energie und genieße eine großzügige Urlaubsregelung.
Kostenlose Nutzung öffentlicher Verkehrsmittel in Deutschland&nbsp;– Mit dem Deutschlandticket Job bist du bestens versorgt.
Zugang zu EGYM Wellness Pass&nbsp;– Nutze eine Vielzahl von Fitness- und Wellnessstudios, um dein körperliches und geistiges Wohlbefinden zu fördern.

Bereit, mit uns durchzustarten?
Dann freuen wir uns auf Deine Bewerbung! Du kannst Dich direkt über unsere Karriereseite mit Deinem Lebenslauf bewerben.
Warum Apaleo?
Bei Apaleo zu arbeiten bedeutet mehr als nur eine Stelle anzutreten: Es geht darum, echte Veränderungen in der Hotellerie voranzutreiben. Deine Beiträge gestalten unsere innovative, API-first und zunehmend AI-first Plattform direkt mit, beeinflussen unternehmensweite Entscheidungen und helfen, die Zukunft der Hospitality-Technologie neu zu definieren. Bei Apaleo zählt deine Meinung, deine Ideen werden geschätzt, und dein Einfluss ist spürbar. Werde Teil eines Teams, in dem deine Arbeit den Fortschritt vorantreibt, Zusammenarbeit Innovationen hervorbringt und Wachstum ein gemeinsames Ziel ist.&nbsp;
Wir sind stolz darauf, ein Arbeitgeber zu sein, der Chancengleichheit und Gleichstellung fördert und sich für einen vielfältigen, integrativen und einladenden Arbeitsplatz einsetzt. Wir begrüßen Bewerbungen von Menschen aller Herkunft, unabhängig von Rasse, Hautfarbe, Religion, Geschlechtsidentität oder -ausdruck, Geschlecht, nationaler Herkunft, Alter, Familienstand, Behinderung oder anderen Merkmalen, die durch geltendes Recht geschützt sind. Deine personenbezogenen Daten werden mit größter Sorgfalt und in Übereinstimmung mit der DSGVO und den einschlägigen Datenschutzbestimmungen behandelt. Wir begrüßen Unterschiede und glauben, dass Vielfalt unser Team bereichert und Innovationen vorantreibt.Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A career driven by you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Join AutoScout24 Group&amp;nbsp;and experience life in the fast lane.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;not just leading the market;&amp;nbsp;we’re&amp;nbsp;creating it.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;constantly innovating,&amp;nbsp;evolving&amp;nbsp;and transforming things for our customers.&amp;nbsp;We’re&amp;nbsp;driven,&amp;nbsp;ambitious&amp;nbsp;and determined to do our best&amp;nbsp;work,&amp;nbsp;together. For a career that&amp;nbsp;doesn’t&amp;nbsp;stand still, where you can put your ideas in the driving seat and change the way the world moves, join our global community.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior Creative Strategist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, you will shape how our brand shows up across paid social, YouTube, creator partnerships, and organic channels.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your focus will be turning our brand strategy into&amp;nbsp;clear, practical creative direction that works in-market. This means defining how the brand comes to life across ads, creators, and content formats in a way that is consistent, distinctive, and effective.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will work closely with creators, agencies, and internal teams to bring that direction to life through high-quality short-form video and social creative. In partnership with the paid social team, you will help define the creative testing roadmap, using campaign insights and performance learnings to understand what resonates and continuously improve creative effectiveness over time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Paid social and online video are key channels for rapid learning and iteration. You will use those learnings to strengthen how we show up across channels and help evolve how the brand is expressed going forward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
