&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Tensordyne (formerly Recogni)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is transforming our world. It can perform cognitive functions that previously only humans could do, such as perceiving interactions across different modalities and environments - with the ability to quickly learn and then solve complex problems. Tensordyne is an AI system solution company that builds very high-performance, low-power generative AI inference systems. Our mission, through the creation of custom silicon, hardware and software, is to enable multimodal Generative AI inference acceleration at scale, with safe, sustainable, high-performance systems for our hyperscaler and neocloud data center customers. We are at the leading edge of advancing the latest research and product improvements for generative Al inference solutions that will make Al even more advantageous for compelling new generative AI applications.Tensordyne is a well funded, fast-paced startup company with headquarters in both Sunnyvale, CA, and Munich, Germany. We also have many talented team members working remotely across North America and Europe. We take care of our people and their families with comprehensive benefits, competitive compensation, flexible spending options, and recognition programs, because building category-defining technology starts with a healthy, supported team. Come join us as we shape the future of multimodal generative artificial intelligence!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How much numerical precision does an LLM need, and where in the model architecture does it matter most? When does quantization improve runtime, and what does it cost in model quality?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;motivated working student&lt;/strong&gt; to help turn these questions into experiments and experiments into maintainable code. You’ll explore optimization methods and build reusable evaluation tooling. You’ll work closely with our quantization, compiler, and runtime engineers, and your findings will directly influence how we optimize models for Tensordyne hardware.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model quality evaluation:&lt;/strong&gt; Measure how low-precision computation affects performance on coding and reasoning benchmarks. Diagnose where quantization has the greatest impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Quantization research:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement and compare post-training quantization methods to improve inference efficiency while preserving task accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build reproducible tooling:&lt;/strong&gt; Automate evaluations, track configurations and results, and make experiments accessible to engineers and AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Measure runtime performance:&lt;/strong&gt; Characterize latency, throughput, and memory usage to understand bottlenecks under different deployment scenarios.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A first project could involve exploring the quality–performance Pareto frontier of a Qwen or LlaMa model. You’ll experiment with 16-bit, 8-bit, and 4-bit quantization configurations to find the best runtime-quality tradeoff.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current enrollment in Computer Science, Mathematics, Electrical Engineering, Machine Learning, or a related master’s degree program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Python and PyTorch skills, including the ability to understand and modify model implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective use of AI coding tools and critical review of their output.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An experimental mindset: you can formulate hypotheses, design comparisons, and draw careful conclusions from noisy results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication and the ability to present experimental findings and technical tradeoffs to the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong pluses:&lt;/strong&gt; experience with quantization, LLM evaluation, performance profiling, or inference optimization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is for you if you &lt;strong&gt;thrive on responsibility, learn quickly, and are naturally proactive&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a deep-tech team building the next generation of AI inference systems. Put your university knowledge into practice with leading open-source LLMs, deepen your understanding of quantization and inference optimization, and build skills in experimental design, software engineering, and AI coding tools. You’ll own a focused project, receive close mentorship from experienced engineers, and have room to explore ideas that shape our optimization methods.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tensordyne&#39;s culture was built on the following values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put people first. We only succeed when our people succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ethics and integrity always. Be open, honest, and respectful of everyone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think Big. Be ambitious and have audacious goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Aim for excellence. Quality and excellence count in everything we do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own it and get it done. Results matter!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make each person better together than they would be as an individual.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace each other’s differences, and embrace that there will be differences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tensordyne is an equal opportunity employer. We believe diverse teams are better equipped to solve complex problems and build exceptional technology. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to age, color, gender identity or expression, marital status, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, race, religion, pregnancy, sexual orientation, or any other characteristic protected by applicable laws, regulations, and ordinances.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A note to recruitment agencies: Please do not contact Tensordyne employees or leaders regarding this role. We do not accept unsolicited agency resumes and are not responsible for fees associated with unsolicited submissions.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Company&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GROPYUS is a technology-based construction company focused on building multi-story residential buildings. Thanks to its prefabricated building system with a wide range of design options, automated offsite construction, and fully digitalized processes, the company is able to create resilient timber housing quickly and cost-effectively. GROPYUS is using scalable construction and manufacturing solutions to tap into a future market, strengthen Europe’s innovation capacity, and play a substantial role in improving sustainability. The company delivers its multi-family houses as a complete and turnkey solution. The combination of technology, construction, robotics, and manufacturing expertise means buildings can be created in a fully digitalized end-to-end process. The building system is based on versatile wall and slab elements, making it easier to optimize land use, customize plans, and build fast with both off-site construction and on-site assembly. This system is complemented by the Building Operating System–developed in-house.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über die Rolle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Senior Architekt:in mit Schwerpunkt in den Leistungsphasen 2–4 bist du Teil unseres interdisziplinären Planungsteams bei GROPYUS und arbeitest aktiv an der Entwicklung und Umsetzung innovativer Wohngebäude mit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Du begleitest unsere Projekte von der Entwurfsplanung bis zur Genehmigungsplanung und arbeitest dabei eng mit internen Fachplaner:innen, Projektleitungen sowie unserem Building System Team zusammen. Durch deine strukturierte und lösungsorientierte Arbeitsweise trägst du dazu bei, hochwertige, effiziente und nachhaltige Wohngebäude zu realisieren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In deiner Rolle übernimmst du Verantwortung für die planerische Ausarbeitung von Projekten, koordinierst Schnittstellen innerhalb des Planungsteams und bringst deine Erfahrung im Wohnungsbau sicher in die Projektarbeit ein. Der Schwerpunkt liegt auf einer qualitativ hochwertigen Planung, einer engen interdisziplinären Zusammenarbeit sowie der digitalen Planung in Revit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aufgaben und Verantwortlichkeiten&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erstellung und Bearbeitung von Entwurfs-, Genehmigungs- und Ausführungsgrundlagen in Revit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entwicklung architektonischer Lösungen unter Berücksichtigung technischer, funktionaler und wirtschaftlicher Anforderungen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Abstimmung und Koordination mit internen Fachplaner:innen sowie externen Projektbeteiligten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung bei der Erstellung von Präsentationen, Planungskonzepten und Genehmigungsunterlagen&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sicherstellung der Planungsqualität sowie Einhaltung projektbezogener Standards und Prozesse&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mitwirkung an der kontinuierlichen Weiterentwicklung unseres digitalen und seriellen Planungssystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Unterstützung der Projekt- und Planungsleitung bei organisatorischen und planerischen Aufgaben&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über dich&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfolgreich abgeschlossenes Studium der Architektur und Eintragung in die Architektenkammer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mindestens 5 Jahre Berufserfahrung in der Planung von Wohnungsbauprojekten, idealerweise Erfahrung in der Projektleitung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Kenntnisse in den Leistungsphasen LP2–LP4 nach HOAI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Kenntnisse in Revit und eine hohe Affinität zu digitaler Planung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung im mehrgeschossigen Wohnungsbau&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Erfahrung im Holzbau ist ein Plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strukturierte, sorgfältige und eigenverantwortliche Arbeitsweise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freude an der Zusammenarbeit in interdisziplinären Teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sehr gute Deutsch- und Englischkenntnisse in Wort und Schrift&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Was wir bieten:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Einen befristeten Vertrag (bis Juli 2027) mit 30 Urlaubstagen.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Flexible Arbeitsweise: Wir legen großen Wert auf regelmäßige persönliche Zusammenarbeit im Büro, und bieten auch die Möglichkeit zum Arbeiten im Homeoffice sowie die Option, bis zu 40 Tage im Jahr aus dem Ausland zu arbeiten.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Attraktive Zusatzleistungen: Wir bieten eine betriebliche Altersvorsorge, Sprachkurse (Englisch/Deutsch) und Mitarbeiterrabatte bei ausgewählten nachhaltigen Marken. Darüber hinaus unterstützen Dich unsere externen Partner im Bereich mentale Gesundheit, um Deine psychische Gesundheit durch anonyme Einzel- oder Gruppensitzungen zu stärken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Eigenverantwortung: Du kannst wirklich etwas bewirken – auf allen Ebenen unserer Organisation. Finde Lösungen, treibe sie voran, teste und implementiere sie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Die Chance, Teil von etwas Großem zu sein: Unsere Mission ist es, eine ganze Branche neu zu denken. Hilf uns dabei, das Bauwesen neu zu erfinden und nachhaltiges, erschwingliches Wohnen zu fördern.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;13&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Ein vielfältiges und bereicherndes Arbeitsumfeld: Werde ein geschätztes Mitglied eines wunderbar vielfältigen Teams von Menschen aus über 50 Ländern. Bei GROPYUS legen wir großen Wert auf Inklusion und sorgen dafür, dass sich jeder – unabhängig von seinem Hintergrund – als Teil der Gemeinschaft fühlt. So werden unsere Unterschiede zu Stärken, die uns als Team weiterbringen.&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Join us on our mission to design buildings as continuously evolving products to create the most exciting and affordable experience for all. We build for people and conserve the resources of our planet.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We can&#39;t wait to get to know you.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;For more information, visit our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://gropyus.com/&quot;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in Germany on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We’re always keen to hear from talented sales professionals. This is not a current vacancy, but if you’d like to be considered for future opportunities at Bitwarden, register your interest and we’ll contact you if a suitable role opens.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Bitwarden&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Bitwarden is the trusted identity security leader for millions of users worldwide, empowering enterprises, developers and individuals to securely manage and share sensitive information anywhere. Our password management, secrets management, and passwordless and passkey solutions make it easy for everyone to extend robust security across their devices. Bitwarden is headquartered in Santa Barbara, California, with a team located across the globe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What our Account Executives do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own a territory and an assigned quota, closing new business with a focus on organisations of 1,000+ employees&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prospect effectively and manage lead flow to build a strong pipeline (typically 3–5x coverage)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and forecast the pipeline accurately in our CRM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build territory plans that deliver both short-term and long-term revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, onboard and grow channel partners, including resellers, MSPs, VARs and integrators, and build joint business plans with measurable goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with marketing on events, programmes and campaigns that create demand among partners’ customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep sales leadership informed on channel pipeline and forecast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who we’d love to hear from&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–8 years of SaaS sales experience in new business or business development. Cyber security experience is a plus but not essential&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consistent track record of hitting annual quota, with specific customer wins you can talk about&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven success driving revenue through partners, with strong existing relationships with resellers, MSPs, VARs or integrators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to build relationships and influence decision makers at every level of a partner or customer organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a startup or high-growth company is desirable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who thrives in a fast-paced, collaborative environment and can work independently or as part of a team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills: listening, writing and presenting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident with CRM tools, Google Workspace and Microsoft Office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A bachelor’s degree or equivalent work experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional languages are welcome, as some territories may require them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What happens next&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; Submit your CV along with a short note telling us where you’re based and the type of territory or role you’re interested in. If a suitable Account Executive role opens, our Talent Acquisition&amp;nbsp; team will contact you. Our process typically includes a screening call, interviews with sales leadership and the team, and a role play.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A FEW REASONS TO WORK WITH US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our user community loves us and we love them. Come to work each day with a sense of purpose as we bring a more secure internet experience to everyone––from our friends and family to the world’s largest organisations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert in a growing market. You’ll get immersed in the prominent technology markets of security and open source software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and grow professionally. Embrace the opportunity to build up your demand generation and product-led growth expertise in a fast-growing startup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are dedicated to building a diverse and talented team. Work with motivated and supportive team members across the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Bitwarden is dedicated to building a diverse and talented team and welcomes applications from all backgrounds.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy:&lt;/em&gt; By submitting your CV, you agree that Bitwarden may keep your details, in line with our privacy policy (&lt;a href=&quot;https://bitwarden.com/privacy/&quot;&gt;https://bitwarden.com/privacy/&lt;/a&gt;), to contact you about future sales roles. You can ask us to delete your details at any time by emailing -----
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About&amp;nbsp;CoreView &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;CoreView is the global leader in Microsoft 365 (M365) tenant resilience, serving over 23 million users worldwide. We empower the world’s leading organizations to master the complexity of Microsoft M365.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Through robust security and precise governance, we help ensure that our client’s environments stay cyber-resilient and productive, no matter how complex they are.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our unified, cloud-native platform delivers powerful automation, rapid value, and end-to-end visibility across the entire M365 ecosystem. Backed by world-class support and a collaborative, innovative culture,&amp;nbsp;CoreView&amp;nbsp;is a place where your ideas matter, and your work truly&amp;nbsp;impacts&amp;nbsp;global enterprises.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Please provide your CV in English.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Applicants must have the legal right to work in the country where this role is based. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Unfortunately, we are unable to provide visa sponsorship or immigration support for this position.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please only apply if you speak EITHER &lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;French or German&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking a results-driven, hunter-minded &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Account Executive&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; to drive net-new revenue growth across &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Europe&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;. This role is focused on winning new Mid-Market &amp;amp; SMB customers across Europe depending on territory alignment and language skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will own the full new-logo sales cycle: proactively researching target accounts, engaging multiple stakeholders, building qualified pipeline, and driving opportunities from first outreach through to signed agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As an individual contributor, you will independently manage your territory and pipeline, working closely with internal pre-sales, marketing, partner, and customer-facing teams to position CoreView’s Microsoft 365 cyber resilience and management platform to enterprise customers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Job Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134245418&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134245529&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:299,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:299}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop and execute a strategic territory plan for your aligned territory to achieve and exceed quarterly and annual sales targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Identify, prospect, and qualify net-new enterprise opportunities through outbound prospecting, social selling, partner networking, events, and ABM campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Manage the full sales cycle from lead generation and qualification through discovery, proposal, negotiation, procurement, and close.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build strong, multi-threaded relationships with C-level executives, security leaders, IT decision-makers, digital workplace stakeholders, and technical influencers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Position CoreView’s value proposition around Microsoft 365 security, governance, cyber resilience, tenant management, automation, and operational efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Accurately forecast opportunities and maintain strong pipeline hygiene using CRM systems and CoreView sales best practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Apply structured sales methodologies, such as MEDDPICC, to qualify, progress, and close complex enterprise deals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with pre-sales, marketing, channel, customer success, and delivery teams to support customer engagement and successful handover.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Stay current on enterprise technology trends, cybersecurity priorities, Microsoft 365 developments, and key market drivers across Europe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Represent CoreView professionally in customer meetings, partner engagements, industry events, and regional campaigns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Job Requirements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;3+ years of experience in sales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;, ideally in cybersecurity, Microsoft 365, cloud security, identity, governance, or compliance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience selling to mid-market and/or SMB customers, and demonstrable readiness to manage a high-velocity sales territory.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A track record of winning new customers and consistently achieving or exceeding targets.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Experience engaging customers across Europe.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to build pipeline through outbound prospecting, account research, partner collaboration, and effective follow-up on inbound interest.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Confidence managing sales conversations with a range of stakeholders, including IT and security teams, business leaders, and decision-makers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Strong communication, discovery, presentation, negotiation, and relationship-building skills.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently in a remote-first environment and collaborate effectively with colleagues across global teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Good CRM discipline, accurate opportunity management, and reliable forecasting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Familiarity with MEDDPICC or another structured sales methodology is an advantage.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel across Europe for customer meetings, partner engagement, and company events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Fluent English is required; you must also speak &lt;strong&gt;EITHER&lt;/strong&gt; French or German&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;#LI-CW1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Coreview Values&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Ownership Mindset&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Take ownership. Drive outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;One Team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;One team, one goal, embracing diversity&amp;nbsp;-&amp;nbsp;to&amp;nbsp;achieve&amp;nbsp;more together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335557856&amp;quot;:16777215,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Velocity:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Decide fast. Deliver fast. Repeat.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Curiosity drives us. We challenge the status quo.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Customer First: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Listen deeply. Solve boldly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Resilience: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Steady under pressure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;CoreView is an organisation which values the strength that diversity brings to the workplace. As an employer, we seek to promote equal opportunity through affirmative action. All qualified applicants will therefore receive consideration for employment and will not be discriminated against based on gender/sex, race/ethnicity, disability, age or any other protected group status (such as protected veteran status) or characteristic that is protected by local legislation. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
