&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1640&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;MS or PhD in Statistics, Biostatistics, or a related field&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;There are no specific therapeutic area requirements; however, experience in Oncology, Rare Disease, or Neuroscience would be advantageous.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong oral and written communication skills, with the ability to effectively communicate internally and with clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated understanding and insight in statistics, drug development process, and relevant FDA regulations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot; data-start=&quot;1638&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Pharmaceutical, CRO, or related industry experience with clinical trials, including interaction with Regulatory Agencies, especially the FDA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.2;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: tahoma, arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Application Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
